export default {"← 返回数学手册":"← Back to the math handbook","与本次数学页面一起发布的源码快照。SHA-256:":"Source snapshot published with this handbook. SHA-256:","下载原始文件":"Download original file","版本指纹清单":"Version fingerprint manifest","LaTeX 已复制":"LaTeX copied","LaTeX 源码，可选择并复制":"LaTeX source; select and copy","请复制已选中的 LaTeX":"Copy the selected LaTeX","Zero to Hero · 12 lessons · 从零到实战 →":"Zero to Hero · 12 lessons · Start the guided course →","quad 外：不产生片元":"outside the quad: no fragment","alpha 低于阈值：丢弃":"alpha below threshold: discarded","alpha 上限生效":"alpha cap active","光滑区间":"smooth region","A：{a}；B：{b}。近→远顺序：{order}。":"A: {a}; B: {b}. Near-to-far order: {order}.","已更新 A 的 {parameter}：{old} → {next}；MSE {before} → {after}。":"Updated A’s {parameter}: {old} → {next}; MSE {before} → {after}.","这一步损失上升，固定步长不保证每个状态下降，可恢复后检查分支。":"Loss increased on this step. A fixed learning rate does not guarantee a decrease in every state; reset and inspect the branches.","已恢复初始两颗 Gaussian、时间和像素。":"Restored both initial Gaussians, time, and pixel.","原始 logit β / r5.x":"Raw logit β / r5.x","02 · 时间差 Δt":"02 · Time offset Δt","解码宽度 ρ = exp(ℓτ)":"Decoded width ρ = exp(ℓτ)","时间权重 w = exp(−(Δt/ρ)²)":"Temporal weight w = exp(−(Δt/ρ)²)","基础 opacity = sigmoid(β)":"Base opacity = sigmoid(β)","03 · 当前中心 μ(t)":"03 · Current center μ(t)","当前单位四元数 q(t) / wxyz":"Current unit quaternion q(t) / wxyz","空间尺度 exp(ℓ)":"Spatial scales exp(ℓ)","三条协方差轴（每行列出一条轴）":"Three covariance axes (one axis per row)","04 · 屏幕中心 μ₂D":"04 · Screen center μ₂D","投影 Jacobian J":"Projection Jacobian J","投影轴（每行列出一条轴）":"Projected axes (one axis per row)","06 · 像素偏移 d = p−μ₂D":"06 · Pixel offset d = p−μ₂D","椭圆局部坐标 local":"Ellipse-local coordinates","空间核 exp(−r²/2)":"Spatial kernel exp(−r²/2)","裁剪之前的 alpha":"Alpha before clipping","07 · 覆盖/阈值/上限之后的 alpha":"07 · Alpha after coverage / threshold / cap","08 · 到达本层前的 Ti":"08 · Incoming Ti","本层贡献 Ti × alpha × RGB":"Layer contribution Ti × alpha × RGB","09 · MSE 对 RGB 的导数":"09 · MSE derivative with respect to RGB","A 后面的尾部颜色 Bᵢ（含背景）":"Tail color Bᵢ after A (including background)","像素对 alpha 的导数 Ti(ci−Bi)":"Pixel derivative with respect to alpha Ti(ci−Bi)","loss 对 alpha 的导数（点积）":"Loss derivative with respect to alpha (dot product)","alpha 对所选参数：均值路径":"Alpha derivative for selected parameter: mean path","alpha 对所选参数：协方差路径":"Alpha derivative for selected parameter: covariance path","alpha 对所选参数：opacity 路径":"Alpha derivative for selected parameter: opacity path","三条路径相加":"Sum of all three paths","10 · 最终 dL/dθ":"10 · Final dL/dθ","当前 θ =":"Current θ =","若执行一步，θ − 0.5 × dL/dθ":"After one step, θ − 0.5 × dL/dθ","展开 01–08：从原始字段到像素，每个中间值":"Expand 01–08: every intermediate value, from raw fields to pixel","步骤 / 数学量":"Step / mathematical quantity","剩余透射率 = {value}，再乘背景并加到两层贡献上，得到上面的预测像素。":"Remaining transmittance = {value}. Multiply it by the background and add both layer contributions to obtain the predicted pixel above.","09–10 · 梯度怎样传回来":"09–10 · How gradients propagate backward","当前数值":"Current value","有限差分步长 h":"Finite-difference step h","两次前向求出的梯度":"Gradient from two forward evaluations","与解析值的绝对误差":"Absolute error against the analytic value","解析梯度来自":"The analytic gradient combines ","两条位置路径":"both position paths","与":" and ","遮挡梯度":"the occlusion gradient","；有限差分重新运行整个前向。若恰好跨越可见性边界，两者可能不一致，需单独检查分支。":". Finite differences rerun the entire forward pass. Crossing a visibility boundary can make them disagree; inspect those branches separately.","把这个基的 RGB 系数归零":"Zero this basis's RGB coefficients","R 通道":"R channel","可旋转的 R 通道方向球":"Rotatable R channel directional sphere","G 通道":"G channel","可旋转的 G 通道方向球":"Rotatable G channel directional sphere","B 通道":"B channel","可旋转的 B 通道方向球":"Rotatable B channel directional sphere","→ RGB 合成":"→ RGB combined","可旋转的 RGB 合成方向球":"Rotatable combined RGB directional sphere","把同一方向的 R、G、B 组成一个颜色":"Combine R, G, and B from the same direction into one color","球谐：给每个观察方向配一种颜色。":"Spherical harmonics: a color for every viewing direction.","先想象站在同一个 Gaussian 周围，从上、下、左、右看它。它的形状可以不变，颜色却可以随视角变化。SH 用一组固定的“方向图案”，加上每个 Gaussian 自己学到的混合系数，保存这种变化。":"Imagine viewing the same Gaussian from above, below, left, and right. Its shape can stay fixed while its color changes with your viewpoint. SH represents that change with fixed directional patterns and a set of mixture coefficients learned for each Gaussian.","先玩图案和颜色 →":"Explore patterns and colors →","再一步步推导 →":"Derive it step by step →","看低阶近似的极限 →":"See the limits of low degrees →","接到 Rust / WGSL →":"Connect to Rust / WGSL →","从真实 4D 场景选一颗 Gaussian，查看参数与 SH 实验 →":"Pick a Gaussian in the real 4D scene: parameters and SH experiment →","01 · 图案 Y":"01 · Pattern Y","像调音台里的固定音色。一个基函数输入方向，输出一个有正负的数；它本身不是 RGB。":"Like a fixed tone on a mixing console. A basis function takes a direction and returns a signed number; it is not RGB by itself.","02 · 系数 a":"02 · Coefficient a","像每个音色的音量旋钮。每个图案有 R、G、B 三个系数，允许为负；它们是训练要学的参数。":"Like a volume knob for each tone. Every pattern has three coefficients, R, G, and B. They may be negative; training learns them.","03 · 求和 c":"03 · Sum c","观察方向决定每个图案当前的数值。数值乘系数，再逐项相加，得到这颗 Gaussian 在这个视角下的颜色。":"The viewing direction selects a value from each pattern. Multiply each value by its coefficients and add the contributions to get this Gaussian's color from that view.","实验一 · 16 张图案，怎样调出颜色？":"Experiment 1 · How do 16 patterns make a color?","先点击一个小图案，再拖动它的 RGB 系数。橙色表示基函数为正，蓝色表示为负，灰色接近零。切换到“球面着色”时，球的半径完全不变；“瓣状图”才用离中心的距离表示绝对值。":"Click a small pattern, then adjust its RGB coefficients. Orange means a positive basis value, blue a negative value, and gray near zero. In sphere-color mode the radius stays fixed. In lobe mode the distance from the center encodes the absolute value.","图案显示":"Pattern display","瓣状图 · 半径 = |Y|":"Lobes · radius = |Y|","球面着色 · 固定半径":"Sphere colors · fixed radius","最高阶 L":"Maximum degree L","载入一个例子":"Load an example","混合：零阶到三阶":"Mixed: degrees 0–3","只有 DC：各方向同色":"DC only: identical in every direction","一阶：两侧不同色":"Degree 1: different colors on opposite sides","二阶：多一组明暗分区":"Degree 2: additional light and dark regions","手动调整":"Custom coefficients","选择球谐基 0":"Select SH basis 0","选择球谐基 1":"Select SH basis 1","选择球谐基 2":"Select SH basis 2","选择球谐基 3":"Select SH basis 3","选择球谐基 4":"Select SH basis 4","选择球谐基 5":"Select SH basis 5","选择球谐基 6":"Select SH basis 6","选择球谐基 7":"Select SH basis 7","选择球谐基 8":"Select SH basis 8","选择球谐基 9":"Select SH basis 9","选择球谐基 10":"Select SH basis 10","选择球谐基 11":"Select SH basis 11","选择球谐基 12":"Select SH basis 12","选择球谐基 13":"Select SH basis 13","选择球谐基 14":"Select SH basis 14","选择球谐基 15":"Select SH basis 15","正值 +":"Positive +","负值 −":"Negative −","每张图各自缩放以看清形状，不能用瓣的大小比较不同基函数的数值。":"Each plot is scaled independently for legibility; lobe sizes do not compare magnitudes across basis functions.","3D 观察视角":"3D viewing angle","重置视角":"Reset view","正面 −Y":"Front −Y","侧面 +X":"Side +X","顶部 +Z":"Top +Z","图示缩放":"Plot zoom","拖动基函数图或下方任一通道球，五张图会一起旋转。可观察背面、顶部与底部；聚焦图后也可用方向键旋转、+/− 缩放、Home 重置。":"Drag the basis plot or any channel sphere below to rotate all five plots together. Inspect the back, top, and underside; with a plot focused, use arrow keys to rotate, +/− to zoom, and Home to reset.","可旋转的三维球谐基；方向标记与数值见下方":"Rotatable 3D SH basis; direction marker and values are described below","01 · 一个方向图案，三个独立系数":"01 · One directional pattern, three separate coefficients","左图是选中的一个 Yₖ：橙色为正、蓝色为负，只用来标记数值的符号，与 RGB 通道无关。R、G、B 共用这个方向图案，但分别乘以自己的系数。":"The left plot is one selected Yₖ: orange is positive and blue is negative. Those colors label the sign of a number, not RGB channels. R, G, and B share this directional pattern but multiply it by their own coefficients.","在通道球旁编辑这个基的 RGB 系数 ↓":"Edit this basis's RGB coefficients beside the channel spheres ↓","02 · 三个通道分别求和，再组成 RGB":"02 · Sum each channel separately, then combine RGB","下面每颗球都累加当前最高阶以内的所有基函数。只改球下方的 R 系数：R 球和合成球会改变，G、B 球不变。选中一个基函数只是选择要编辑的系数，不会让其他项停止参与求和。":"Each sphere below sums every basis function up to the selected degree. Change only the R coefficient beneath the spheres: the R sphere and the combined sphere change, while G and B stay fixed. Selecting a basis chooses which coefficients to edit; it does not remove other terms from the sum.","单通道的显示方式":"Single-channel display","通道本色：红 / 绿 / 蓝":"Channel colors: red / green / blue","统一灰度：比较通道数值":"Shared grayscale: compare channel values","通道本色模式只亮起对应的分量，例如 R 球显示 (dR,0,0)。灰度模式把同一个值复制到三个分量，例如 (dR,dR,dR)，便于比较。所有通道共用固定 0–1 范围，不单独归一化，也不附加光照；RGB 合成球始终显示完整颜色。":"Channel-color mode lights only the corresponding component: the R sphere displays (dR,0,0). Grayscale copies that value into all three components, (dR,dR,dR), for comparison. All channels use the same fixed 0–1 range, with no per-channel normalization or added lighting; the RGB sphere always shows the full color.","方位角 φ：绕 z 轴":"Azimuth φ: around the z axis","极角 θ：从 +z 往下":"Polar angle θ: down from +z","方向取反 v → −v":"Reverse direction v → −v","球下方的读数对应同一个白色方向标记。SH 求和允许为负，加 0.5 是这里采用的 3DGS 约定；官方求值只截断负颜色，本页为屏幕显示再截断到 1。被截断后，系数继续变化也可能暂时看不出颜色变化。":"Readouts below the spheres refer to the same white direction marker. The SH sum may be negative; +0.5 follows the 3DGS convention used here. The official evaluator clamps negative colors only; this page additionally clips at 1 for screen display. After clipping, further coefficient changes may temporarily produce no visible color change.","这里旋转的是看图的视角：系数、输入方向 v 和颜色计算结果保持不变。正面、侧面、顶部表示图示相机位于 −Y、+X、+Z 轴；下方的 φ、θ 才会改变 SH 的求值方向。":"These controls rotate only the plot camera: coefficients, input direction v, and evaluated color stay fixed. Front, side, and top place the plot camera on the −Y, +X, and +Z axes. The φ and θ controls below change the SH evaluation direction.","白点代表当前输入方向；虚线圆代表它在背面。这里的坐标是“相机 → Gaussian”的单位向量，所以相机实际位于相反方向。图中的球与瓣都只是函数图，不是场景中的物体或 Gaussian 椭球。":"The white marker is the current input direction; a dashed ring means it is on the back. Coordinates use the unit vector from camera to Gaussian, so the camera itself is in the opposite direction. These spheres and lobes are plots of functions, not scene objects or Gaussian ellipsoids.","逐项核对：基函数 × 系数 = RGB 贡献":"Check every term: basis × coefficients = RGB contribution","当前 Y 值":"Current Y value","RGB 系数 a":"RGB coefficients a","RGB 贡献 aY":"RGB contribution aY","表格只累加最高阶以内的项。RGB 系数分别改变三个通道，基函数的方向图案对三个通道完全相同。":"The table sums only terms up to the selected degree. RGB coefficients control the three channels separately; all three channels use the same directional basis pattern.","照着做，立刻验证三个结论":"Try these three quick checks","载入“只有 DC”，拖动两个角度：颜色不变，因为常数不看方向。":"Load DC only and move both angles: the color stays fixed because a constant ignores direction.","把最高阶设为 1，选 k = 2，把 R 调到正数：+z 侧更红，−z 侧更少红。再让 R 变负，效果反过来。":"Set the maximum degree to 1, select k = 2, and make R positive: the +z side gains red and the −z side loses red. A negative R reverses the effect.","把最高阶设为 2，选 k = 6，点击“方向取反”：二阶 Y 值不变；改选 k = 2，同样操作，一阶 Y 值变号。":"Set the maximum degree to 2, select k = 6, and reverse the direction: its degree-2 value is unchanged. Select k = 2 and repeat: its degree-1 value changes sign.","从初中数学开始，推到能写进代码。":"Start with school mathematics. Finish with code.","不需要先背积分和导数。下面先用长度、面积、对称性解释它们；每一步再给精确公式。积分符号可以先读作“把整颗球上所有小块的结果加起来”。":"You do not need to memorize calculus first. We explain it through lengths, areas, and symmetry, then give the precise equations. Read an integral as “add the results from every small patch of the sphere.”","设 Gaussian 中心是 μ，相机是 C。用中心减相机，得到箭头 d。用勾股定理算长度，再把三个分量都除以长度。距离变短了，指向不变。相机与中心重合时长度为零，代码必须处理这个特殊情况。":"Let μ be the Gaussian center and C the camera. Subtract the camera position from the center to get d. Use Pythagoras to find its length, then divide every component by that length. This changes length, not direction. If the camera and center coincide, the length is zero and code must handle that case.","先减位置，再把长度变成 1":"Subtract positions, then make the length 1","θ 是从北极 +z 往下量的角度。直角三角形给出高度 z = cosθ，水平圈半径是 sinθ。再在水平圆内用 φ 分出 x 和 y。θ 不是从赤道量的纬度；代码中的 sin、cos 使用弧度。":"θ is measured down from the north pole, +z. A right triangle gives height z = cosθ and horizontal-circle radius sinθ. On that horizontal circle, φ splits the radius into x and y. θ is not latitude measured from the equator; code uses radians for sin and cos.","两个角度只是在描述同一个点":"Two angles describe the same point","01 · 方向：从一根箭头变成球上的一点":"01 · Direction: an arrow becomes a point on a sphere","两张图案如果总是一起变亮，就有重复信息。把对应位置的值相乘再相加，可以测这种重合。比如 [1,1,1] 和 [−1,0,1] 的乘积和是 0：后者的正负抵消，不能冒充前者的整体亮度。把三格换成整个球面，就是函数的内积。":"Patterns that always brighten together carry overlapping information. Multiply corresponding values and add them to measure that overlap. For [1,1,1] and [−1,0,1], the sum of products is zero: the second pattern cancels itself and cannot imitate uniform brightness. Replacing three entries with the whole sphere gives a function inner product.","先从三格表格的点积说起":"Start with the dot product of three entries","经纬图中同样宽的一格，在北极附近会缩小。纬圈半径是 sinθ，所以球面小块面积约等于“横向 sinθΔφ × 纵向 Δθ”。把格子越分越细，就得到 sinθ dθ dφ。单位球总面积是 4π。正交归一的意思是：不同图案的乘积和为 0，同一图案的平方和为 1。":"A fixed-width cell on a longitude–latitude map shrinks near a pole. The horizontal-circle radius is sinθ, so a patch has approximate area sinθΔφ × Δθ. Taking ever smaller cells gives sinθ dθ dφ. A unit sphere has total area 4π. Orthonormal means product-sum zero for different patterns and square-sum one for the same pattern.","球面上的小格子，面积并不都一样":"Small patches on a sphere do not all have the same area","02 · “不重复的图案”：加权求和与正交":"02 · Nonredundant patterns: weighted sums and orthogonality","把基函数设成常数 k。整球的平方和就是“面积 × k²”。让它等于 1，取正根，便得到 DC 常数。它不是拍脑袋调出来的亮度。":"Set the basis function to a constant k. Its square-sum over the sphere is area × k². Set that to one and take the positive root to get the DC constant. It is a normalization, not a hand-tuned brightness.","零阶：所有方向都一样":"Degree 0: the same in every direction","球的左右两半完全对称：x 的正负抵消，故它与常数正交；xy 也会在 x 取反时抵消，故 x 与 y 正交。三个方向地位相同，所以 x²、y²、z² 的球面积分相等。它们相加恒等于 1，因此每一个积分都是 4π/3。":"The two halves of a sphere are symmetric: positive and negative x cancel, making x orthogonal to a constant. Likewise, xy cancels when x is reversed, making x orthogonal to y. The axes are equivalent, so the integrals of x², y², and z² are equal. Their sum is always one, so each integral is 4π/3.","一阶：先拿 x、y、z 当三张图案":"Degree 1: use x, y, and z as three patterns","正交性并不会规定哪个图案必须取负号。这里采用 Graphdeco 3DGS 的实球谐约定：一阶按 −y、z、−x 排列。若只看形状忽略这些负号，读入同一份系数就会得到错误颜色。方向从 μ−C 改成 C−μ，也会把奇数阶翻转。":"Orthogonality does not force a particular sign for each pattern. We use Graphdeco 3DGS real SH: degree 1 is ordered −y, z, −x. Ignoring those signs changes the colors of an existing coefficient file. Replacing μ−C with C−μ also flips odd degrees.","正负号与排列：必须和模型文件一致":"Signs and ordering must match the model file","03 · 零阶与一阶：为什么是 0.282 和 0.489？":"03 · Degrees 0 and 1: why 0.282 and 0.489?","把 x、y、z 两两相乘，得到 x²、y²、z²、xy、yz、xz 六种。但 x²+y²+z²=1 已经是零阶常数。扣掉这个重复方向，剩下五种独立变化。注意“扣掉一个”是五维空间，不是随便删掉一个多项式。":"Pairwise products of x, y, and z give six terms: x², y², z², xy, yz, xz. But x²+y²+z²=1 already belongs to degree 0. Removing this redundant direction leaves five independent variations. This means a five-dimensional space, not arbitrarily deleting any polynomial.","六个二次项里，有一个其实是旧图案":"One of the six quadratic combinations repeats an old pattern","z² 从不为负，会夹带一层“整体亮度”。上一节算过 z² 在球上的平均值是 1/3，所以先减掉 1/3，再乘 3 去分母。这样正负面积抵消，保证不再重复 DC。x²−y² 也因为对称性而平均为零。":"Because z² is never negative, it contains uniform brightness. We found that its average over the sphere is 1/3. Subtract 1/3, then multiply by three to remove the fraction. Positive and negative contributions now cancel, so the pattern no longer duplicates DC. Symmetry also gives x²−y² zero mean.","为什么会出现 3z²−1？":"Why does 3z²−1 appear?","把球切成薄薄的水平带。在单位球上，每条带的面积是 2π × 高度差 Δz；纬圈变短与斜坡变陡刚好抵消。因此 z⁴ 的球面积分变成 2π 乘上 −1 到 1 的 z⁴ 面积。幂函数的面积规则是：指数加一，再除以新的指数。再展开 (x²+y²+z²)²，利用三轴对称，就能求交叉项。":"Cut the unit sphere into thin horizontal bands. Each has area 2π × height difference Δz: a shorter latitude circle and a steeper slope cancel exactly. The sphere integral of z⁴ becomes 2π times its area from −1 to 1. The power-area rule increases the exponent by one and divides by that new exponent. Expand (x²+y²+z²)² and use symmetry to find the cross terms.","先算两个面积和：z⁴ 与 x²y²":"Compute two area sums: z⁴ and x²y²","xy 的平方和已经有了。对 3z²−1 和 x²−y²，先展开平方，再代入刚才的面积和。每个图案乘上“平方和的倒数开根号”，就全部归一化。最后按约定给 yz、xz 加负号。":"We already know the square-sum of xy. For 3z²−1 and x²−y², expand each square and substitute the area sums above. Multiply every pattern by the reciprocal square root of its square-sum to normalize it. Finally use the chosen negative signs for yz and xz.","平方和变成 1，常数就自己出现了":"Make the square-sums one and the constants follow","04 · 二阶：从六个乘法式，得到五张新图案":"04 · Degree 2: six products become five new patterns","不是把任意多项式归一化就能叫标准球谐。三维齐次调和多项式限制在单位球上，才给出这一族图案。“齐次”指每项总次数相同；“调和”指三个二阶偏导数相加为零。二阶例子 2z²−x²−y² 的结果是 4−2−2=0。单位球上可把它写成 3z²−1，但检查调和性时应使用前面的三维多项式。":"Normalizing an arbitrary polynomial does not make it a standard spherical harmonic. This family comes from homogeneous harmonic polynomials in 3D restricted to the unit sphere. Homogeneous means all terms have the same total degree. Harmonic means the three second partial derivatives sum to zero. For 2z²−x²−y², that sum is 4−2−2=0. On the sphere it equals 3z²−1; test harmonicity using the original 3D polynomial.","“球谐”里的“谐”：一种特殊的多项式":"The harmonic in spherical harmonics: a special polynomial","Legendre 多项式提供不依赖方位角的那一个图案。下面是生成它的 Rodrigues 规则。d/dz 表示“求斜率”：zⁿ 的斜率是 nzⁿ⁻¹；连续做两次就是二阶导。按规则先展开、再逐项求导，不需要记住答案。":"Legendre polynomials provide the pattern with no azimuth dependence. The Rodrigues rule generates them. Here d/dz means “take the slope”: the slope of zⁿ is nzⁿ⁻¹. Doing this twice gives a second derivative. Expand first and differentiate term by term; there is no need to memorize the result.","先只沿南北变化：逐项算出 P₂ 与 P₃":"Start with north–south variation: calculate P₂ and P₃","对每个正整数 m，有一张 cos(mφ) 图和一张 sin(mφ) 图。m=0 只需一张，因为 sin0=0。关联 Legendre 函数把南北方向的形状补齐。这里的 (−1)ᵐ 是 Condon–Shortley 相位，必须和前面的一阶符号一致。阶乘 ! 就是从该整数一路乘到 1，0!=1。":"Each positive integer m gives a cos(mφ) pattern and a sin(mφ) pattern. For m=0, only one is needed because sin0=0. Associated Legendre functions supply the north–south shape. The factor (−1)ᵐ is the Condon–Shortley phase, consistent with our degree-1 signs. A factorial, !, multiplies integers down to one; 0!=1.","再加入绕圈变化：sin 与 cos 两个搭档":"Add variation around the sphere: sine and cosine pairs","以 ℓ=2、m=2 为例：P₂ 求两次导得到 3，所以 P₂²=3(1−z²)。再用 sin2φ=2sinφcosφ，以及 x=sinθcosφ、y=sinθsinφ，根号和三角函数会合并成 xy。代码使用这些化简后的多项式，所以渲染时不必再求阶乘、积分或三角函数。":"For ℓ=2 and m=2, differentiating P₂ twice gives 3, so P₂²=3(1−z²). Use sin2φ=2sinφcosφ with x=sinθcosφ and y=sinθsinφ. The factors collapse to xy. Rendering uses these simplified polynomials; it does not need factorials, integrals, or trigonometric functions for SH evaluation.","把通用规则亲手化成代码中的 xy":"Turn the general rule into the xy in code","m=0 给一张，m=1 到 ℓ 各给 sin、cos 两张，所以是 1+2ℓ。从零阶加到 L 阶，是连续奇数相加；正好拼成边长 L+1 的正方形。每个图案有三个颜色系数，所以 L=3 是 16 个 RGB 向量、48 个标量。":"There is one pattern at m=0 and a sine/cosine pair for each m from 1 to ℓ, giving 1+2ℓ. Summing degrees 0 through L adds consecutive odd numbers, which build a square of side L+1. Each pattern has three color coefficients, so L=3 uses 16 RGB vectors, or 48 scalars.","为何每阶 2ℓ+1 个，L=3 总共 16 个？":"Why 2ℓ+1 per degree and 16 through L=3?","05 · 更高阶：Legendre 规则从哪里接上来？":"05 · Higher degrees: how does the Legendre rule connect?","先看单个颜色通道 f。假设它能由这些基函数的和表达，等式两边都乘 Yⱼ，再对球面求和。因为不同图案乘积的积分全是 0，只有第 j 项留下，而且它的平方积分是 1。于是得到求系数的公式。若只保留有限阶，得到的是在整个球面上的最小平方误差近似。":"Consider one color channel f. If it can be expanded in the basis, multiply both sides by Yⱼ and integrate over the sphere. Every other pattern has zero product integral; only term j remains, with square integral one. This gives the coefficient formula. Keeping finitely many degrees gives a least-squares approximation over the whole sphere.","正交像一把筛子：只留下想要的那项":"Orthogonality acts as a sieve for one coefficient","用 N 个近似等面积分布的方向，每个代表球面面积 4π/N，就把积分变成普通循环。如果用等间隔的经纬网格，各点代表的面积不同，需要 sinθ 权重。下面的重建实验采用等面积高度带和黄金角方向，共 4096 个样本；它是数值积分近似，不是精确符号积分。":"Use N approximately equal-area directions, each representing area 4π/N, to turn the integral into an ordinary loop. A regularly spaced longitude–latitude grid needs sinθ weights because its cells have different areas. The reconstruction experiment below uses 4096 samples on equal-area height bands with golden-angle azimuths. This is numerical quadrature, not exact symbolic integration.","计算机怎样“把所有方向加起来”？":"How does a computer add up all directions?","取方向 v=(0,0,1)，使用一阶，红通道系数为 [0.4,0,0.6,0]。只有 DC 和 z 那项不为零。把它们乘系数、相加，再按 Graphdeco 的约定加 0.5。这说明系数既不是最终颜色，也不需要限制在 0 到 1。":"Take v=(0,0,1), degree 1, and red coefficients [0.4,0,0.6,0]. Only DC and the z term are nonzero. Multiply by coefficients, add, then apply Graphdeco's +0.5 convention. The coefficients are not final colors and need not lie between zero and one.","官方 CUDA 的这一阶段只截掉负值；高于 1 的值仍可能保留。实验的普通屏幕色块另外截到 0–1，属于显示步骤，不能和前面的 SH 求值混为一谈。":"At this stage the official CUDA implementation clamps only negative values; values above one may remain. The demo clips its screen swatches to 0–1 in a separate display step. That is distinct from evaluating SH.","算一个真实颜色：把四项全部代进去":"Calculate a color by substituting all four terms","06 · 从颜色求系数，再把系数还原成颜色":"06 · Find coefficients from colors, then reconstruct the colors","实验二 · 同一束“小亮斑”，低阶 SH 能记住多少？":"Experiment 2 · How much of a small bright spot can low-degree SH retain?","左边是人为定义的方向颜色函数，不是测量材质。右边用相同的投影系数逐级增加阶数。零阶只能记住平均色；一阶出现宽渐变；二、三阶逐渐聚拢。尖锐亮斑仍会被抹宽，附近还可能出现过冲和振铃。":"The left plot is a synthetic directional color function, not a measured material. The others use the same projected coefficients with increasing degree. Degree 0 stores only the mean; degree 1 gives a broad gradient; degrees 2 and 3 concentrate it. Sharp spots remain blurred and may produce overshoot or ringing nearby.","拖动任意一个球，五张图会同步旋转，便于从同一角度比较。只改变观察视角，拟合系数与整个球面上的 RMSE 不变。也支持方向键、+/− 和 Home。":"Drag any sphere to rotate all five together and compare them from the same angle. Only the viewing angle changes; fitted coefficients and full-sphere RMSE stay fixed. Arrow keys, +/−, and Home also work.","原始方向颜色亮斑":"Original directional color spot","目标颜色":"Target color","最高阶 0 的颜色重建":"Color reconstruction through degree 0","最高阶 1 的颜色重建":"Color reconstruction through degree 1","最高阶 2 的颜色重建":"Color reconstruction through degree 2","最高阶 3 的颜色重建":"Color reconstruction through degree 3","RMSE 使用另外 2048 个方向，比较“加 0.5 后、截断前”的重建 RGB 与目标 RGB。它不是图像 PSNR，也不是训练结果。彩色图只负责展示，显示截断会隐藏负值与过冲。低阶 SH 适合平滑方向变化，不能保证逼真地表示镜面尖峰；增加阶数也不会自动获得可重光照的材质。":"RMSE uses 2048 separate directions and compares reconstructed RGB after +0.5 but before clipping with target RGB. It is not image PSNR or a training result. Display clipping can hide negative values and overshoot. Low-degree SH suits smooth directional variation; it cannot reliably represent sharp specular peaks. Increasing the degree does not create a relightable material.","最后一公里 · 公式怎样走到 GS 训练和 wgpu？":"The final connection · From equations to GS training and wgpu","通常先为每个 Gaussian、每个相机求一次视角颜色，再让所有被它覆盖的像素使用同一个 RGB。像素之间变化的是高斯核权重与合成顺序，不必在每个 fragment 里重复算 16 项 SH。对动态场景，用当前时刻 μ(t) 算方向；即使系数没变，运动也可能改变观察方向与颜色。":"Typically, compute one view-dependent color per Gaussian per camera, then reuse that RGB for all pixels covered by the splat. Gaussian weights and compositing vary by pixel; there is no need to reevaluate 16 SH terms per fragment. For a dynamic scene, use μ(t) for the current time. Motion can change the viewing direction and color even when coefficients stay fixed.","可以直接检查的运行代码":"Runnable code you can inspect","本页实验直接调用 shBasis、sampleSH 与 projectColor。源码页按本次构建生成，可以从符号一路跟到每个中间量。sampleSH 保留了 raw、shifted、shaderColor、display 四层结果，便于定位“为什么颜色不一样”。":"This experiment directly calls shBasis, sampleSH, and projectColor. The source snapshot is generated with this build, so you can follow each symbol into the intermediate values. sampleSH keeps raw, shifted, shaderColor, and display separately to help diagnose color mismatches.","先固定一个方向，只动一个红通道系数 a。颜色对它是一条直线，斜率就是该方向的 Y 值。如果 Y=0，该方向对这个系数没有直接颜色梯度；要从其他方向获得信息。下面用半平方误差，让斜率可以直接看清。":"Fix the direction and change one red coefficient a. Color is a straight-line function of a, with slope equal to the basis value Y at that direction. If Y=0, this view supplies no direct color gradient for that coefficient; other directions are needed. A half-squared error makes the slope easy to see.","例如 Y=0.4886，预测红色 0.7，目标 0.8，梯度为 −0.04886。学习率 0.1 时，a 要增加 0.004886，颜色约增加 0.002387。预测向目标靠近，说明正负号合理。这是单通道、单方向、未触发 clamp 的局部例子。":"For Y=0.4886, predicted red 0.7, and target 0.8, the gradient is −0.04886. With learning rate 0.1, a increases by 0.004886 and color increases by about 0.002387. Moving toward the target checks the sign. This local example uses one channel and one direction with no active clamp.","真正的 GS 训练从渲染像素的损失反传，链条还要乘本层合成权重 Tᵢαᵢ，再把所有像素、相机的贡献加起来。下式假设只改 SH 系数、alpha 和顺序固定且颜色没有被下界截断。若 shifted 小于 0，官方 clamp 分支的颜色梯度为 0；恰好等于 0 的导数按实现约定。":"Real GS training backpropagates image loss, multiplying by this splat's compositing weight Tᵢαᵢ and summing over pixels and cameras. The expression below holds for SH coefficient changes with alpha and order fixed and the color unclamped. If shifted is below zero, the official clamp branch has zero color gradient; the derivative exactly at zero follows the implementation convention.","球面积分的投影只是本页的教学拟合方法。真实 GS 通常通过图像损失联合优化位置、尺度、不透明度和 SH 系数，训练视角也不一定均匀覆盖球面。因此不能把本页的积分循环当成完整 GS 训练器。":"Sphere projection is the educational fitting method used here. Actual GS typically optimizes positions, scales, opacities, and SH coefficients jointly through image loss, and training views may not cover the sphere uniformly. The integral loop here is not a complete GS trainer.","训练：怎么知道该拧哪一个系数？":"Training: how do we know which coefficient to turn?","L=3 的 16 个 RGB 系数在紧密排列的 float32 文件中占 16×3×4=192 字节。但 WGSL 的 array<vec3<f32>,16> 元素步长是 16 字节，占 256 字节。最容易核对的上传格式是 16 个 vec4，每个 w 填 0，Rust 对应 [[f32;4];16]。这是系数块，不含位置和其他参数；混合结构仍要单独核对每个字段的 offset。":"Sixteen RGB coefficients at L=3 occupy 16×3×4=192 bytes in a tightly packed float32 file. A WGSL array<vec3<f32>,16> has a 16-byte stride and occupies 256 bytes. A straightforward upload layout uses 16 vec4 values with w=0, corresponding to [[f32;4];16] in Rust. That is only the coefficient block; mixed structs still require checking every field offset.","还要核对：阶数是否表示“最高阶”还是“阶数数量”、RGB 通道排列、DC 与其余项的文件布局、基函数符号、方向朝向、是否已经加过 0.5、颜色空间与曝光。上面是接口示意，不是已经接入本项目的 SH shader。":"Also verify whether the degree field means maximum degree or number of degrees, RGB channel ordering, the file layout of DC and remaining terms, basis signs, direction orientation, whether +0.5 has already been applied, color space, and exposure. The snippet illustrates the interface; it is not an SH shader already integrated into this project.","当前 STG-Lite 的关键差别":"The key difference in the current STG-Lite renderer","本项目当前 f_dc_0..2 是直接 RGB，shader 再 clamp 到 0–1。它不是 Graphdeco 的 SH DC，不能直接套 RGB2SH 或加 0.5。未来接 SH 要扩展文件解码、GPU buffer 和着色器，并保留现有 RGB 路径的格式区分。SH 也不是所有 4DGS 方法都使用的外观模型；特征解码器是另一条路线。":"This project currently treats f_dc_0..2 as direct RGB, then clamps to 0–1 in the shader. Those values are not Graphdeco SH DC: do not apply RGB2SH or add 0.5 blindly. Integrating SH would require file decoding, GPU buffers, and shader changes, while retaining an explicit distinction from the existing RGB format. SH is not the appearance model of every 4DGS method; feature decoders are another approach.","存储与接口：Rust / WGSL 接入时核对什么？":"Storage and interfaces: what to verify in Rust / WGSL","以下均假设 x²+y²+z²=1，使用本页和 Graphdeco 相同的实球谐符号与索引。三阶公式里的 5z²−1 可以用 4z²−x²−y² 替换，5z²−3 可以用 2z²−3x²−3y² 替换；单位球上完全相等。":"All expressions assume x²+y²+z²=1 and use the real-SH signs and indices shared by this page and Graphdeco. At degree 3, 5z²−1 equals 4z²−x²−y², and 5z²−3 equals 2z²−3x²−3y² on the unit sphere.","查表：零阶到三阶的完整 16 项":"Reference: all 16 terms through degree 3","面试自测：一句话解释 SH 在 GS 里做什么？":"Interview check: what does SH do in GS, in one sentence?","对每个 Gaussian，SH 用一组固定的球面方向基和学习到的 RGB 系数表示随视角变化的颜色；渲染时将相机到中心的方向归一化，求基函数值并加权求和，再进入投影与 alpha 合成。它不直接改变 Gaussian 的位置或协方差，也不等价于可重光照的 BRDF。":"For each Gaussian, SH represents view-dependent color with fixed directional basis functions and learned RGB coefficients; rendering normalizes the camera-to-center direction, evaluates the basis, and sums weighted values before projection and alpha compositing. It does not directly change the Gaussian's position or covariance, and it is not a relightable BRDF.","推导与实现的一手依据":"Primary references for the derivation and implementation","球谐图案与颜色":"SH patterns and colors","图示视角：方位 {yaw}° · 仰角 {pitch}° · 缩放 {zoom}×":"Plot camera: azimuth {yaw}° · elevation {pitch}° · zoom {zoom}×","选中 k = {k} · ℓ = {l}, m = {m} · Y(v) = {value}":"Selected k = {k} · ℓ = {l}, m = {m} · Y(v) = {value}","编辑 k = {k} 的三个系数":"Edit the three coefficients of k = {k}","该项高于当前最高阶，保留系数但暂不参与颜色求和。":"This term is above the maximum degree. Its coefficients are retained but do not contribute to the color.","该项正在参与求和。试着只改变一个通道，再观察贡献表。":"This term is active. Try changing only one channel, then inspect the contribution table.","单位方向 v = {direction}；长度 = {length}":"Unit direction v = {direction}; length = {length}","L = {degree}：{count} 个共享基函数 × 3 个通道 = {total} 个独立系数。":"L = {degree}: {count} shared basis functions × 3 channels = {total} separate coefficients.","SH 求和 {raw}；加 0.5 → {shifted}；显示 → {display}":"SH sum {raw}; +0.5 → {shifted}; display → {display}","纯 SH 求和":"Raw SH sum","加 0.5 后":"After +0.5","仅下界 clamp":"Lower clamp only","屏幕显示 0–1":"Screen display 0–1","展开原有单像素实验与完整数值表":"Open the original single-pixel lab and full numeric tables","下一小步 →":"Next stage →","开始下一轮 →":"Start next iteration →","播放本轮":"Play this iteration","暂停":"Pause","全宽训练视图":"Expand training view","返回手册布局":"Return to handbook layout","第 {iteration} 轮 · 小步 {stage}/8 · {state}":"Iteration {iteration} · stage {stage}/8 · {state}","参数尚未更新":"Parameters not updated yet","本轮已更新一次":"This iteration was applied once","自动训练中；可随时暂停":"Training automatically; pause at any time","已暂停":"Paused","已达到 500 轮；重置可重新观察":"Reached 500 iterations; reset to start again","这一步损失上升，可回退或降低学习率。":"Loss rose on this step; go back or lower the learning rate.","第 3 小步显示屏幕椭圆":"Screen ellipses appear at stage 3","第 5 小步显示误差":"Errors appear at stage 5","像素 p = {pixel}，t = {time}":"Pixel p = {pixel}, t = {time}","A 的 Δt = {dt}；μ(t) = {mean}；基础 opacity = {opacity}":"A: Δt = {dt}; μ(t) = {mean}; base opacity = {opacity}","A 的屏幕中心 = {uv}；C = {covariance}":"A: screen center = {uv}; C = {covariance}","近→远 {order}；A 的 alpha = {alpha}，T = {transmittance}":"Near→far {order}; A: alpha = {alpha}, T = {transmittance}","预测 {prediction}；目标 {target}；本像素 MSE = {loss}":"Prediction {prediction}; target {target}; pixel MSE = {loss}","此像素更新前：∂Lₙ/∂α = {lossAlpha}；∂α/∂μ₀x = {alphaMean}；相乘 = {meanGradient}":"Before update, this pixel: ∂Lₙ/∂α = {lossAlpha}; ∂α/∂μ₀x = {alphaMean}; product = {meanGradient}","均值路径 {meanPath} + 协方差路径 {covariancePath} = {alphaMean}":"Center path {meanPath} + covariance path {covariancePath} = {alphaMean}","运动梯度再乘 Δt = {dt}；表格是全部 360 像素的平均，不是只用这个像素。":"Motion gradient also multiplies by Δt = {dt}; the table averages all 360 pixels, not just this pixel.","初始 {initial} → 当前 {current}；共 {count} 次更新":"Initial {initial} → current {current}; {count} updates","计算遇到问题；已暂停。请重置训练。":"Calculation failed; paused. Please reset training.","把训练慢放：从三帧图像到一次参数更新":"Training in slow motion: three frames, one parameter update","这是在浏览器里实际运行的双精度 CPU 教学训练器：2 颗 STG-Lite Gaussian、3 个时间、1 台相机。目标图固定，只优化 A 的位置 μ₀x、运动 m₁x 和不透明度 β；没有密度控制或完整场景重建。":"This is a real double-precision CPU teaching trainer in your browser: 2 STG-Lite Gaussians, 3 times, 1 camera. Targets are fixed. Only A’s position μ₀x, motion m₁x, and opacity β are optimized; it does not perform density control or full-scene reconstruction.","← 上一小步":"← Previous stage","训练 50 轮":"Train 50 iterations","重置训练":"Reset training","学习率 η":"Learning rate η","1. 读取训练样本":"1. Read the training batch","2. 把参数变成当前时刻的 Gaussian":"2. Evaluate the Gaussian at each time","3. 投影到屏幕":"3. Project onto the screen","4. 覆盖、排序、合成像素":"4. Cover, sort, and composite pixels","5. 计算误差":"5. Measure the error","6. 反向传播并累积梯度":"6. Backpropagate and accumulate gradients","7. 准备一次 SGD 更新":"7. Prepare one SGD update","8. 应用更新，再渲染核对":"8. Apply the update and render again","读取训练样本":"Read the training batch","目标是固定的三帧合成图，时间分别为 0.25、0.5、0.75。每帧取 12×10 个像素，三帧一起组成这次更新的 batch。迭代次数增加不会改变目标图。":"The targets are three fixed synthetic frames at times 0.25, 0.5, and 0.75. Each contributes a 12×10 pixel crop. All three frames form the batch for this update; targets stay fixed across iterations.","这一步的实际 JavaScript 源码":"Actual JavaScript for this stage","把参数变成当前时刻的 Gaussian":"Evaluate the Gaussian at each time","同一套参数生成三个时刻的形状。μ₀x 是基准位置，m₁x 是水平方向的一阶运动系数；β 经 sigmoid 变成基础不透明度。本实验只学习这三个参数，其他字段和 Gaussian B 固定。":"One parameter set generates all three times. μ₀x is the base position, m₁x is its linear horizontal motion, and sigmoid turns β into base opacity. Only these three parameters of A are learned; all other fields and Gaussian B stay fixed.","投影到屏幕":"Project onto the screen","位置经相机变换得到屏幕中心；协方差经 Jacobian 变成屏幕椭圆。中间图现在只画椭圆轮廓。这里的相机固定，学习者改变的是 Gaussian 参数。":"The camera maps the center to screen coordinates; the Jacobian maps covariance to a screen ellipse. The middle image now shows ellipse outlines. The camera is fixed: training changes Gaussian parameters.","覆盖、排序、合成像素":"Cover, sort, and composite pixels","先算原始 alpha，再设 0.99 上限；quad 外或 alpha 小于 1/255 的贡献归零。按近到远累积颜色，每层乘以前面剩余的透射率，最后加背景。预测图由当前参数真正计算出来。":"Compute raw alpha and cap it at 0.99; outside the quad or below 1/255, its contribution is zero. Accumulate front to back, weighting each layer by remaining transmittance, then add background. The prediction is actually rendered from current parameters.","计算误差":"Measure the error","逐像素、逐 RGB 通道比较预测和目标，再对全部 360 个像素取平均。右图亮的地方误差较大。点击任一图可以追踪一个像素，但不会改变训练 batch。":"Compare prediction with target in each RGB channel and average over all 360 pixels. Brighter regions on the right have larger errors. Click any image to inspect a pixel; the training batch stays unchanged.","反向传播并累积梯度":"Backpropagate and accumulate gradients","从误差倒着走：RGB → alpha → 位置或不透明度。位置还会通过投影 Jacobian 影响椭圆，因此需要两条路径。运动系数的梯度再乘 Δt；将所有像素、三个时间的贡献平均，得到下表的 batch 梯度。":"Follow the error backward: RGB → alpha → position or opacity. Position also changes the ellipse through the projection Jacobian, so both paths matter. The motion gradient includes Δt. Average contributions from every pixel and all three times to obtain the batch gradients below.","准备一次 SGD 更新":"Prepare one SGD update","此刻梯度已经算完，参数还没有修改。三个参数使用同一份旧参数求得的梯度，同时执行 θ−ηg。学习率越大，移动越远，但不保证损失下降。":"Gradients are ready, but parameters have not changed yet. All three updates use gradients from the same old parameter set and apply θ−ηg simultaneously. A larger learning rate moves farther and does not guarantee a lower loss.","应用更新，再渲染核对":"Apply the update and render again","参数在进入这一步时只更新一次。重新渲染同一批三帧，比较前后损失，向曲线追加一个实测点。上一小步会撤销这次更新，便于核对；下一轮重新计算梯度，不会复用旧梯度。":"Entering this step applies the update exactly once. Render the same three frames again, compare losses, and append one measured point to the curve. Going back undoes this update for inspection; the next iteration recomputes gradients.","查看哪一帧（全部三帧都参与训练）":"Inspect a frame (all three are trained)","追踪像素 0–119":"Inspect pixel 0–119","场景时间 t 选择画面；训练轮数记录参数更新了几次。":"Scene time t selects a frame; the iteration count tracks parameter updates.","固定目标":"Fixed target","固定目标，点击选择像素":"Fixed target; click to select a pixel","当前预测":"Current prediction","当前预测，点击选择像素":"Current prediction; click to select a pixel","逐像素误差":"Per-pixel error","逐像素误差，点击选择像素":"Per-pixel error; click to select a pixel","三图共享白色像素标记。误差图显示每像素 RGB 均方根误差，固定 0–0.25 映射为暗到亮，超过 0.25 饱和；下方数值始终是未缩放的 MSE。":"All images share the white pixel marker. Error brightness maps per-pixel RGB RMSE from 0 to 0.25, saturating above 0.25. Numeric MSE values below remain unscaled.","更新前 batch MSE":"Batch MSE before","更新后 batch MSE":"Batch MSE after","已完成参数更新":"Completed updates","参数":"Parameter","更新前 θ":"Before θ","batch 梯度 g":"Batch gradient g","改变量 −ηg":"Change −ηg","候选 θ − ηg":"Candidate θ − ηg","跟踪这一个像素":"Trace this pixel","实际 batch 损失（初始值 + 每次已完成更新）":"Measured batch loss (initial + each completed update)","训练损失曲线，数值摘要见下方":"Training loss curve; numeric summary below","与 PyTorch、真实训练和引擎的对应关系":"Connection to PyTorch, real training, and the engine","步骤 1–5 对应取 batch、render 和计算 loss；步骤 6 对应 loss.backward()；步骤 7–8 对应 optimizer.step() 和下一次前向。本页每轮重新累积梯度，等价于先清零；位置梯度包含中心与协方差两条路径。这里使用解析梯度与 SGD，下面链接的 PyTorch toy trainer 使用自动微分与 Adam。":"Stages 1–5 select the batch, render, and compute loss; stage 6 corresponds to loss.backward(); stages 7–8 to optimizer.step() and another forward pass. Gradients are accumulated afresh each iteration, equivalent to clearing them first. Position gradients include both center and covariance paths. This lab uses analytic gradients and SGD; the linked PyTorch toy trainer uses autograd and Adam.","可见性、alpha 阈值和排序有离散分支，梯度按当前分支计算；跨过边界或学习率过大时损失可能上升。单相机、少量参数的合成拟合不能证明真实多视角重建能力。RGB 在本 STG-Lite 格式中是直接颜色，当前实验不训练 SH。":"Visibility, alpha thresholds, and sorting contain discrete branches; gradients follow the current branch. Crossing a boundary or taking a large step can increase loss. A small single-camera synthetic fit does not establish real multi-view reconstruction quality. STG-Lite stores direct RGB here; this experiment does not train SH.","模型定义 → 坐标变换":"Model definition → coordinate transformation","为什么一团软椭球会写成“负的二次型的指数”？":"Why does a soft ellipsoid become the exponential of a negative quadratic form?","先只画一条数轴":"Start with a number line","中心 μ 决定最高点在哪里。尺度 s 决定多远算“远”。先减中心，再除尺度，得到没有单位的距离 z；这样厘米和米不会改变形状。":"The center μ locates the peak. The scale s determines what counts as far away. Subtract the center and divide by the scale to get a dimensionless distance z. Changing centimeters to meters then leaves the shape unchanged.","选择一个平滑的权重":"Choose a smooth weight","我们希望中心为 1、两侧对称、越远越小。exp(−z²/2) 满足这些要求。选 Gaussian 是建模选择，并非这些要求只允许这一种函数；1/2 是让 s 对应标准差的常用约定。":"We want a value of 1 at the center, symmetry on either side, and decreasing weight farther away. exp(−z²/2) has these properties. Choosing a Gaussian is a modeling decision: it is not the only possible function. The factor 1/2 is the convention that makes s the standard deviation.","把三条独立轴的权重相乘":"Multiply the weights along three independent axes","指数相乘就是指数相加。三维局部坐标 ξ 的每一维都按自己的尺度计量；等权重的位置形成椭球。":"Multiplying exponentials adds their exponents. Each local coordinate ξ is measured in its own scale. Positions with the same weight form an ellipsoid.","让椭球可以旋转和移动":"Allow the ellipsoid to rotate and move","世界偏移 d=x−μ。用逆旋转 Rᵀ 把它转回椭球自己的坐标，ξ=Rᵀd。把三个平方写成矩阵乘法，再把 ξ 代进去。":"The world-space offset is d=x−μ. The inverse rotation Rᵀ takes it into the ellipsoid’s own coordinates, ξ=Rᵀd. Write the three squared terms as a matrix product, then substitute ξ.","把中间那张表命名为逆协方差":"Name the middle matrix the inverse covariance","旋转的逆是转置，乘积求逆要倒序。因此括号中恰好是 Σ 的逆。这只是前面逐项平方相加的紧凑写法。":"The inverse of a rotation is its transpose, and inverting a product reverses its order. The middle matrix is therefore exactly Σ⁻¹. This is just a compact version of the sum of squared, scaled coordinates.","取 μ=0、R=I、尺度 (2,1,1)，点 (2,0,0) 刚好离中心一个“长轴尺度”。":"Let μ=0, R=I, and scales be (2,1,1). The point (2,0,0) is exactly one long-axis scale from the center.","GPU 最终评估的是投影后的二维核。local 已经完成“减中心、旋转、除尺度”；dot 就是平方相加。":"The GPU ultimately evaluates the projected 2D kernel. local already accounts for subtracting the center, rotating, and dividing by scale; dot adds the squared components.","r² ↔ dot(input.local,input.local)；G ↔ exp(power)":"r² ↔ dot(input.local,input.local); G ↔ exp(power)","这是峰值为 1 的核。概率密度还需要归一化常数，但这里的亮度由 opacity 控制，不能随手补那个常数。":"This kernel peaks at 1. A probability density also needs a normalization constant, but splat brightness is controlled by opacity. Do not add that constant without changing the rendering model.","点改成 (4,0,0)，权重是多少？":"What is the weight at (4,0,0)?","标准化距离变成 2，平方为 4；exp(−2)≈0.135335。":"The standardized distance is 2, so its square is 4. exp(−2)≈0.135335.","参数化选择 + 解方程":"Parameterization choice + solving an equation","训练得到任意实数，怎么保证尺度和 opacity 合法？":"How do arbitrary training parameters become valid scales and opacity?","给尺度一个总为正的出口":"Give scale an always-positive output","原始参数 ℓ 可以是负数；exp(ℓ) 总是正数。训练优化 ℓ，渲染再解码成尺度 s。":"The stored parameter ℓ may be negative, but exp(ℓ) is positive. Training optimizes ℓ; rendering decodes it into scale s.","把 opacity 变成胜算":"Express opacity as odds","先假设 0<o<1。比值 o/(1−o) 从 0 到无穷大；对它取 ln 后能覆盖所有实数，把这个数叫 logit β。":"Assume 0<o<1. The ratio o/(1−o) ranges from zero to infinity. Taking its logarithm covers every real number; call that number the logit β.","把 o 单独解出来":"Solve for o","两边乘 1−o，展开，再把含 o 的项移到同一侧，最后除以系数。":"Multiply by 1−o, expand, collect the terms containing o, and divide by their coefficient.","从文件到 GPU，只激活一次":"Activate once on each reading path","PLY 的 scale_*、opacity 保存原始值。CPU 为可见性判断解码；GPU 从同一份原始值解码用于绘制。它们是两条并行读取路线，不是把 CPU 已激活的值再激活一次。":"The PLY scale_* and opacity fields store raw parameters. The CPU decodes them for visibility checks; the GPU decodes the same raw values for drawing. These are parallel reads, not a second activation of the CPU’s decoded values.","保存 0.8 的 opacity 时应写 logit，而不是直接写 0.8。":"To store opacity 0.8, write its logit rather than the number 0.8.","r5.x 是 opacity logit；r5.yzw 是三个 log-scale。":"r5.x holds the opacity logit; r5.yzw holds the three log-scales.","β ↔ splat.r5.x；ℓ₁..₃ ↔ splat.r5.yzw":"β ↔ splat.r5.x; ℓ₁..₃ ↔ splat.r5.yzw","教学训练器直接导出 opacity logit 和 log-scale；RGB 在导出前先 sigmoid，和 opacity 不同。":"The teaching trainer exports raw opacity logits and log-scales. RGB is passed through sigmoid before export, unlike opacity.","opacity ↔ rows[:,20]；log-scale ↔ rows[:,21:24]":"opacity ↔ rows[:,20]; log-scale ↔ rows[:,21:24]","数学上 exp 总为正，浮点上仍会溢出或下溢。当前 loader 检查有限值；时间尺度另设最小值。":"Mathematically, exp is always positive. Floating-point arithmetic can still overflow or underflow. The loader checks finite values, and temporal width also has a lower bound.","scale_0=0 表示零尺寸吗？":"Does scale_0=0 mean zero size?","不是。exp(0)=1；它表示长度尺度 1。":"No. exp(0)=1, so it means a length scale of 1.","代数恒等式":"Algebraic identity","怎样从三条有方向的轴得到一张协方差表？":"How do three oriented axes become a covariance matrix?","从一个没有偏好的小球开始":"Start with an unbiased sphere","设局部随机向量 Z 的均值为 0，三维方差均为 1，互不相关。它的协方差就是 I。这里随机变量只是帮助描述形状，渲染时不需要随机采样。":"Let a local random vector Z have mean zero, variance one along each axis, and uncorrelated components. Its covariance is I. Random variables help describe the shape; rendering does not need to sample them.","先拉伸，再旋转，最后平移":"Stretch, rotate, then translate","S 是三个尺度组成的对角矩阵。X−μ=RSZ。把偏移和自己的转置相乘，再求平均；固定矩阵可移到平均之外。":"S is the diagonal matrix of scales. X−μ=RSZ. Multiply this offset by its transpose and take the average. Constant matrices can move outside the expectation.","把矩阵的列写出来":"Write the columns explicitly","A=RS 的第 k 列就是旋转的第 k 列乘尺度。矩阵乘法 AAᵀ 的每个元素是各列对应分量的乘积之和。":"The kth column of A=RS is the kth rotation column multiplied by its scale. Each entry of AAᵀ sums products of the corresponding components of these columns.","得到轴外积求和，也解释正定":"Recover the outer-product sum and positive definiteness","任意方向 v 的二次型是三个平方的和；三个正尺度对应可逆的 A，非零 v 不可能三个平方都为 0。":"The quadratic form along any direction v is a sum of three squares. With three positive scales, A is invertible: a nonzero v cannot make all three squares zero.","不旋转、尺度 (2,1,3)，三条轴分别为 (2,0,0)、(0,1,0)、(0,0,3)。":"With no rotation and scales (2,1,3), the axes are (2,0,0), (0,1,0), and (0,0,3).","axis0/1/2 是这三条缩放后的轴。投影后仍按同样的外积规则累加，只是向量从三维变成二维。":"axis0/1/2 are these three scaled axes. After projection, the same outer-product sum applies to 2D rather than 3D vectors.","a₁..₃ ↔ axis0/1/2":"a₁..₃ ↔ axis0/1/2","cov_a 是所有 x 分量平方之和；cov_b 是 xy 乘积之和；cov_c 是所有 y 分量平方之和。":"cov_a sums squared x components, cov_b sums xy products, and cov_c sums squared y components.","C₁₁,C₁₂,C₂₂ ↔ cov_a,cov_b,cov_c":"C₁₁,C₁₂,C₂₂ ↔ cov_a,cov_b,cov_c","协方差的单位是长度平方；尺度是长度。把 s 直接放到协方差对角线会把椭球画错。":"Covariance has units of length squared; scale has units of length. Putting s rather than s² on the covariance diagonal produces the wrong ellipsoid.","整体位置平移 10 米会改变 Σ 吗？":"Does translating everything by 10 meters change Σ?","不会。X 和 μ 一起平移，X−μ 不变。":"No. X and μ translate together, so X−μ is unchanged.","旋转的代数表示":"An algebraic representation of rotation","为什么四个数能变成 shader 里的九个旋转项？":"How do four numbers produce the nine rotation terms in the shader?","先约定四元数如何相乘":"First define quaternion multiplication","四元数记为 (w,v)，其中 v=(x,y,z)。下面的规则是定义。叉积 a×b 的三个分量依次为 (a₂b₃−a₃b₂,a₃b₁−a₁b₃,a₁b₂−a₂b₁)，可直接代数计算。":"Write a quaternion as (w,v), where v=(x,y,z). The rule below is the definition. The cross product a×b has components (a₂b₃−a₃b₂,a₃b₁−a₁b₃,a₁b₂−a₂b₁), so you can evaluate everything with ordinary arithmetic.","用单位四元数表示旋转":"Use a unit quaternion to represent rotation","令 w²+x²+y²+z²=1；逆四元数就是共轭 (w,−v)。把待旋转的点 p 装成 (0,p)，用 q(0,p)q⁻¹ 旋转。角度 θ、单位轴 n 对应 q=(cos(θ/2),n sin(θ/2))；这一步定义了它与几何旋转的联系。":"Require w²+x²+y²+z²=1. The inverse is its conjugate (w,−v). Embed a point p as (0,p), then rotate it with q(0,p)q⁻¹. Angle θ about unit axis n corresponds to q=(cos(θ/2),n sin(θ/2)); this defines the connection to geometric rotation.","再乘一次，把向量部分展开":"Multiply again and expand the vector part","用第一步的乘法规则，得到下式。第二行用叉积逐分量可验证的恒等式 (v×p)×v=||v||²p−(v·p)v；每一步只是乘法与合并同类项。":"Apply the multiplication rule from step 1. The second line uses (v×p)×v=||v||²p−(v·p)v, which can be checked component by component. Each step is multiplication followed by collecting like terms.","把三个坐标轴分别代进去":"Substitute each coordinate axis","p=e₁ 时 v×e₁=(0,z,−y)；p=e₂ 时为 (−z,0,x)；p=e₃ 时为 (y,−x,0)。这三次计算的结果就是旋转矩阵的三列。":"For p=e₁, v×e₁=(0,z,−y); for e₂ it is (−z,0,x); for e₃ it is (y,−x,0). The three resulting vectors are the columns of the rotation matrix.","用单位长度替换对角项":"Use unit length to simplify the diagonal","例如 w²+x²=1−y²−z²，因此第一个对角元素变成 1−2(y²+z²)。另外两个完全同理，得到上面的九项公式。":"For example, w²+x²=1−y²−z², so the first diagonal entry becomes 1−2(y²+z²). Simplify the other two in the same way to obtain the nine-term formula above.","绕 z 轴转 90°：q=(√2/2,0,0,√2/2)。第一条轴向上，第二条轴向左。":"For a 90° rotation about z, q=(√2/2,0,0,√2/2). The first axis points up and the second points left.","按本页的列向量约定，axis0 是 s₁Re₁，axis1 是 s₂Re₂，axis2 是 s₃Re₃。直接比较这三条轴，可避开 GLM 参考代码对矩阵命名的转置差异。":"With this page’s column-vector convention, axis0=s₁Re₁, axis1=s₂Re₂, and axis2=s₃Re₃. Comparing these vectors directly avoids the transposed matrix naming in the GLM reference.","q=(w,x,y,z) ↔ quaternion.xyzw；注意 quaternion.x 存 w":"q=(w,x,y,z) ↔ quaternion.xyzw; quaternion.x stores w","单位四元数才满足本页公式。q 和 −q 表示同一旋转，但任意翻转插值端点的符号可能改变插值路径。":"The formula assumes a unit quaternion. q and −q describe the same rotation, but arbitrarily flipping an interpolation endpoint can change the path.","q=(1,0,0,0) 得到什么？":"What does q=(1,0,0,0) produce?","三个轴原样输出，R=I。":"All three axes remain unchanged: R=I.","换坐标 + 解一次方程":"Changing coordinates + solving a linear equation","为什么相机位置不是文件中的平移 t？":"Why is the camera position different from the stored translation t?","先把相机搬到原点":"Move the camera to the origin","相机在世界中的位置为 Cw。一个点相对相机的位移是 xw−Cw，而不是 xw+Cw。":"The camera’s world-space position is Cw. A point’s displacement from the camera is xw−Cw, not xw+Cw.","再把世界方向转到相机方向":"Rotate world directions into camera directions","Rcw 把世界向量表示成相机坐标。展开括号，把不含 xw 的项叫 tcw。下标 cw 表示从 world 到 camera。":"Rcw expresses a world vector in camera coordinates. Expand the brackets and call the term independent of xw, tcw. The subscript cw means world to camera.","反解相机中心":"Solve for the camera center","两边左乘 Rcwᵀ，利用 RᵀR=I；或令相机中心在相机坐标中等于 0，都能得到同一结果。":"Left-multiply by Rcwᵀ and use RᵀR=I. Alternatively, set the camera-space coordinates of the camera center to zero; the answer is the same.","放入 GPU 使用的四维表格":"Put it into the GPU’s homogeneous matrix","点的末尾写 1，平移会生效；方向末尾写 0，平移不会生效。WebGPU 宿主使用相机前方 −Z、上方 +Y；本页手算使用前方 +Z、下方 +Y。两者的相机坐标可用 B=diag(1,−1,−1) 转换。":"Append 1 to a point so translation applies; append 0 to a direction so it does not. The WebGPU host uses forward −Z and up +Y. Our hand calculation uses forward +Z and down +Y. B=diag(1,−1,−1) converts between these camera coordinates.","无旋转，相机在 (2,0,0)，世界点在 (3,1,5)。":"With no rotation, let the camera be at (2,0,0) and a world point at (3,1,5).","宿主传入列主序的 view 和 projection。view_projection=projection*view；不能直接把 camera→world pose 当 view。":"The host supplies column-major view and projection matrices. view_projection=projection*view; a camera-to-world pose cannot be used directly as view.","R,t ↔ view 的左上 3×3 与平移列":"R,t ↔ the upper-left 3×3 block and translation column of view","教学训练器的相机旋转恒为 I，所以这里只减 cameras。这个简化不能替代任意相机外参。":"The teaching trainer fixes every camera rotation to I, so it only subtracts cameras. This simplification does not handle arbitrary extrinsics.","Cw ↔ cameras；xc ↔ xyz":"Cw ↔ cameras; xc ↔ xyz","内存列主序和几何使用列向量是两个概念；上传顺序、乘法次序、坐标轴必须一起核对。":"Column-major memory layout and column-vector geometry are different concepts. Check upload layout, multiplication order, and coordinate axes together.","相机向右移动 1，静止物体的相机 x 怎样变化？":"If the camera moves right by 1, what happens to a stationary object’s camera-space x?","无旋转时减小 1，所以屏幕上向左移。":"With no rotation, x decreases by 1, so the object moves left on screen.","相似三角形":"Similar triangles","三维点为什么要除以深度 z？":"Why does projecting a 3D point require division by depth z?","从侧面看两只相似三角形":"Look at two similar triangles from the side","一只三角形的横边为 x、纵边为 z；图像平面距离为 f，投影横边为 x′。相同射线给出相同的边长比。我们把成像平面放在前方，因此不用物理底片的倒像符号。":"One triangle has horizontal side x and depth z. The image plane is f away, and the projected horizontal side is x′. The same ray gives the same side ratio. We place a virtual image plane in front, avoiding the inverted-image sign of physical film.","从长度换成像素，再加主点":"Convert lengths to pixels and add the principal point","像素宽为 ax，焦距 f/ax 就是 fx。光轴打到图像上的位置是主点 cx，通常在图像附近中心，但不必恰好等于宽度的一半。":"If pixel width is ax, focal length in pixels is fx=f/ax. The optical axis meets the image at cx, usually near the center but not necessarily exactly half the image width.","用齐次坐标统一写法":"Write it using homogeneous coordinates","先乘内参矩阵 K，得到 (fx x+cx z, fy y+cy z,z)，再除以最后一项。乘法是线性的，最后这次除法是非线性的。":"First multiply by the intrinsic matrix K to get (fx x+cx z,fy y+cy z,z), then divide by the final component. The multiplication is linear; this final division is nonlinear.","对应屏幕像素中心":"Match pixel sample centers","像素索引是整数，但采样位置通常是整数加 0.5。图像宽高缩放时 fx、fy、cx、cy 也必须按相同坐标约定缩放。这里忽略镜头畸变。":"Pixel indices are integers, but samples usually lie at index+0.5. Resizing the image also requires scaling fx,fy,cx,cy under the same coordinate convention. Lens distortion is omitted here.","深度变成 20，x 和 y 不变：偏离主点的距离减半。":"Double depth to 20 while keeping x and y unchanged: the displacement from the principal point halves.","uv 的两项正是针孔公式。训练器用像素中心网格，和固定图形管线的采样位置衔接。":"The two entries of uv implement the pinhole formula. The trainer uses pixel-center samples to match the fixed graphics pipeline’s sampling convention.","fx=fy ↔ focal；cx ↔ width/2；cy ↔ height/2":"fx=fy ↔ focal; cx ↔ width/2; cy ↔ height/2","z≤0 的点不满足这套前向成像条件；近平面也需要处理。透视投影不是简单丢掉 z。":"Points with z≤0 do not satisfy this forward-camera model; near-plane handling is also necessary. Perspective projection is not simply dropping z.","fx 增加一倍，主点不变时会怎样？":"What happens if fx doubles while the principal point stays fixed?","所有点相对主点的横向距离增加一倍，看起来放大。":"Every horizontal displacement from the principal point doubles, producing horizontal magnification.","逐项求偏导":"Differentiate each input separately","把“移动一点点，会挪多少像素”写成一张表。":"Turn “a small motion changes how many pixels?” into a table.","只改 x，锁住 y 和 z":"Change only x; hold y and z fixed","将 x+h 代入 u，再减原来的 u，除以 h。cx 抵消，答案与 h 无关。v 不含 x，所以第二行这一项为 0。":"Substitute x+h into u, subtract the original u, and divide by h. cx cancels and the result is independent of h. v contains no x, so that entry in the second row is zero.","只改 y":"Change only y","同理，u 不含 y；v 的变化率为 fy/z。":"Similarly, u does not depend on y, while v changes at rate fy/z.","最容易漏掉的是深度":"Do not overlook depth","这次分母变了。先通分，再约掉 h，最后取 h 接近 0 的极限。不要把 z 当常数带进这一步。":"This time the denominator changes. Use a common denominator, cancel h, then take its limit toward zero. You cannot treat z as constant in this step.","把两组结果排成 2×3":"Arrange the results into a 2×3 matrix","第一行对应 u，第二行对应 v；三列依次对应 x,y,z。小位移 δx 经 J 变成像素位移，这只是中心附近的一阶近似。":"The first row belongs to u, the second to v; columns correspond to x,y,z. J maps a small 3D displacement to a pixel displacement. This is a first-order approximation around the center.","f=100、中心 (1,2,10)，只向右移动 0.01：屏幕约向右 0.1 像素。":"For f=100 and center (1,2,10), moving right by 0.01 moves the projection right by approximately 0.1 pixel.","torch.stack 的六项逐项对应这张表，reshape(...,2,3) 是把最后六个数排成两行。":"The six torch.stack entries match this matrix term by term. reshape(...,2,3) arranges those six numbers into two rows.","J ↔ jacobian；每个 batch、每个 Gaussian 各有一张表":"J ↔ jacobian; one matrix per batch item and Gaussian","J 的单位为像素/世界长度；f 是像素，z 是世界长度。它不是相机旋转矩阵。":"J has units of pixels per world length: f is in pixels and z is in world length. J is not the camera rotation matrix.","位于光轴 x=y=0 时，J 的第三列为什么全是 0？":"Why is the third column zero when x=y=0 on the optical axis?","沿光轴前后移动，投影中心仍是主点；但投影大小仍会变化。":"Moving along the optical axis leaves the projected center at the principal point, although the projected size still changes.","从平均值定义证明":"Proof from the definition of an average","为什么一个线性变换要在协方差左右各乘一次？":"Why does covariance need the linear transform on both sides?","写出新均值":"Find the new mean","Y=AX+b；平均可以分配到加法，也可以把不变的 A、b 提到外面。有限样本时逐项求和就能验证。":"Y=AX+b. An average distributes over addition, and constant A and b can move outside it. For finite samples, verify this by writing out the sum.","新样本减去新均值":"Subtract the new mean from each new sample","同一个平移 b 被减掉了。协方差描述相对中心的形状，所以不关心中心平移到哪里。":"The same translation b cancels. Covariance describes shape relative to the center, so it does not depend on where that center moves.","按定义做外积，再求平均":"Take the outer product and then its expectation","转置会倒转乘法顺序，所以右侧出现 Aᵀ 而不是 A。把固定矩阵移到期望号外面，内部就是原协方差。":"Transposition reverses multiplication order, giving Aᵀ on the right. Move the constant matrices outside the expectation; what remains is the original covariance.","把矩阵语言翻回标量":"Translate the matrix expression back into scalars","第 i、j 个输出的共同变化来自所有输入分量对的贡献。下面就是上一行的逐项展开，不是另加的一条定理。":"The joint variation of output components i and j adds contributions from every pair of input components. This is the preceding matrix equation written entry by entry, not an extra theorem.","X 的二维协方差为 diag(1,4)，x 放大两倍、y 缩小一半。":"Let the 2D covariance of X be diag(1,4), stretch x by 2, and shrink y by half.","教学例子 Σ=0.12²I，因此 JΣJᵀ 可简化成 0.12²*(J@Jᵀ)。任意各向异性 Σ 不能这样简化。":"The teaching example has Σ=0.12²I, so JΣJᵀ simplifies to 0.12²*(J@Jᵀ). You cannot make this simplification for an arbitrary anisotropic Σ.","A ↔ jacobian；@ ↔ 矩阵乘法；transpose(-1,-2) ↔ 转置最后两个维度":"A ↔ jacobian; @ ↔ matrix multiplication; transpose(-1,-2) ↔ transpose the final two dimensions","只有固定线性或仿射变换才精确。透视除法不是线性变换，下一式要先近似。":"This identity is exact for a fixed linear or affine transform. Perspective division is nonlinear, so the next formula needs an approximation first.","一维尺度放大 3 倍，方差放大几倍？":"If a 1D length scale triples, how much does the variance grow?","9 倍，因为偏移先乘 3，再平方。":"By 9: deviations are multiplied by 3 before being squared.","一阶近似 + 线性恒等式":"First-order approximation + linear identity","为什么 GS 屏幕椭圆是 J R Σ Rᵀ Jᵀ？":"Why is the GS screen ellipse described by J R Σ Rᵀ Jᵀ?","先把中心和形状都转到相机坐标":"Transform both center and shape into camera coordinates","中心需要旋转加平移，形状只需要旋转。使用上一节的协方差恒等式。":"The center needs rotation and translation; shape needs only rotation. Apply the covariance identity from the previous formula.","用中心附近的切线替代弯曲投影":"Replace curved projection locally with its tangent","导数告诉我们很小的变化怎样传播。把三维点 X 写成中心加偏移；对每个输出保留一次变化，丢掉二次及更高阶变化。":"A derivative describes how a very small change propagates. Write a 3D point as center plus offset, keep the first-order change in each output, and omit second-order and higher terms.","平移项不改变方差":"The translation term does not change variance","在线性近似里，π(μc) 是常数，J 是在中心算好的固定矩阵。因此屏幕形状用 JΣcJᵀ。再加 εI 表示额外的各向同性屏幕方差。":"In the linear approximation, π(μc) is constant and J is the fixed matrix evaluated at the center. Screen covariance is JΣcJᵀ. Adding εI supplies extra isotropic screen-space variance.","把矩阵乘法改写成三个小向量":"Rewrite the matrix product using three small vectors","若 Σ=∑ak akᵀ，令 dk=JRcw ak。分配乘法后，C 等于三条投影轴的外积之和。这正是 shader 的计算路线。":"If Σ=∑ak akᵀ, define dk=JRcw ak. Distributing the products gives a sum of three projected-axis outer products. This is the shader’s computation.","检查近似的边界":"Check the approximation’s limits","当 Gaussian 的深度厚度相对中心深度很大，或靠近相机时，J 在整团内变化明显，一阶椭圆近似会变差。加 0.3 是过滤策略，不是透视几何必然出现的常数。":"When a Gaussian is thick in depth relative to its center depth, or is near the camera, J varies substantially across it and the approximation becomes less accurate. Adding 0.3 is a filtering choice, not a constant required by perspective geometry.","用前面的 J 和 Σc=diag(1,4,9)，分别投影长度为 1、2、3 的轴，再累加。":"Use the previous J and Σc=diag(1,4,9): project axes of lengths 1,2,3 separately, then add their outer products.","shader 保留 cov_a、cov_b、cov_c 三个独立元素，没有先分配一个 3×3 矩阵。":"The shader keeps the three independent entries cov_a,cov_b,cov_c rather than first allocating a 3×3 covariance matrix.","dk ↔ d0,d1,d2；ε ↔ +0.3":"dk ↔ d0,d1,d2; ε ↔ +0.3","屏幕上“标准差增加 0.3”和“方差增加 0.3”完全不同。当前实现是后者，也没有配套做积分能量补偿。":"Adding 0.3 to standard deviation is different from adding 0.3 to variance. This implementation adds variance and does not apply an associated integral-energy compensation.","为什么主点 cx、cy 不出现在 C 里？":"Why do cx and cy not appear in C?","它们只平移投影中心，求导后为 0，不改变局部形状。":"They only translate the projected center. Their derivatives are zero, so they do not affect local shape.","分式通分 → 方向导数":"Common denominators → directional derivative","WGSL 没写 fx/z，怎样确认它算的仍是同一个 Jacobian？":"WGSL does not explicitly write fx/z. How can we verify that it computes the same Jacobian?","给中心和方向加上不同的末位":"Append different final coordinates to the center and direction","中心 h=PV[μ,1]；轴方向 δh=PV[a,0]。沿轴走一个小量 η 后，clip 坐标就是 h+ηδh，因为矩阵乘法是线性的。":"The center is h=PV[μ,1]; an axis direction is δh=PV[a,0]. Moving a small amount η along that axis gives h+ηδh in clip coordinates because matrix multiplication is linear.","先相减再通分":"Subtract and use a common denominator","分子里的 hx hw 抵消；剩下两项都含 η，和差商分母中的 η 约掉。":"The hx hw terms cancel. Both remaining terms contain η, which cancels the η in the difference quotient.","把 η 缩到 0，y 同理":"Let η approach zero; repeat for y","这里需要 hw 非零。把 x、y 两个结果拼成向量，就是 shader 的分子与分母。":"This requires nonzero hw. Combining the x and y results gives the shader’s vector numerator and denominator.","从 NDC 换到像素":"Convert NDC displacement into pixels","NDC 横向从 −1 到 +1 跨 2 个单位，对应宽度 W，故乘 W/2。WebGPU 屏幕原点在左上，实际向下的像素 y 要乘 −H/2；shader 采用向上的内部屏幕坐标，乘 +H/2。两种坐标用 F 翻转转换，整个椭圆和偏移一起翻转，二次型不变。":"NDC spans −1 to +1 horizontally, or 2 units across width W, so multiply by W/2. With WebGPU’s top-left screen origin, downward pixel y uses −H/2. The shader instead uses an internal upward screen coordinate and +H/2. Reflect the entire ellipse and offset using F; the quadratic distance is unchanged.","顶点回到 clip 坐标时为什么又乘 w":"Why multiply by w when returning a vertex to clip space?","想让透视除法后的 NDC 多 δn，就在 clip.xy 里加 δn·hw；除以 hw 后恰好剩 δn。中心 w 对四个角相同，local 的透视插值在这张 billboard 内也就是线性插值。":"To add δn after perspective division, add δn·hw to clip.xy first. Dividing by hw then leaves δn. All four billboard corners share center w, so perspective interpolation of local on this billboard is linear.","hx=2、hw=4、δhx=1、δhw=0.5、W=800。":"Let hx=2, hw=4, δhx=1, δhw=0.5, and W=800.","公式的每一项在 projected_axis 中都有同名值。max(w²,1e−8) 是数值保护，中心背面的剔除另由 CPU 完成。":"Every term appears by name in projected_axis. max(w²,1e−8) is a numerical guard; the CPU separately rejects centers behind the camera.","h ↔ center_clip；δh ↔ axis_clip":"h ↔ center_clip; δh ↔ axis_clip","pixel_offset 先变成 ndc_offset，再乘 center_clip.w 加回 clip.xy。":"pixel_offset becomes ndc_offset, which is multiplied by center_clip.w before being added to clip.xy.","δn ↔ ndc_offset":"δn ↔ ndc_offset","符号不能一半使用向下的像素坐标，一半使用向上的投影轴。坐标换基需要同时作用于中心、偏移、协方差。":"Do not mix downward pixel coordinates with upward projected axes halfway through the calculation. A basis change must act consistently on center, offset, and covariance.","轴的齐次末位为什么是 0？":"Why is the homogeneous coordinate of an axis 0?","它是方向，不是点。末位为 0 才不会把相机平移重复加进轴向量。":"It is a direction, not a point. The zero prevents camera translation from being added to the axis.","解两组二元一次方程":"Solve two pairs of linear equations","不背口诀，也能得到 2×2 逆矩阵。":"Derive a 2×2 inverse without memorizing a shortcut.","把逆矩阵的第一列设成未知数":"Treat the first inverse column as two unknowns","C 乘逆矩阵的第一列应得到 (1,0)。这就是两条一次方程。":"C times the first column of its inverse must be (1,0). This gives two linear equations.","消元解出第一列":"Eliminate one unknown","第一式乘 c，第二式乘 b，相减得到 (ac−b²)u=c。类似消掉 u 可解出 v。令 D=ac−b²。":"Multiply the first equation by c and the second by b, then subtract to get (ac−b²)u=c. Eliminate u similarly to solve for v. Call ac−b², D.","解第二列，再拼回去":"Solve the second column and assemble the matrix","右侧换成 (0,1)，同样消元得到 (−b/D,a/D)。现在把两列排在一起，就得到 Q。":"Replace the right-hand side with (0,1). The same elimination gives (−b/D,a/D). Put the two columns together to obtain Q.","为什么要求正定":"Understand the positive-definite condition","把 ax²+2bxy+cy² 配方；要让任何非零方向都为正，需要 a>0 且 c−b²/a>0，也就是 D>0。":"Complete the square in ax²+2bxy+cy². For a positive value in every nonzero direction, we need a>0 and c−b²/a>0, equivalently D>0.","C=[[4,1],[1,2]]，D=8−1=7。":"For C=[[4,1],[1,2]], D=8−1=7.","PyTorch 使用 linalg.inv 显式求逆；GPU 通过特征轴局部坐标得到相同距离，下一节解释这条连接。":"PyTorch explicitly inverts covariance with linalg.inv. The GPU obtains the equivalent distance in eigen-axis local coordinates, explained next.","Q ↔ inverse；D ↔ det(C)":"Q ↔ inverse; D ↔ det(C)","D 很小时数值误差会被除法放大。不是任何三个数 a,b,c 都能作为有效椭圆。":"A small D amplifies numerical error through division. Arbitrary a,b,c values do not necessarily describe a valid ellipse.","C=diag(4,9) 的逆是什么？":"What is the inverse of C=diag(4,9)?","Q=diag(1/4,1/9)，不是 diag(−4,−9)。":"Q=diag(1/4,1/9), not diag(−4,−9).","椭圆换坐标的等价式":"Equivalent ellipse coordinate systems","CPU 的 dᵀQd 怎样变成 WGSL 的 dot(local,local)？":"How does CPU dᵀQd become WGSL dot(local,local)?","把像素改写为离中心的偏移":"Express a pixel relative to the center","像素位置 p 与投影中心必须用同一个屏幕坐标系。离中心远近不能直接用世界距离。":"Pixel p and projected center must use the same screen coordinate system. World distance is not a substitute for screen distance.","先把矩阵乘法完全展开":"Expand the matrix multiplication completely","Q 对称，所以中间两项相同，可以合并为 2Q12 dxdy；不是只剩一项。":"Because Q is symmetric, the two mixed terms are equal and combine into 2Q12 dxdy; neither contribution can be omitted.","在椭圆自己的两条主轴上计量":"Measure along the ellipse’s own principal axes","C=U diag(λ₁,λ₂)Uᵀ，U 的列是互相垂直的单位轴。先用 Uᵀ 转到主轴坐标，再除以标准差 √λ；得到 local。":"Write C=U diag(λ₁,λ₂)Uᵀ, with perpendicular unit axes as U’s columns. First rotate with Uᵀ, then divide by standard deviations √λ to obtain local.","让两个三角形替我们插值 local":"Let two triangles interpolate local for us","顶点放在主轴各 ±3σ 的矩形角上，并赋 local=corner×3。光栅化后，每个片元收到自己的连续局部坐标，所以直接 dot(local,local) 就能得到 r²。":"Place vertices at the corners of the rectangle extending ±3σ along each principal axis, and assign local=corner×3. Each fragment receives its continuous local coordinates, so dot(local,local) gives r² directly.","再把实际分支写清楚":"Include the actual branches","shader 把 alpha 截到 0.99，低于 1/255 时丢弃；矩形外没有片元。只有未触发轴长度限幅时，这个 local 才精确对应原始 C。":"The shader caps alpha at 0.99 and discards values below 1/255. No fragments exist outside the rectangle. local corresponds exactly to the original C only when axis-length limits are inactive.","C=diag(4,1)，像素偏移 (2,1)，o=0.8。":"Take C=diag(4,1), pixel offset (2,1), and o=0.8.","这里没有 inv(C)，因为逆变换已经隐含在顶点给出的 local 和片元插值中。":"There is no inv(C) here: the inverse transformation is implicit in the vertex local coordinates and their interpolation.","local ↔ l；power ↔ −r²/2":"local ↔ l; power ↔ −r²/2","major_axis、minor_axis 构成 U，sigma_major/minor 是 √λ。":"major_axis and minor_axis form U; sigma_major/minor are √λ.","corner*3 ↔ 顶点处 l":"corner*3 ↔ l at each vertex","local 不是 UV 纹理坐标，也不是世界坐标。它的单位是标准差，中心为 0。":"local is neither texture UV nor world coordinates. It measures distance in standard-deviation units, with zero at the center.","local=(0,0) 时 alpha 一定等于 1 吗？":"Must alpha equal 1 at local=(0,0)?","不一定。空间核为 1，但仍要乘时间权重和基础 opacity，并受 0.99 上限限制。":"No. The spatial kernel is 1, but it is still multiplied by temporal weight and base opacity, then capped at 0.99.","二次方程 + 换坐标":"Quadratic equation + coordinate transformation","从 a,b,c 求出椭圆的长短轴。":"Recover the ellipse’s major and minor axes from a,b,c.","寻找变换后方向不变的向量":"Find a vector whose direction survives the transform","若 Cv=λv，v 的方向不变，只拉伸 λ 倍；这就是特征向量和特征值的定义。把右侧移到左侧。":"If Cv=λv, v keeps its direction and is scaled by λ. This defines an eigenvector and eigenvalue. Move the right side to the left.","什么时候有非零的解":"Determine when a nonzero solution exists","两条方程必须不独立，否则只能 v=0；二维时条件就是行列式为 0。展开后得到普通二次方程。":"The two equations must not be independent, or v=0 is the only solution. In 2D this requires determinant zero. Expanding gives an ordinary quadratic equation.","使用配方法求根":"Solve by completing the square","把上一式的 s=a+c、p=ac−b² 代入基础课求根公式。判别式化简为 (a−c)²+4b²。":"Substitute s=a+c and p=ac−b² into the quadratic formula from the foundations. The discriminant simplifies to (a−c)²+4b².","解出方向并归一化":"Solve for a direction and normalize it","第一行是 (a−λ)vx+bvy=0，取 (vx,vy)=(b,λ−a) 恰好满足。除以长度得到单位轴；另一轴垂直于它。b=0 时按 a、c 的大小选坐标轴。":"The first row is (a−λ)vx+bvy=0, satisfied by (vx,vy)=(b,λ−a). Divide by its length for a unit axis; the other axis is perpendicular. If b=0, select a coordinate axis according to a and c.","方差开平方才是长度":"Take the square root of variance to get length","在特征轴坐标中二次型是 ξ₁²/λ₁+ξ₂²/λ₂。令它等于 k²，就得到椭圆半轴长度 k√λ。":"In the eigenbasis the quadratic form is ξ₁²/λ₁+ξ₂²/λ₂. Setting it to k² gives semiaxis lengths k√λ.","C=[[4,1],[1,2]]；λ±=3±√2。":"For C=[[4,1],[1,2]], λ±=3±√2.","discriminant、lambda_major/minor 按这一求根式计算。GPU 还把 λ 下限设为 0.1、σ 上限设为 192 像素，属于实现保护。":"discriminant and lambda_major/minor implement this quadratic solution. The GPU also floors λ at 0.1 and caps σ at 192 pixels as implementation guards.","λ± ↔ lambda_major/minor；u± ↔ major_axis/minor_axis":"λ± ↔ lambda_major/minor; u± ↔ major_axis/minor_axis","若 C=aI，两条轴一样长，任何正交方向都成立。此时不要归一化零向量 (b,λ−a)。":"If C=aI, both axes have equal length and any orthonormal directions work. Do not normalize the zero vector (b,λ−a).","C=diag(9,4)，3σ 椭圆半轴多长？":"For C=diag(9,4), how long are the 3σ semiaxes?","9 和 6 像素：先开平方得到 3、2，再乘 3。":"9 and 6 pixels: take square roots to get 3 and 2, then multiply by 3.","解指数不等式":"Solve an exponential inequality","alpha 小到可以忽略时，到底能截掉多远？":"How far can we truncate weights below the alpha threshold?","写出保留像素的条件":"Write the condition for retaining a pixel","设阈值 αmin>0，先忽略 clamp。o 是当前时间的峰值 opacity，r² 非负。":"Let αmin>0, initially ignoring the cap. o is peak opacity at the current time, and r² is nonnegative.","先检查有没有解":"First check whether any solution exists","核的最大值为 1，因此若 o<αmin，连中心都达不到阈值，整个 Gaussian 可跳过。否则除以正数 o。":"The kernel is at most 1. If o<αmin, even the center is below threshold and the entire Gaussian can be skipped. Otherwise divide by the positive value o.","取对数，再乘负数":"Take logarithms, then multiply by a negative number","ln 单调递增，不等号不变；乘 −2 时不等号要反向。":"ln is increasing, so it preserves the inequality. Multiplying by −2 reverses the inequality.","区分理论支持域和实际矩形":"Distinguish theoretical support from the actual rectangle","精确阈值边界在 local 空间是半径 rmax 的圆，回到屏幕是椭圆。当前 shader 画的是每个主轴 ±3σ 的矩形，再在片元里按 alpha 丢弃，因此两者并不相等。":"The exact threshold boundary is a circle of radius rmax in local coordinates, or an ellipse on screen. The shader draws a rectangle extending ±3σ along each principal axis, then discards fragments by alpha. These supports are not identical.","轴向 local=(3.1,0) 的 alpha 仍超过阈值，但超出当前 ±3 的 quad，没有片元；这显示真实的截断近似。":"At local=(3.1,0), alpha is still above threshold, but the point lies outside the ±3 quad and produces no fragment. This exposes the actual truncation approximation.","corner×3 确定实际几何覆盖范围；它不是上述阈值公式的计算结果。":"corner×3 defines the geometric coverage; it is not computed from the threshold equation above.","±3σ ↔ pixel_offset 中的 3.0":"±3σ ↔ the 3.0 in pixel_offset","alpha 低于阈值后 discard，两个判断共同决定最终覆盖。":"Discarding alpha below threshold further restricts coverage. Both decisions determine what is finally drawn.","αmin ↔ 0.0039215686":"αmin ↔ 0.0039215686","“3σ 包含所有有效像素”不成立。大 opacity 下仍可能裁掉高于阈值的尾部。":"“3σ contains every relevant pixel” is false. With sufficiently high opacity, it cuts off tails still above threshold.","o 正好等于 αmin 时，数学上哪里还能保留？":"If o equals αmin exactly, which points pass the mathematical threshold?","只有 r=0 的中心；实际像素网格可能没有采样点正好落在中心。":"Only the center r=0; the pixel grid may contain no sample exactly at that center.","剩余比例的连乘":"Multiply the remaining fractions","光到达第 i 层时，还剩下多少？":"How much remains when light reaches layer i?","把每层理解为覆盖一部分的薄片":"Think of each layer as a partially covering sheet","alpha 为 0.2，就有 20% 被这层覆盖，80% 继续往后。先用这个透明合成模型建立直觉，它不要求场景真的是玻璃。":"An alpha of 0.2 means this layer covers 20%, leaving 80% to continue. This transparency model builds intuition; the actual scene need not consist of glass.","下一层只作用于上一层剩下的部分":"Apply the next layer only to what remains","若第二层也覆盖 20%，它覆盖的不是原始光的 20%，而是剩余 80% 的 20%。":"If layer 2 also covers 20%, it takes 20% of the remaining 80%, not 20% of the original amount.","重复这一规则":"Repeat the rule","到达第 i 层之前已经穿过 i−1 层；∏ 是把这些剩余比例全部相乘。":"Before layer i, we have passed through i−1 layers. The ∏ symbol multiplies all their remaining fractions.","解释训练代码为什么先补一个 1":"Why does the training code prepend a 1?","cumprod 得到前缀连乘。需要的是当前层之前的连乘，因此数组前面补 1，再丢掉最后一项。":"cumprod computes prefix products. We need the product before the current layer, so prepend 1 and remove the final entry.","两层 alpha 都是 0.5，第二层得到的光为 0.5，背景得到 0.25。":"With two alphas of 0.5, layer 2 receives 0.5 and the background receives 0.25.","先近后远排列 alpha，沿 Gaussian 维度 cumprod；[:, :-1] 取到当前层之前的透射率。":"Sort alpha near to far, then take cumprod along the Gaussian dimension. [:, :-1] selects transmittance before each current layer.","Ti ↔ transmittance；dim=1 ↔ Gaussian 维":"Ti ↔ transmittance; dim=1 ↔ Gaussian dimension","Ti 不含当前层 alpha；否则会把当前层遮挡自己一次。":"Ti does not include the current layer’s alpha. Including it would make the layer occlude itself again.","若第一层 alpha=1，后面的 Ti 是多少？":"If the first alpha is 1, what are all subsequent Ti values?","全部为 0；当前 shader 把单层 alpha 限到 0.99，因此实际不会由单层直接得到精确的 0。":"They are zero. The shader caps individual alpha at 0.99, so one layer alone never produces an exact zero in practice.","加权相加 + 望远镜求和":"Weighted sum + telescoping sum","每层与背景怎样一起组成最终像素？":"How do layers and background form the final pixel?","先看一层和背景":"Begin with one layer and a background","当前层占 alpha，其余部分透出背景。RGB 三个通道分别做同样的运算。":"The current layer contributes alpha of its color; the remaining fraction reveals the background. Apply the same operation independently to RGB.","把背景换成后面的一整幅合成结果":"Replace the background with the composited tail","两层时先用第二层和背景合成 B1，再把 B1 放到第一层后面。展开括号。":"For two layers, first composite layer 2 with the background to form B1. Place B1 behind layer 1 and expand the brackets.","推广到 N 层":"Generalize to N layers","第 i 层之前必须穿过前 i−1 层，所以颜色权重为 Ti αi；背景的权重是穿过全部层的 TN+1。":"Reaching layer i requires passing through the previous i−1 layers, giving color weight Ti αi. Background weight is TN+1, the fraction passing through all layers.","用权重和检查有没有漏项":"Check the sum of weights for missing terms","Ti αi=Ti−Ti+1；求和时中间项抵消，只剩 1−TN+1。加上背景正好为 1。":"Ti αi=Ti−Ti+1. The intermediate terms cancel in the sum, leaving 1−TN+1. Add the background weight to obtain exactly 1.","红在前、蓝在后，两层 alpha=0.5，黑色背景。":"Red in front, blue behind, both alphas 0.5, and a black background.","代码对 T*alpha*color 沿 Gaussian 维求和，背景为黑，所以省略了数值为 0 的背景项。":"The code sums T*alpha*color along the Gaussian dimension. The background is black, so its zero contribution is omitted.","C ↔ return；N ↔ 张量 dim=1":"C ↔ return value; N ↔ tensor dimension 1","交换层次会改变颜色。中心深度排序只是该实现的近似；相交的大 Gaussian 不保证每个像素的遮挡都准确。":"Changing layer order changes color. Center-depth sorting is an implementation approximation; intersecting large Gaussians may not have correct per-pixel occlusion.","为什么权重不一定加起来等于 1？":"Why might the weights appear not to sum to 1?","如果只看 Gaussian 权重，和为 1−剩余透射率；把背景权重加进去才等于 1。":"Gaussian weights alone sum to 1−remaining transmittance. Include the background weight to obtain 1.","同一合成式的 GPU 写法":"The same composition written for GPU blending","为什么 fragment 输出 RGB×alpha，混合状态却用 One？":"Why output RGB×alpha while using One as the source blend factor?","定义预乘颜色":"Define premultiplied color","把颜色与它的覆盖率先乘好，记作 c̃。这样透明黑和普通黑在存储时也有一致的含义。":"Multiply color by coverage in advance and call the result c̃. This gives transparent and opaque color storage a consistent interpretation.","把后面已经画好的结果当 destination":"Treat the already-rendered tail as destination","远处先画，当前较近的一层为 source。它留下自己的预乘颜色，并遮掉 destination 的 alpha 比例。":"Draw distant layers first. The current nearer layer is the source: it contributes its premultiplied color and hides an alpha fraction of the destination.","映射到固定混合硬件的两个乘数":"Map the equation to the hardware’s two factors","硬件计算 src×srcFactor + dst×dstFactor。于是 srcFactor=One，dstFactor=OneMinusSrcAlpha。alpha 通道也按 over 规则累积。":"Hardware computes src×srcFactor + dst×dstFactor. Set srcFactor=One and dstFactor=OneMinusSrcAlpha. The alpha channel also follows the over rule.","与近到远公式核对":"Cross-check the near-to-far formula","先画远处蓝，再画近处红；展开正好得到上一式的红 0.5、蓝 0.25。顺序不同，代数结果一致。":"Draw distant blue first, then nearer red. Expanding gives red 0.5 and blue 0.25, just as before. Different evaluation order, same algebraic result.","若 shader 已输出红色 (0.5,0,0)，却又配置 SrcAlpha=0.5，会错误地再乘一次。":"If the shader already outputs red (0.5,0,0), using SrcAlpha=0.5 multiplies it a second time incorrectly.","返回值 vec4(rgb*alpha,alpha) 明确是预乘。":"Returning vec4(rgb*alpha,alpha) explicitly produces premultiplied output.","c̃s ↔ input.color_opacity.rgb*alpha":"c̃s ↔ input.color_opacity.rgb*alpha","PREMULTIPLIED_ALPHA_BLENDING 与这份输出匹配；StgPass 按远到近排序，透明 splat 不写深度。":"PREMULTIPLIED_ALPHA_BLENDING matches that output. StgPass sorts far to near, and transparent splats do not write depth.","over ↔ blend state；顺序 ↔ sort_unstable_by":"over ↔ blend state; order ↔ sort_unstable_by","透明混合一般要禁用 Gaussian 自身的深度写入。与不透明场景的深度测试是另一个独立开关。":"Gaussian depth writes should generally be disabled for transparent composition. Testing against opaque-scene depth is a separate decision.","预乘颜色仍要乘 Ti 吗？":"Does premultiplied color still need Ti?","逐层 GPU over 已经隐式完成遮挡；若在手写近到远累积器里，则仍需乘到达该层的 Ti。":"Sequential hardware over already implements occlusion implicitly. A handwritten near-to-far accumulator still needs to multiply by the incoming Ti.","薄层极限，非精确 GS 射线积分":"Thin-layer limit; not exact GS ray integration","连续密度为什么会产生指数透射率？":"Why does continuous density produce exponential transmittance?","把一段路切成 N 个薄层":"Divide a path into N thin layers","密度 σ 表示单位长度上的消光强度；薄层厚 Δs 足够小时，透过比例约为 1−σΔs。把总长度 l 平分。":"Density σ is extinction strength per unit length. For sufficiently small Δs, the transmitted fraction is approximately 1−σΔs. Split total length l equally.","让薄层越来越薄":"Make the layers progressively thinner","基础极限 (1+a/N)ᴺ→eᵃ，取 a=−σl。常密度下就得到指数透过率；被覆盖比例是 1−T。":"Use (1+a/N)ᴺ→eᵃ with a=−σl. Constant density gives exponential transmittance; the covered fraction is 1−T.","密度沿路径变化时分别连乘":"Multiply separate factors for varying density","取对数把乘法变加法，利用 ln(1−ε)≈−ε，再把细分求和变成积分。":"Take logarithms to turn products into sums. Use ln(1−ε)≈−ε, then take the limit of the finely subdivided sum to obtain an integral.","回到离散渲染的每一段":"Return to discrete rendering segments","每段内部假定密度固定，就用该段长度 Δsi 得到 alpha。相邻段按剩余比例相乘，因此和前面的合成模型接上。":"Assume constant density within each segment and use its length Δsi to obtain alpha. Remaining fractions multiply between segments, connecting to the previous composition model.","σ=2 /米，一段长 0.5 米，乘积 σΔs 没有单位。":"Let σ=2 per meter and segment length be 0.5 meter. The product σΔs is dimensionless.","对照源码可见，当前 renderer 直接计算 opacity*投影 Gaussian 核，没有沿每条光线积分 σ。这里只解释透明合成与体渲染的关系。":"The renderer computes opacity times a projected Gaussian kernel; it does not integrate σ along each ray. This formula only explains the relation between transparent composition and volume rendering.","本式 σ、Δs：当前 STG-Lite shader 没有对应字段":"σ and Δs have no corresponding fields in the current STG-Lite shader","不能把 learned opacity 当作物理消光密度 σ；两者参数、单位和积分过程不同。":"Learned opacity is not physical extinction density σ. Their parameters, units, and integration procedures differ.","若把一段恒密度路程平分两半，总透过率会变吗？":"Does splitting a constant-density segment in half change total transmittance?","不会。e^(−σl/2)×e^(−σl/2)=e^(−σl)。":"No. e^(−σl/2)×e^(−σl/2)=e^(−σl).","单位换算":"Unit conversion","视频的秒、帧号、模型时间如何对齐？":"How do video seconds, frame indices, and model time line up?","先确定时间起点和尺度":"Choose a time origin and scale","物理时刻 s 减去起点 s0，得到经过的秒数；除以 D 秒，得到无单位的模型时间 t。D 必须来自训练约定。":"Subtract origin s0 from physical time s to get elapsed seconds, then divide by D seconds for dimensionless model time t. D must follow the training convention.","再对齐每个 Gaussian 自己的中心时刻":"Align with each Gaussian’s own center time","τ 是该 Gaussian 最活跃的模型时间。运动系数围绕 τ 展开，所以实际使用 Δt=t−τ。":"τ is the model time at which that Gaussian is most active. Motion coefficients are expanded around τ, so evaluation uses Δt=t−τ.","帧号需要匹配分母约定":"Match the frame-index denominator","若训练器定义 t=j/N，帧率为 fps，则 s−s0=j/fps，与 D=N/fps 对齐；最后一帧 t=(N−1)/N，不等于 1。若定义 j/(N−1)，D 则不同。":"If training uses t=j/N at frame rate fps, then s−s0=j/fps and D=N/fps. The final frame has t=(N−1)/N, not 1. Using j/(N−1) instead requires a different D.","沿代码找到时间只被换算一次":"Find where time is converted in the code","浏览器 baseline 的 10 秒循环是播放约定，不能据此认定数据真实时长为 10 秒。原生 StgPass 直接接收 normalized_time，不做秒数推断。":"The browser baseline’s 10-second loop is a playback convention, not evidence that the capture lasted 10 seconds. Native StgPass accepts normalized_time directly and does not infer seconds.","若有 100 帧、25fps，并采用 j/N，第 50 帧的模型时间为 0.5。":"With 100 frames at 25fps and the j/N convention, frame 50 has model time 0.5.","当前 LOOP_SECONDS=10，用 rem_euclid 后除以它；这只描述播放器速度。":"The current LOOP_SECONDS is 10. Playback uses rem_euclid and divides by this value; this only specifies playback speed.","s ↔ time_seconds；D ↔ LOOP_SECONDS":"s ↔ time_seconds; D ↔ LOOP_SECONDS","原生接入显式传归一化时间；prepare 检查 0..1。":"Native integration supplies normalized time explicitly; prepare checks the range 0..1.","t ↔ normalized_time → camera.scene.x":"t ↔ normalized_time → camera.scene.x","PLY 的 32 个浮点字段没有 fps 和 capture duration，不能只看模型文件猜秒数。":"The 32-float PLY contains neither fps nor capture duration. Do not infer physical seconds from the model alone.","同一个模型以两倍播放速度播放，运动系数需要改吗？":"Must motion coefficients change to play the same model at double speed?","不需要；改变输入 t 随真实时间推进的速度即可。若重新定义模型时间坐标本身，则系数必须换算。":"No. Change how quickly input t advances with real time. If redefining the model-time coordinate itself, however, convert the coefficients accordingly.","时间核的模型选择":"Choice of temporal kernel","为什么有的时间 Gaussian 指数没有 1/2？":"Why does this temporal Gaussian omit the factor 1/2?","定义到活跃时刻的相对距离":"Define distance from the active time","Δt=t−τ；ρ 是宽度。先除以宽度再平方，时间单位约掉。STG-Lite 采用 exp(−距离²) 作为可见性包络。":"Δt=t−τ and ρ controls width. Divide by width and square so time units cancel. STG-Lite chooses exp(−distance²) as its visibility envelope.","用 log-width 保证宽度为正":"Guarantee positive width with log-width","PLY 保存 ℓτ，不是 ρ 本身。与空间 log-scale 类似，先 exp 解码。官方论文用另一种系数 sτ 乘在平方前，二者可直接换算。":"PLY stores ℓτ rather than ρ. Decode with exp, as for spatial scale. The paper writes a different coefficient sτ before the squared offset; the two forms convert directly.","和标准 Gaussian 的宽度比较":"Compare with a standard Gaussian","两个指数表示相同曲线时，平方项系数必须相等。注意这里的 ρ 不等于标准差 σt。":"To describe the same curve, the coefficients of the squared offset must match. In this parameterization, ρ is not the standard deviation σt.","把基础不透明度乘上时间权重":"Multiply base opacity by temporal weight","基础 opacity 表示最高可见程度；时间核只把它衰减。在中心时刻 w=1，离开中心一倍 ρ 时 w=e⁻¹。":"Base opacity gives the peak visibility, and the temporal kernel attenuates it. At the center w=1; one width ρ away, w=e⁻¹.","τ=0.5，ρ=0.25，t=0.75，β=0。":"Let τ=0.5, ρ=0.25, t=0.75, and β=0.","注意 temporal_opacity 的指数没有 0.5；fragment 的空间 power 才有 −0.5。":"temporal_opacity has no 0.5 in its exponent. The fragment shader’s spatial power is the one that includes −0.5.","ρ ↔ temporal_scale；w ↔ temporal_opacity；o(t) ↔ opacity":"ρ ↔ temporal_scale; w ↔ temporal_opacity; o(t) ↔ opacity","两个指数的 1/2 不能为了统一外观而互相抄。时间宽度字段也不是训练录像的总时长。":"Do not copy the 1/2 from one exponent to the other for visual consistency. Temporal width is not the total recording duration.","把 ρ 加倍，在同样 Δt 下指数平方项变成几分之一？":"If ρ doubles at the same Δt, what happens to the squared term in the exponent?","四分之一；时间包络因此变宽。":"It becomes one quarter as large, making the temporal envelope wider.","多项式模型":"Polynomial model","把随时间移动的中心拆成可存储的系数。":"Represent a moving center with a small set of stored coefficients.","从静止模型开始":"Start with a stationary model","如果只保存 μ0，任意时刻位置都相同。这里 μ0 表示 t=τ 时的中心，并非一定是视频第一帧的位置。":"If we store only μ0, position never changes. Here μ0 is the center at t=τ, which need not be the first video frame.","加上一次运动":"Add linear motion","每经过一个模型时间单位，增加 m1。三维中每个系数都是 x、y、z 三个数。":"Each model-time unit adds m1. In 3D, each coefficient contains three numbers for x,y,z.","加上弯曲和更灵活的变化":"Add curvature and more flexible changes","二次项让速度随时间变，三次项让加速度随时间变。这是有限阶模型选择；不要求真实运动必然是三次曲线。":"The quadratic term makes velocity vary; the cubic term makes acceleration vary. This is a finite-order modeling choice, not a claim that real motion must be cubic.","逐坐标代数计算":"Evaluate each coordinate with ordinary arithmetic","对 x 分量先平方、立方，再乘各自系数，最后相加；y、z 一样。三次轨迹也可用 Horner 顺序少做乘法，但当前 shader 直接算 dt2 方便复用。":"For x, square and cube Δt, multiply by each coefficient, and add. Repeat for y and z. Horner evaluation can reduce multiplications, but the current shader computes dt2 directly for reuse.","μ0=(1,2,10)，m1=(2,0,0)，m2=(0,4,0)，m3=(0,0,8)，Δt=0.5。":"Take μ0=(1,2,10), m1=(2,0,0), m2=(0,4,0), m3=(0,0,8), and Δt=0.5.","9 个 motion 浮点跨越 vec4 边界，所以 quadratic 和 cubic 要重新拼接。":"The nine motion floats cross vec4 boundaries, so quadratic and cubic vectors must be reconstructed.","m1 ↔ r2.xyz；m2 ↔ (r2.w,r3.x,r3.y)；m3 ↔ (r3.z,r3.w,r4.x)":"m1 ↔ r2.xyz; m2 ↔ (r2.w,r3.x,r3.y); m3 ↔ (r3.z,r3.w,r4.x)","CPU 使用同一轨迹来剔除和排序；GPU 使用它来摆放 quad，两边必须一致。":"The CPU uses the same trajectory for culling and sorting, while the GPU uses it to place the quad. Both evaluations must agree.","μ(t) ↔ position / center":"μ(t) ↔ position / center","m2 不是加速度本身，m3 也不是三阶导数本身；还差求导产生的倍数。":"m2 is not acceleration itself, and m3 is not the third derivative itself. Differentiation introduces additional factors.","Δt=0 时 motion 再大，中心是什么？":"At Δt=0, where is the center even if motion coefficients are large?","仍是 μ0，因为所有非零阶项都乘了 0。":"It is still μ0 because every higher-order term is multiplied by zero.","多项式求导 + 单位换算":"Polynomial differentiation + units","运动系数和实际速度、加速度差在哪？":"How do stored coefficients differ from physical velocity and acceleration?","从差商验证平方、立方规则":"Verify square and cube rules using difference quotients","基础课已经用展开证明：t² 的导数是 2t，t³ 是 3t²。τ 固定时，Δt 对 t 的导数为 1。":"The foundations expanded the differences to show that the derivatives of t² and t³ are 2t and 3t². With fixed τ, the derivative of Δt with respect to t is 1.","每一项分别求导后相加":"Differentiate each term and add","μ0 是常数，导数为 0；向量系数不变，对每个分量独立做相同运算。":"μ0 is constant, so its derivative is zero. Vector coefficients remain fixed; apply the same operation independently to each component.","再求一次导数":"Differentiate once more","在中心时刻 Δt=0，加速度为 2m2；三阶导数为 6m3。因此若从速度、加速度、jerk 写 Taylor 系数，会出现 1/2 和 1/6。":"At Δt=0, acceleration is 2m2; the third derivative is 6m3. Taylor coefficients written from velocity, acceleration, and jerk therefore include 1/2 and 1/6.","从模型时间换成秒":"Convert model time to seconds","t=(s−s0)/D，因此 dt/ds=1/D。链式法则告诉我们速度除以 D；加速度除以 D²。":"Since t=(s−s0)/D, dt/ds=1/D. The chain rule divides velocity by D and acceleration by D².","上一例 Δt=0.5，模型时间速度为 (2,4,6)。若 D=10 秒且空间是米：":"At Δt=0.5 in the previous example, model-time velocity is (2,4,6). If D=10 seconds and space is measured in meters:","renderer 只求位置，没有显式求 velocity。需要运动矢量或诊断速度时，应从这些 motion 字段按本式计算；不要声称当前 pass 已输出速度。":"The renderer evaluates position, not an explicit velocity output. Derive diagnostic velocity or motion vectors from these motion fields; the current pass does not already output them.","导数来源 ↔ motion_linear/quadratic/cubic":"Derivative inputs ↔ motion_linear/quadratic/cubic","空间单位不明确时只能说“世界单位/秒”，不能直接说米/秒。":"Without a documented spatial unit, say world units per second rather than meters per second.","D 加倍、模型不变，同一归一化时刻的物理速度怎样变？":"If D doubles with the model unchanged, what happens to physical velocity at the same normalized time?","减半。":"It halves.","四维系数模型 + 归一化":"Four-dimensional coefficient model + normalization","旋转随时间变化时，为什么先相加再 normalize？":"Why add coefficients and then normalize to animate rotation?","先在四维系数空间里走直线":"Move along a line in four-dimensional coefficient space","q0、ω 都有四个数，按分量计算 u=q0+Δtω。这里 ω 是四元数系数的变化，不是三维物理角速度。":"q0 and ω each have four components. Evaluate u=q0+Δtω componentwise. Here ω is a quaternion-coefficient change, not a 3D physical angular velocity.","直线不保证仍在单位球面上":"A line does not stay on the unit sphere","即使 q0 是单位长度，相加后的 u 一般也不是。例如 (1,0,0,0)+(0,0,0,0.5) 的长度是 √1.25。":"Even if q0 has unit length, u usually does not. For example, (1,0,0,0)+(0,0,0,0.5) has length √1.25.","除以长度，回到单位四元数":"Divide by length to recover a unit quaternion","每项都除以同一个数，平方和就变成 1。要求 u≠0；归一化后送进前面的旋转矩阵。":"Dividing every component by the same length makes the sum of squares equal 1. This requires u≠0. Feed the normalized result into the rotation matrix above.","理解角度速度不恒定":"Understand why angular speed is not constant","归一化把系数直线投到单位球面，因此角度一般非线性变化。这个模型不是 SLERP，也不自动满足刚体角速度微分方程。":"Normalization projects a straight coefficient path onto the unit sphere, so angle usually changes nonlinearly. This is neither SLERP nor automatically a solution of the rigid-body angular-velocity equation.","Δt=0.5 时 q≈(0.894427,0,0,0.447214)，对应绕 z 旋转约 53.13°。":"At Δt=0.5, q≈(0.894427,0,0,0.447214), representing a rotation of about 53.13° around z.","normalize(splat.r6 + dt*splat.r7) 正是这两步。loader 的有限值检查并不保证所有时刻 u 的范数非零；资产需满足这个前提。":"normalize(splat.r6 + dt*splat.r7) performs exactly these steps. Finite-value checks in the loader do not guarantee nonzero u at every time; the asset must satisfy that condition.","q0 ↔ r6；ω ↔ r7；q ↔ quaternion":"q0 ↔ r6; ω ↔ r7; q ↔ quaternion","当前 shader 没有为 u=0 定义有效旋转。解释这个公式必须写出非零范数条件，不能只说 normalize 永远安全。":"The current shader does not define a valid rotation for u=0. Always state the nonzero-norm condition rather than treating normalize as unconditionally safe.","ω=0 时旋转会随时间变化吗？":"Does rotation change over time if ω=0?","不会；始终是 normalize(q0)，前提 q0≠0。":"No. It stays at normalize(q0), provided q0 is nonzero.","逐分量求导，再组成矩阵":"Differentiate components, then assemble a matrix","normalize 的梯度为什么会减掉 qqᵀ？":"Why does the normalize gradient subtract qqᵀ?","先给长度一个短名字":"Give the length a short name","令 r=||u||。因为 r²=∑uj²，两边对某个 uj 求偏导：2r ∂r/∂uj=2uj。":"Let r=||u||. Since r²=∑uj², differentiating both sides with respect to uj gives 2r ∂r/∂uj=2uj.","对 qi=ui/r 使用商法则":"Apply the quotient rule to qi=ui/r","δij 在 i=j 时为 1，否则为 0。这只是 ui 对 uj 的偏导，不是神秘函数。":"δij is 1 when i=j and 0 otherwise. It is simply the derivative of ui with respect to uj.","用 qi、qj 替换 ui/r、uj/r":"Replace ui/r and uj/r with qi and qj","把所有 i,j 的项排成一张 4×4 表；对角的 δij 组成 I，qiqj 组成外积 qqᵀ。":"Arrange the entries into a 4×4 matrix. The δij entries form I; the qiqj entries form the outer product qqᵀ.","把时间这条链接上":"Connect the time derivative","u=q0+(t−τ)ω，所以 du/dt=ω。右乘 ω 得到 q 的时间变化率。若变化正好沿着 q，归一化会把它完全消掉。":"Because u=q0+(t−τ)ω, du/dt=ω. Multiply the Jacobian by ω to obtain dq/dt. A change exactly along q is removed entirely by normalization.","u=(2,0,0,0)，r=2，q=(1,0,0,0)。":"For u=(2,0,0,0), r=2 and q=(1,0,0,0).","GPU 的 normalize 只有前向计算。此导数用于理解训练端自动微分，本仓库 toy trainer 固定旋转，未训练 q 或 ω。":"GPU normalize performs only the forward calculation. This derivative explains training-side autodiff; the repository’s toy trainer keeps rotation fixed and does not train q or ω.","前向 q ↔ quaternion；反向 Jacobian ↔ 教学数值检查":"Forward q ↔ quaternion; backward Jacobian ↔ teaching numerical checks","r 接近 0 时分母放大梯度。数学上可导不意味着当前渲染 pass 有 backward kernel。":"When r approaches zero, the denominator amplifies gradients. Mathematical differentiability does not mean this rendering pass has a backward kernel.","只把 u 整体乘一个略大的正数，q 会变吗？":"Does q change if all of u is multiplied by a slightly larger positive number?","不会。沿径向的变化被 I−qqᵀ 消掉。":"No. I−qqᵀ removes the radial component of change.","另一类模型的接口定义":"Interface definition for another model family","如果不存运动多项式，时间怎样影响 Gaussian？":"How can time affect a Gaussian without stored motion polynomials?","先保存一个参考状态":"Store a reference state","规范 Gaussian G⁰ 可以包含中心、log-scale、四元数、opacity 等。规范空间是共同参考，不一定是实际拍到的第一帧。":"A canonical Gaussian G⁰ may contain a center, log-scales, quaternion, opacity, and other parameters. Canonical space is a shared reference, not necessarily the first captured frame.","让函数读取位置和时间":"Let a function read position and time","Fθ 是带可学习参数 θ 的函数。最简单的网络层只是“矩阵乘输入再加偏移”，再经过非线性。例如 ReLU 逐项取 max(0,x)。实际 Wu 等方法还使用时空特征编码，不能被这个小例子替代。":"Fθ is a function with learnable parameters θ. A basic network layer multiplies an input by a matrix, adds a bias, and applies a nonlinearity such as componentwise ReLU=max(0,x). Wu et al. also use spatiotemporal feature encoding; this small example does not replace their model.","不同输出头要在自己的参数域解码":"Decode each output head in its own parameter domain","一个可选示例：中心直接加位移，log-scale 加增量后 exp，四元数相加后归一化。它只是示意，不断言所有 deformation 仓库都这样处理。":"One possible example adds displacement to position, adds a log-scale increment before exp, and adds a quaternion increment before normalization. These are illustrative choices, not universal rules for deformation repositories.","把时间分支收口到同一个三维渲染接口":"Return the time-dependent result to the shared 3D rendering interface","无论时间来自网络还是多项式，只要得到当前时刻的 μ、Σ、o、颜色，就能接投影、排序、合成。额外工作是存储网络参数、执行推理，并匹配训练时的 decoder 规则。":"Whether time is handled by a network or a polynomial, current μ,Σ,o and appearance can feed projection, sorting, and composition. A network additionally requires stored weights, inference, and a decoder matching training.","只看 log-scale head：s0=2，Δℓ=ln1.5。":"For just the log-scale head, let s0=2 and Δℓ=ln1.5.","单独提供的教学函数演示这三种输出域的解码；没有接入 StgPass，也不是 Wu 4D-GS 模型加载器。":"This standalone teaching function demonstrates decoding in three parameter domains. It is not connected to StgPass and is not a Wu 4D-GS model loader.","Δμ、Δℓ、Δq ↔ deltaPosition、deltaLogScale、deltaQuaternion":"Δμ,Δℓ,Δq ↔ deltaPosition,deltaLogScale,deltaQuaternion","不能把一个网络模型的 checkpoint 改名成 STG PLY 后加载；还缺网络权重、特征网格及执行过程。":"Renaming a network checkpoint to STG PLY does not make it loadable. Network weights, feature grids, and their execution are still required.","log-scale 加 0.1 对真实尺度是加 0.1 吗？":"Does adding 0.1 to log-scale add 0.1 to physical scale?","不是，真实尺度乘 exp(0.1)≈1.10517。":"No. Physical scale is multiplied by exp(0.1)≈1.10517.","联合变量的定义":"Definition of a joint variable","原生 4D Gaussian 的第四维究竟存了什么？":"What does the fourth dimension of a native 4D Gaussian actually contain?","把空间和时间装进同一列":"Put space and time in one column","前三个量是空间坐标，第四个是时间。均值同样有四个分量。单位可以不同，因此协方差的各块单位也不同。":"The first three entries are spatial coordinates and the fourth is time. The mean also has four components. The units may differ, so covariance blocks have different units too.","逐项写出平均偏移乘积":"Write every average product of deviations","4×4 表中的每项都是两个坐标偏移的平均乘积。右上角三项描述各空间坐标与时间的共同变化。":"Each entry of the 4×4 matrix averages the product of two coordinate deviations. The three upper-right entries describe how each spatial coordinate varies with time.","把它分成四块":"Group the entries into four blocks","A 为 3×3 空间协方差；b 为 3×1 时空交叉项；c 为时间方差。bᵀ 是 1×3，因此四块能拼成 4×4。":"A is the 3×3 spatial covariance, b is the 3×1 space-time cross-covariance, and c is temporal variance. bᵀ is 1×3, so the blocks form a 4×4 matrix.","保证这是一团有厚度的四维形状":"Require a nondegenerate four-dimensional shape","要求联合协方差正定。下一节会证明这等价于 c>0 且 S=A−bbᵀ/c 正定。b 的大小并非任意可取。":"The joint covariance must be positive definite. The following derivation shows this is equivalent to c>0 and positive-definite S=A−bbᵀ/c. The magnitude of b cannot be chosen arbitrarily.","只有 x 与时间相关的例子：A=diag(2,1,1)、b=(1,0,0)、c=1。":"An example with correlation only between x and time: A=diag(2,1,1), b=(1,0,0), c=1.","教学函数显式接收 A,b,c。当前 STG 的 32-float 记录没有这些块，不能从 r0..r7 直接假装读取它们。":"The teaching function takes A,b,c explicitly. The current 32-float STG record has no such blocks; r0..r7 cannot simply be reinterpreted as them.","A,b,c ↔ 同名教学参数；不属于现有模型格式":"A,b,c ↔ teaching arguments with the same names; absent from the current model format","在三维 Gaussian 后面追加一个时间戳，并不自动得到联合 4D Gaussian。四维旋转也不是把普通三维四元数原样复用。":"Appending a timestamp to a 3D Gaussian does not create a joint 4D Gaussian. Nor can an ordinary 3D quaternion directly represent a general 4D rotation.","b=0 表示什么？":"What does b=0 mean?","在联合 Gaussian 模型中空间和时间独立；固定时刻不会移动空间中心。":"Space and time are independent in this joint Gaussian model; fixing time does not move the spatial center.","消去相关项 → 条件分布":"Remove correlation → condition the distribution","为什么固定时间后要减去 bbᵀ/c，而不能直接用 A？":"Why subtract bbᵀ/c rather than use A when time is fixed?","把两个变量都先减去均值":"Subtract the means from both variables","令 X 表示三维空间偏移，T 表示时间偏移。它们均值为 0，协方差块分别是 A、b、c。":"Let X be the 3D spatial offset and T the temporal offset. Both have mean zero, with covariance blocks A,b,c.","尝试从 X 中减去一部分时间变化":"Subtract a time-dependent component from X","设 U=X−kT，希望残差 U 不再与 T 共同变化。展开平均乘积，令它为 0，就能解出 k，而不用背条件均值公式。":"Define U=X−kT and seek a residual uncorrelated with T. Expand the expected product and set it to zero to solve for k, without memorizing the conditional-mean formula.","展开残差的协方差":"Expand the residual covariance","四项分别取平均。两个交叉项都是 bbᵀ/c，最后一项加回来一次，因此净减去一次。":"Take expectations of all four terms. Both cross terms subtract bbᵀ/c and the final term adds it once, leaving one net subtraction.","利用联合 Gaussian 的特殊结构":"Use the special structure of a joint Gaussian","一般分布中“不相关”不一定等于“独立”。但 Gaussian 的指数只有二次项；下一式的分块分解会证明 U 和 T 的指数分开，所以固定 T 不改变 U 的分布。":"For general distributions, uncorrelated does not imply independent. A Gaussian exponent is quadratic; the next block factorization separates its U and T terms, proving that fixing T leaves U’s distribution unchanged.","把固定时间的偏移加回中心":"Add the fixed-time displacement back to the center","X=U+(b/c)T。固定时间后，后半项只是平移；残差仍是均值 0、协方差 S 的 Gaussian。":"X=U+(b/c)T. Once time is fixed, the second term is a translation. The residual remains a zero-mean Gaussian with covariance S.","标量空间也一样：Var(X)=2，Cov(X,T)=1，Var(T)=1。固定 T=3 后，均值移到 3，方差从 2 降为 1。":"The same reasoning works for scalar space: Var(X)=2, Cov(X,T)=1, Var(T)=1. Conditioning on T=3 moves the mean to 3 and reduces variance from 2 to 1.","逐项构造 shiftedMean 和 A[i][j]−b[i]*b[j]/c；本函数供手算验证，不改变 STG renderer。":"The function computes shifted mean and A[i][j]−b[i]*b[j]/c entry by entry. It verifies the derivation without modifying the STG renderer.","条件均值 ↔ mean；S ↔ covariance":"Conditional mean ↔ mean; S ↔ covariance","条件分布与边缘分布不同。忽略时间得到空间边缘 A；知道时间后得到更窄的条件协方差 S。":"Conditioning and marginalizing are different. Ignoring time gives spatial marginal covariance A; knowing time gives the smaller conditional covariance S.","单个固定 4D Gaussian 的条件协方差会随 t 改变吗？":"Does the conditional covariance of one fixed 4D Gaussian vary with t?","不会，它只由 A,b,c 决定；中心随 t 线性变化，时间权重随 t 变化。":"No. It depends only on A,b,c. Its center moves linearly with t and its temporal weight changes.","矩阵配方的完整证明":"Complete proof by block-matrix completion of squares","空间条件核和时间核为什么能相乘？":"Why does the kernel factor into a spatial conditional kernel and a temporal kernel?","构造一个可撤销的换坐标":"Construct an invertible coordinate change","令 k=b/c、S=A−bbᵀ/c；下三角块矩阵 L 把独立残差 U 和时间 T 组合成 X=U+kT。":"Set k=b/c and S=A−bbᵀ/c. The block triangular matrix L combines residual U and time T into X=U+kT.","亲手乘开验证分块协方差":"Multiply the blocks to verify the covariance","先乘左边两张表，再乘 Lᵀ；右上是 kc=b，左上是 S+kckᵀ=A。这也证明 c>0、S 正定时联合协方差正定。":"Multiply the first two matrices, then Lᵀ. The upper-right block is kc=b and upper-left is S+kckᵀ=A. This also proves positive definiteness of the joint covariance when c>0 and S is positive definite.","把逆矩阵放进二次型":"Substitute the inverse into the quadratic form","乘积求逆要倒序。L⁻¹[X;T]=[X−kT;T]，因此不需要展开整个 4×4 逆矩阵，就能把交叉项消掉。":"Inverting a product reverses its order. Since L⁻¹[X;T]=[X−kT;T], the cross terms disappear without explicitly writing a 4×4 inverse.","指数中的加法变成核的乘法":"Turn addition in the exponent into multiplication of kernels","乘上 −1/2 后取 exp，用 exp(a+b)=exp(a)exp(b)。第一部分以 μx+kT 为中心，第二部分只依赖时间。":"Multiply by −1/2 and exponentiate, using exp(a+b)=exp(a)exp(b). The first factor is centered at μx+kT; the second depends only on time.","如果使用概率密度，常数也能分开":"Probability-density constants factor too, if needed","det(L)=1，所以 det(Σ4)=det(S)c。归一化常数同样分成三维和一维两份；本页渲染核没有使用这些常数。":"det(L)=1, so det(Σ4)=det(S)c. The density normalization separates into 3D and 1D factors. The rendering kernels on this page do not include these constants.","前面的例子取 t=1、空间点 (1,0,0)。它正好位于条件空间中心，因此空间核为 1。":"In the previous example, let t=1 and the spatial point be (1,0,0). It lies at the conditional center, so its spatial kernel equals 1.","timeWeight=exp(−0.5*dt²/c) 必须保留；它和条件中心、条件协方差一起给到后续三维 renderer 才能表达这个联合核。":"Keep timeWeight=exp(−0.5*dt²/c). Pass it along with conditional center and covariance to the subsequent 3D renderer to represent the joint kernel.","时间边缘核 ↔ timeWeight":"Temporal marginal kernel ↔ timeWeight","只移动中心、丢掉时间权重，会让本应随时间淡出的 primitive 永远保持相同峰值。":"Moving the center but dropping temporal weight makes a primitive retain its peak indefinitely when it should fade over time.","这条时间核与 STG-Lite 的 ρ 怎样对应？":"How does this temporal kernel correspond to STG-Lite width ρ?","若只匹配时间曲线，ρ=√(2c)；这不意味着两种完整表示等价。":"Matching the temporal curve alone gives ρ=√(2c). That does not make the complete representations equivalent.","逐项代入验算":"Substitute numbers, entry by entry","用一个可手算的 4×4 例子把条件化走完。":"Work through conditioning in a hand-checkable 4×4 example.","先算外积，不把它误写成点积":"Compute the outer product, not a dot product","b 是三维列，bbᵀ 是 3×3；只有左上角为 1。":"b is a 3D column, so bbᵀ is 3×3. Only its top-left entry is 1.","相减得到条件协方差":"Subtract to get conditional covariance","A 的第一个方差从 2 减到 1，其余保持 1。因此固定时间后的空间核是单位球。":"The first variance of A drops from 2 to 1; the others stay 1. At a fixed time, the spatial kernel is therefore a unit sphere.","条件中心随时间移动":"Move the conditional center with time","四维均值取 0，b/c=(1,0,0)。所以中心沿 x 轴以每模型时间单位 1 个世界单位移动。":"With zero 4D mean and b/c=(1,0,0), the center moves along x by one world unit per model-time unit.","直接用逆矩阵再验一次":"Verify directly with the inverse matrix","x,t 对应的 2×2 块 [[2,1],[1,1]] 的逆是 [[1,−1],[−1,2]]；二次型配方后恰好是 (x−t)²+t²。再加 y²、z²。":"The inverse of the x,t block [[2,1],[1,1]] is [[1,−1],[−1,2]]. Completing the quadratic square gives (x−t)²+t². Add y² and z².","t=2、x=2、y=z=0，空间在中心、时间偏离 2；两种路线都给同一个结果。":"At t=2 and (x,y,z)=(2,0,0), the spatial point is at its conditional center and the temporal offset is 2. Both calculations agree.","可以在下载的教学模块中直接调用这个 A,b,c；数值检查同时比较完整四维二次型与分解后的两个核。":"Call the downloadable teaching module with this A,b,c. Numerical checks compare the full 4D quadratic form with its factored kernels.","A=diag(2,1,1)；b=[1,0,0]；c=1":"A=diag(2,1,1); b=[1,0,0]; c=1","这个例子有线性轨迹和固定形状，不能拿来证明单个联合 4D Gaussian 能表达 STG 的任意三次轨迹。":"This example has a linear trajectory and fixed conditional shape. It does not show that one joint 4D Gaussian can express an arbitrary STG cubic trajectory.","若误用 A 当条件协方差，哪个轴会过宽？":"Which axis becomes too wide if you incorrectly use A as conditional covariance?","x 轴，标准差会从 1 错变成 √2。":"The x axis: its standard deviation incorrectly becomes √2 instead of 1.","基函数定义 → 有限展开":"Define basis functions → build a finite expansion","SH 不是魔法颜色：它是“几个方向图案乘系数再相加”。":"SH color is a sum of directional patterns, each multiplied by a coefficient.","先把相机方向化为单位向量":"Normalize the viewing direction","颜色可以随观察方向变化。假设方向函数只依赖 v；SH 选择一组球面上的标准图案 Y，RGB 系数分别控制每张图案的贡献。有限阶展开是一种近似表示。":"Color may vary with viewing direction v. SH selects standard spherical patterns Y; RGB coefficients control each pattern’s contribution. A finite-order expansion is an approximate representation.","从常数图案推导 DC 的系数":"Derive the constant DC basis value","为了让一张图案的“平方总量”为 1，常数 k 必须满足球面面积 4π 乘 k²=1。因此 Y00=1/√(4π)。":"To give a constant pattern unit squared integral over the sphere, its value k must satisfy 4πk²=1. Thus Y00=1/√(4π).","一阶图案来自 x、y、z":"Build first-order patterns from x,y,z","球面对三个轴完全对称，且 x²+y²+z²=1，因此三个平方的球面积分都为 4π/3。各乘 √(3/4π) 后平方总量为 1。按 Graphdeco 的实数约定，一阶顺序是 −y,z,−x。":"The sphere treats all three axes symmetrically and x²+y²+z²=1, so each squared coordinate integrates to 4π/3. Multiplying by √(3/4π) gives unit squared integral. Graphdeco’s real first-order convention uses the order −y,z,−x.","高阶图案也有明确的生成规则":"Higher orders also have an explicit construction","想继续往上，可用 Legendre 多项式的定义：ℓ! 表示从 1 连乘到 ℓ，0!=1；d^ℓ 表示连续求导 ℓ 次。代入 ℓ=0,1,2 就得到下面三项。":"Use the Legendre polynomial definition: ℓ! multiplies integers 1 through ℓ, with 0!=1; d^ℓ means differentiating ℓ times. Substituting ℓ=0,1,2 yields the three polynomials below.","把纬度图案和经度图案组合":"Combine latitude and longitude patterns","对 m≥0，先求关联多项式；再乘 sin(mφ) 或 cos(mφ) 与归一化常数。这里明确采用含 (−1)^m 的约定，避免源码之间符号不一致。":"For m≥0, first form an associated polynomial, then multiply by sin(mφ) or cos(mφ) and a normalization constant. We explicitly include the (−1)^m convention to avoid sign mismatches between implementations.","为什么系数可以逐项求":"Why can coefficients be recovered individually?","这些图案按上述归一化满足正交性：同一图案的乘积积分为 1，不同图案为 0。将展开式乘 Ykn 再积分，其余项消失，只剩对应系数。GS 实际通常直接优化系数；无需运行时积分。高阶正交性的完整证明可继续读 NIST DLMF，运行时只要评估多项式。":"With these normalizations, basis functions are orthogonal: matching products integrate to 1 and distinct products to 0. Multiply an expansion by Ykn and integrate to isolate its coefficient. GS usually optimizes coefficients directly, with no runtime integration. NIST DLMF gives the higher-order orthogonality theory; runtime only evaluates polynomials.","回到具体文件，先检查有没有 SH":"Check whether the actual asset contains SH","本项目 STG-Lite 的 f_dc_0..2 直接保存 RGB。静态 Graphdeco 3DGS 的 DC 则通常按 C0*a00+0.5 转成颜色。相同名字不是相同格式。":"This project’s STG-Lite f_dc_0..2 fields directly store RGB. Static Graphdeco 3DGS typically converts DC coefficients with C0*a00+0.5. A shared field name does not imply a shared format.","只用 DC 表示红通道 0.8，在静态 3DGS 约定下系数约 1.06347；当前 Lite 则直接存 0.8。":"To represent a constant red-channel value 0.8 using static 3DGS DC, store about 1.06347. Current Lite instead stores 0.8 directly.","教学模块实现到一阶：C0*a0 + C1*(−y*a1+z*a2−x*a3)。它是用于检查 SH 系数的独立示例，未接入 Lite。":"The teaching module evaluates through first order: C0*a0 + C1*(−y*a1+z*a2−x*a3). It is a standalone SH example, not part of Lite rendering.","ℓ≤1 的四项 ↔ coefficients[0..3]":"Four terms with ℓ≤1 ↔ coefficients[0..3]","真实 shader 读取 r4.yzw 后 clamp，没有求 SH。":"The actual shader reads r4.yzw and clamps it; it does not evaluate SH.","当前 RGB ↔ splat.r4.yzw":"Current RGB ↔ splat.r4.yzw","SH 表示观察方向相关颜色，不等于可重光照材质。方向反向、基底排序或符号不同都会改变奇数阶贡献。":"SH describes view-dependent color, not automatically a relightable material. Reversing directions or changing basis order/signs changes odd-order contributions.","最高阶 L=3 一共需要多少个 RGB 系数？":"How many RGB coefficient vectors are needed through order L=3?","每阶 2ℓ+1 个，总数 1+3+5+7=16，也就是 (L+1)²。":"Each order has 2ℓ+1: 1+3+5+7=16, or (L+1)².","颜色合成推广到特征":"Generalize color composition to features","为什么有的 STG 先画特征，再通过网络得到颜色？":"Why do some STG methods splat features and decode color afterward?","把三个颜色数字换成 D 个特征数字":"Replace three color numbers with D feature numbers","alpha 仍由几何与时间决定，前缀透射率也相同。只把每层的 RGB 列换成长一点的特征列。":"Geometry and time still determine alpha, and prefix transmittance is unchanged. Replace each RGB column with a longer feature column.","每个通道独立做同样的加权和":"Apply the same weighted sum to every channel","堆起来就是 F=∑Tiαifi。若背景特征不为 0，也要像颜色一样加上剩余透射率乘背景特征。这里概念式默认背景特征为 0。":"Stack the channels to obtain F=∑Tiαifi. A nonzero background feature must also be multiplied by remaining transmittance and added. This conceptual formula assumes zero background features.","用 decoder 把特征和方向变成颜色":"Decode features and direction into color","示意网络先拼接 F 与观察方向，矩阵乘法加偏移，再做非线性，最后输出三维。真实 STG 的特征分组和输入应按论文与 checkpoint 配套实现。":"An illustrative network concatenates F and view direction, applies a matrix and bias, then a nonlinearity, and outputs three channels. Match the actual STG feature groups and decoder inputs to its paper and checkpoint.","解释为什么不能随意交换先后顺序":"Explain why the order cannot generally be swapped","非线性函数一般不满足 D(a+b)=D(a)+D(b)。所以“先解码每个 Gaussian 再合成颜色”不一定等于“先合成特征再解码”。":"A nonlinear function usually does not satisfy D(a+b)=D(a)+D(b). Decoding each Gaussian before color composition may therefore differ from composing features before decoding.","两层特征 (1,2)、(3,0)，alpha 都为 0.5、近到远，黑背景特征。":"For near-to-far features (1,2) and (3,0), both alphas 0.5, and zero background features:","教学函数复用透明合成计算任意 D 维特征；示例 decoder 的权重只是手写练习，不是 STG 训练权重。":"The teaching function composes arbitrary D-dimensional features using the same transparency rule. Any hand-chosen example decoder weights are exercises, not trained STG weights.","F ↔ compositeFeatures 返回值":"F ↔ compositeFeatures return value","Lite 的特殊情况直接合成三通道 RGB，没有 feature render target 或 MLP 调用。":"Lite directly composes three RGB channels. There is no feature render target or MLP call.","D=3 且直接颜色 ↔ 当前 color_opacity.rgb":"D=3 with direct color ↔ current color_opacity.rgb","加载完整版 STG 需要匹配特征通道、时间编码、decoder 权重和输入约定，不能只保留三个 f_dc 字段。":"Loading full STG requires matching feature channels, temporal encoding, decoder weights, and inputs. Keeping only three f_dc fields is insufficient.","只有线性 decoder 就能随意交换合成和解码吗？":"Can composition and decoding always be swapped if the decoder is linear?","纯线性且背景处理一致时可以；有偏置时还要考虑权重之和，不能省略背景后直接搬过去。":"For a purely linear decoder and consistent background treatment, yes. With a bias, the sum of weights also matters; omitting background can invalidate the swap.","误差度量的选择":"Choosing an error measure","渲染得到图像之后，训练到底在减少哪个数字？":"After rendering an image, which number does training reduce?","把预测和目标逐通道相减":"Subtract target from prediction, channel by channel","把所有参与训练的像素通道排成 M 个数。L1 取误差绝对值再平均；MSE 先平方再平均。二者都非负，完全一致时为 0，但它们不是同一个损失。":"Arrange all training pixel channels into M numbers. L1 averages absolute errors; MSE averages squared errors. Both are nonnegative and vanish for an exact match, but they are different losses.","为什么还可能看局部结构":"Why compare local structure too?","只比较单个像素会忽略局部亮度和对比度关系。SSIM 先在窗口内求均值、方差与协方差，再构造相似度；下面给出一种常见加权窗口版本，权重 wn 非负且和为 1。":"Individual pixel errors miss relationships in local brightness and contrast. SSIM computes window means, variances, and covariance, then defines a similarity score. This common weighted-window version uses nonnegative weights wn that sum to 1.","说明 SSIM 是定义，不是假装能唯一推出来":"SSIM is a definition, not a uniquely derivable law","亮度项利用 2ab=a²+b²−(a−b)²：均值差越小，比例越接近 1。结构项利用两个中心化信号的平方差展开得到类似性质。C1、C2 是防止小分母的正常数；窗口和边界处理由实现决定。":"The luminance factor uses 2ab=a²+b²−(a−b)²: closer means give a ratio closer to 1. Expanding the squared difference of centered signals gives a similar property for the structure factor. C1 and C2 are positive constants stabilizing small denominators; window and boundary choices depend on the implementation.","把相似度转成要最小化的损失":"Turn similarity into a loss to minimize","1−SSIM 在相似度最高时最小。λ 是两种误差的权重，R(θ) 是额外正则，例如限制运动大小；不需要时为 0。这是常见训练目标的结构，不是所有 4DGS 的统一公式。":"1−SSIM is smallest at maximum similarity. λ weights the error terms. R(θ) adds regularization, such as penalizing motion, or is zero when unnecessary. This is a common objective structure, not a universal formula for all 4DGS methods.","当前 toy trainer 使用更容易核对的 MSE":"The current toy trainer uses the easier-to-check MSE","平方的导数是 2e，目标图像视为常量；除以 M 得到每个预测通道的起始梯度。L1 在非零误差处则只取符号，零点使用选定的次梯度。":"The derivative of a squared error is 2e; the target image is constant. Divide by M to get the starting gradient of each predicted channel. L1 uses the error sign away from zero and a chosen subgradient at zero.","把误差传回去，再更新":"Propagate error backward, then update","zero_grad 清除上一轮梯度；backward 按链式法则累计；step 使用优化器修改参数。教学页面的一步演示用 SGD 便于手算，实际 train_toy_stg.py 用 Adam。":"zero_grad clears previous gradients; backward accumulates through the chain rule; step changes parameters with the optimizer. The page demonstrates one SGD step for hand calculation; train_toy_stg.py actually uses Adam.","预测 (0.6,0.2,0.1)，目标 (0.5,0.3,0.1)，三通道平均。":"Prediction (0.6,0.2,0.1), target (0.5,0.3,0.1), averaged over three channels.","实际代码 square().mean() 是 MSE，没有 SSIM 或运动正则。Adam 的 fitted 列表决定哪些变量会被训练。":"The actual square().mean() computes MSE, with no SSIM or motion regularizer. Adam’s fitted list determines which variables are trained.","L ↔ loss；∇L ↔ .grad；参数更新 ↔ optimizer.step()":"L ↔ loss; ∇L ↔ .grad; parameter update ↔ optimizer.step()","不能把某次 loss 下降直接等同于真实场景重建质量。当前数据是合成图像，旋转和尺度固定，也没有 SfM 与 densification。":"A falling loss does not by itself demonstrate real-scene reconstruction quality. These images are synthetic, scale and rotation are fixed, and there is no SfM or densification.","为什么 backward 后画面可能完全没变？":"Why might the image remain unchanged after backward?","backward 只算梯度；尚未 optimizer.step，或者变量不在优化器参数列表里。":"backward only calculates gradients. optimizer.step may not have run, or the variable may be absent from the optimizer’s parameter list.","指数链式法则":"The exponential chain rule","把 Gaussian 中心挪向一个像素，alpha 会怎样变？":"How does alpha change when the Gaussian center moves toward a pixel?","把指数部分命名为 E":"Name the exponent E","固定 C、o，令 d=p−μ。Q 对称，先按 x、y 分量把 E 展开，避免直接背矩阵求导规则。":"Hold C and o fixed and set d=p−μ. Q is symmetric. Expand E into x and y components before using any matrix differentiation shortcut.","对中心 x 分量求导":"Differentiate with respect to the center’s x coordinate","dx 对 μx 的导数是 −1，dy 不变。平方导数的 2 与前面的 1/2 抵消，两个负号又抵消。":"The derivative of dx with respect to μx is −1; dy is unchanged. The square contributes a 2 that cancels 1/2, and the two minus signs cancel.","对中心 y 分量同样计算":"Repeat for the y coordinate","合起来正好就是矩阵 Q 乘偏移 d。":"Together, the two results are exactly matrix Q multiplied by displacement d.","外层指数再乘一次自己":"Differentiate the outer exponential","exp 的导数还是 exp，o 视为常量，因此外层导数 o exp(E) 恰好等于 alpha。":"The derivative of exp is exp itself, and o is constant. Thus the outer derivative o exp(E) is exactly alpha.","注意这只是局部偏导":"Recognize that this is only a local partial derivative","中心的真实三维位置还会改变投影大小、方向外观和排序。此处锁住 C，下一条完整链式公式再把其他路径加回来。":"The actual 3D center also changes projected size, directional appearance, and ordering. Here C is fixed; the complete chain rule below restores the other paths.","C=diag(4,1)、d=(2,1)、o=0.8，alpha≈0.294304。":"C=diag(4,1), d=(2,1), o=0.8, giving alpha≈0.294304.","delta=pixel−uv、inverse=inv(covariance)、exp(power) 组成这条路径；PyTorch 自动微分负责同样的计算。":"delta=pixel−uv, inverse=inv(covariance), and exp(power) form this path. PyTorch autograd performs the same differentiation.","μ ↔ uv；d ↔ delta；Q ↔ inverse":"μ ↔ uv; d ↔ delta; Q ↔ inverse","把 d 写成 μ−p 却仍使用正号，会把梯度方向反过来。clamp 或 discard 的分段梯度也不在此式内。":"Defining d as μ−p but keeping the positive sign reverses the gradient. This formula also excludes the piecewise derivatives introduced by clamp or discard.","像素恰好在中心，均值偏导是多少？":"What is the mean derivative exactly at the center?","0，因为 d=0；峰值附近向任意方向小挪动的影响从二阶开始。":"Zero, because d=0. At the peak, the effect of a small displacement begins at second order.","逆矩阵微分，拆成代数步骤":"Inverse-matrix differentiation, one algebra step at a time","怎样知道把椭圆变宽会让某个像素变亮多少？":"How much brighter does a pixel become when the ellipse widens?","从逆矩阵的定义出发":"Start from the definition of an inverse","Q=C⁻¹，所以 CQ=I。让 C 增加很小的 δC，Q 增加 δQ，乘开后减去 CQ=I。":"Q=C⁻¹, so CQ=I. Increase C by a small δC and Q by δQ; expand the product and subtract CQ=I.","只保留一次小量":"Keep only first-order changes","δCδQ 是二次小量，在导数极限中消失。左乘 Q 得到 δQ=−QδCQ。这是逆矩阵求导的来源。":"δCδQ is second order and vanishes in the derivative limit. Multiply on the left by Q to obtain δQ=−QδCQ. This is where the inverse derivative comes from.","把它代入指数的变化":"Substitute into the exponent’s change","固定 d，E=−dᵀQd/2。两个负号抵消；令 v=Qd，则结果只剩 vᵀδCv/2。":"Hold d fixed in E=−dᵀQd/2. The two minus signs cancel. With v=Qd, only vᵀδCv/2 remains.","逐元素读出系数":"Read off each element’s coefficient","把 vᵀδCv 展开为 ∑ij vi vj δCij。每个 δCij 前面的系数就是 E 对那个矩阵元素的偏导；再乘指数导数 alpha。":"Expand vᵀδCv as ∑ij vi vj δCij. The coefficient of each δCij is the partial derivative of E with respect to that element. Then multiply by the outer exponential derivative, alpha.","实际只存一个 b 时要加两项":"Add both contributions when storing just one b","C12 和 C21 同时等于 b；b 增加会同时改变两个元素。因此 db 的导数是两项之和，不能只读矩阵右上角。":"Both C12 and C21 equal b. Increasing b changes both entries, so its derivative sums two contributions; reading only the upper-right matrix entry misses one.","继续用 alpha≈0.294304、v=(0.5,1)。":"Continue with alpha≈0.294304 and v=(0.5,1).","torch.linalg.inv 的反向传播与这条逆矩阵规则一致；WGSL 仅负责前向，没有对应训练 backward。":"The backward rule for torch.linalg.inv matches this inverse derivative. WGSL currently performs only the forward pass and has no training backward pass.","C ↔ covariance；∂α/∂C ↔ autograd 中间梯度":"C ↔ covariance; ∂α/∂C ↔ an autograd intermediate gradient","该式用于峰值归一的核。若额外含 det(C) 的概率密度归一化因子，其导数还有一项，不能照抄。":"This is a peak-normalized kernel. A probability density with a det(C) normalization factor has an additional derivative term.","像素位于中心时，只变宽度会改变未归一化核的峰值吗？":"At the center, does changing width change the peak of this unnormalized kernel?","不会。d=0，协方差梯度为 0；它仍等于 o。":"No. d=0 makes the covariance gradient zero; the value remains o.","sigmoid 的导数":"The derivative of sigmoid","为什么训练 opacity 用 logit，而梯度里出现 1−o？":"Why train opacity as a logit, and why does 1−o appear in the gradient?","把 sigmoid 写成倒数":"Write sigmoid as a reciprocal","令 o=(1+e⁻ᵝ)⁻¹。外层倒数求导给负号，内层 e⁻ᵝ 又给负号，两者抵消。":"Let o=(1+e⁻ᵝ)⁻¹. Differentiating the outer reciprocal introduces a minus sign; the inner e⁻ᵝ introduces another. They cancel.","把结果改写成 o 的乘积":"Rewrite the result in terms of o","一个分母给 o，剩下的比例等于 1−o。":"One denominator gives o; the remaining ratio equals 1−o.","乘上固定的时间核和空间核":"Multiply by the fixed temporal and spatial kernels","令 K=w(t)G(p)，与 β 无关；alpha=oK。求导得到 K o(1−o)，把 Ko 换回 alpha。":"Let K=w(t)G(p), independent of β, so alpha=oK. Its derivative is K o(1−o); replace Ko with alpha.","再接像素损失的上游梯度":"Attach the upstream pixel-loss gradient","β 改变 alpha，alpha 改变像素，像素改变 loss。每个受影响像素的贡献都要累加。":"β changes alpha, alpha changes the pixel, and the pixel changes loss. Sum the contributions of every affected pixel.","β=0，o=0.5，K=0.6，所以 alpha=0.3。":"β=0 gives o=0.5. With K=0.6, alpha=0.3.","opacity_logits 参与 torch.sigmoid；导出时写回原始 logit，GPU 再解码。":"opacity_logits passes through torch.sigmoid. Export writes the original logit, which the GPU decodes again.","β ↔ opacity_logits；o ↔ torch.sigmoid(...)":"β ↔ opacity_logits; o ↔ torch.sigmoid(...)","这里 1−o 用基础 sigmoid opacity，不是 1−alpha，也不是 1−时间衰减后的 opacity。":"The factor 1−o uses the base sigmoid opacity, not 1−alpha or 1 minus the temporally attenuated opacity.","为什么 β 非常大时难以继续训练 opacity？":"Why is opacity hard to train when β is very large?","sigmoid 接近 1，o(1−o) 接近 0，梯度饱和。":"Sigmoid approaches 1 and o(1−o) approaches zero: the gradient saturates.","多条路径的链式法则":"The chain rule across multiple paths","训练位置时，为什么只乘 Jᵀ 会漏梯度？":"Why does multiplying only by Jᵀ miss part of the position gradient?","先画出同一位置的两条出口":"Draw the two outgoing paths from the same position","三维中心同时决定屏幕均值 μ2D=π(μc) 和 Jacobian J(μc)；后者又决定 C。暂时固定颜色、opacity 和世界协方差。":"The 3D center determines both the screen mean μ2D=π(μc) and the Jacobian J(μc), which determines C. Temporarily hold color, opacity, and world covariance fixed.","先对一个三维坐标分量展开":"Expand one 3D coordinate first","比如 x：loss 随两个均值分量和四个协方差元素变化；每条路径都是“上游梯度×局部斜率”，最后相加。若只存 a,b,c，则按三个独立量写等价求和。":"For x, loss changes through two mean components and four covariance entries. Each path contributes upstream gradient times local slope, and the contributions add. Storing only independent a,b,c gives an equivalent three-term covariance sum.","把 x,y,z 三条式子排成列":"Stack the x, y, and z results into a column","vec 只是按固定顺序把矩阵元素排成向量；一旦两边使用相同顺序，就能把逐项求和写成矩阵乘法。转置负责把输出梯度送回输入。":"vec simply lists matrix entries in a fixed order. Using the same order on both sides turns the sums into a matrix product. Transposes send output gradients back to inputs.","C 的变化本身也有左右两条路":"C itself changes through a left and a right path","C=JΣcJᵀ+εI；δJ 可以出现在左边，也可以出现在右边。Σc 暂时固定，ε 是常数。":"In C=JΣcJᵀ+εI, δJ can appear on either side. Σc is temporarily fixed and ε is constant.","直接给一个均值路径为零的例子":"Examine a case where the mean path is zero","球位于光轴上，x=y=0，均匀世界尺度 s。前后移动不会改变屏幕中心，但投影方差 f²s²/z² 会改变。因此只保留第一项会把深度梯度误算成 0。":"An isotropic Gaussian lies on the optical axis, x=y=0, with world scale s. Moving it in depth leaves the screen center fixed but changes projected variance f²s²/z². Keeping only the first path would incorrectly make its depth gradient zero.","其余可训练参数也沿自己的边连接":"Connect the other trainable parameters along their own paths","回到世界位置需左乘 Rcwᵀ。若训练 log-scale，Σ=∑akakᵀ 且 ak=e^ℓk rk，对 ℓk 求导得到 2akakᵀ；若训练旋转，还需接四元数矩阵及 normalize 的导数。":"Returning to world position requires multiplication by Rcwᵀ. For log-scale, Σ=∑akakᵀ with ak=e^ℓk rk, so differentiating with respect to ℓk gives 2akakᵀ. Training rotation also requires the quaternion-matrix and normalization derivatives.","f=100、s=0.1、z=10，投影方差=1.3；深度变化率为 −0.2。":"f=100, s=0.1, z=10: projected variance is 1.3 and its depth derivative is −0.2.","xyz 同时进入 uv 和 jacobian，这就是两条计算图路径。不要 detach jacobian 后仍声称训练的是完整位置梯度。":"xyz feeds both uv and jacobian, creating both graph paths. Detaching jacobian would no longer yield the complete position gradient.","μc ↔ xyz；μ2D ↔ uv；C ↔ covariance":"μc ↔ xyz; μ2D ↔ uv; C ↔ covariance","实际若颜色依赖观察方向，还要补颜色路径；若 opacity、旋转依赖时间，也要补对应时间路径。排序和硬可见性变化是分段边界。":"View-dependent color adds a color path. Time-dependent opacity or rotation adds its own time path. Sorting and hard visibility changes form piecewise boundaries.","在哪段代码最容易漏掉第二条路径？":"Where is the second path most easily lost in code?","预先缓存或 detach J、C 的训练实现；当前 toy 的 J 由可导 xyz 重新计算。":"Training code that caches or detaches J or C. The current toy implementation recomputes J from differentiable xyz.","分离前缀、本层和尾部":"Separate the prefix, current layer, and tail","让前景更不透明，也会挡住后景；梯度怎样同时记住两件事？":"Increasing foreground opacity also hides the background. How does the gradient include both effects?","固定顺序，只观察第 i 层":"Fix the order and focus on layer i","Ai 表示前面各层已经贡献的颜色；Ti 是到达本层前的透射率；Bi 是从本层之后开始独立合成的尾部颜色，包含背景。":"Ai is the color already contributed by earlier layers. Ti is incoming transmittance. Bi is the independently composited tail after this layer, including the background.","锁住其他层，对 alpha 求导":"Hold the other layers fixed and differentiate alpha","Ai、Ti、ci、Bi 都视为常量。第一项贡献 ci，第二项贡献 −Bi。":"Ai, Ti, ci, and Bi are constant. The first term contributes ci and the second contributes −Bi.","锁住 alpha，对当前颜色求导":"Hold alpha fixed and differentiate this layer’s color","RGB 各通道独立相乘，当前颜色的每一通道只改变输出的同一通道，因此 Jacobian 是系数乘 I3。":"RGB channels multiply independently. Each input color channel changes only the corresponding output channel, so the Jacobian is a scalar times I3.","接上标量 loss":"Attach a scalar loss","像素 loss 的 RGB 梯度是三维列；对 alpha 的梯度是它与颜色差做点积。这样颜色差的正负才正确参与参数更新。":"The pixel-loss RGB gradient is a three-component column. Its dot product with the color difference gives the alpha gradient, preserving each signed contribution during the update.","前景红、后景蓝 alpha=0.5、黑背景；第一层 T1=1，B1=(0,0,0.5)。":"A red foreground, a blue tail with alpha=0.5, and a black background give T1=1 and B1=(0,0,0.5).","autograd 穿过 alpha 的直接颜色贡献和 cumprod 的遮挡贡献；手写 backward 时两者都要保留。":"Autograd traverses both alpha’s direct color contribution and its occlusion contribution through cumprod. A handwritten backward pass must retain both.","Ai/Bi ↔ 合成链前缀/后缀；Ti ↔ transmittance":"Ai/Bi ↔ composition prefix/tail; Ti ↔ transmittance","Bi 是未乘 Ti 的尾部合成颜色。若先乘了前缀再代公式，就把 Ti 乘了两次。":"Bi does not include Ti. Multiplying it by the prefix before substituting would apply Ti twice.","前景颜色和后方合成颜色完全一样时，alpha 的颜色梯度是多少？":"What is the alpha color derivative when foreground color equals the composited tail?","0；增加遮挡不会改变这一个像素的颜色。":"Zero. Increasing occlusion does not change this pixel’s color.","时间链的逐项求导":"Differentiate the time paths term by term","时间、宽度、运动系数分别怎样接收梯度？":"How do time, width, and motion coefficients receive gradients?","给时间核的指数命名":"Name the temporal kernel’s exponent","E=−Δt²/ρ²；固定 τ、ρ 时，Δt 对 t 的导数是 1。先求 E 的导数，再乘外层 w。":"E=−Δt²/ρ². With τ and ρ fixed, the derivative of Δt with respect to t is 1. Differentiate E, then multiply by the outer w.","对 log-width 求导，不是直接对宽度求导":"Differentiate log-width, not width directly","把 ρ=e^ℓτ 代入，E=−Δt²e^(−2ℓτ)。指数求导带出 −2，与前面负号抵消。":"Substitute ρ=e^ℓτ to get E=−Δt²e^(−2ℓτ). Differentiating the exponential produces −2, canceling the leading minus sign.","时间中心的符号相反":"The temporal center has the opposite sign","Δt=t−τ，对 τ 的偏导为 −1；所以只看时间核这条路，τ 的导数与 t 相反。若 τ 同时进入运动，还必须累加运动路径。":"Δt=t−τ has derivative −1 with respect to τ. Along this kernel path alone, the τ derivative is the negative of the t derivative. If τ also affects motion, add that path too.","运动系数只出现在一次乘法里":"Each motion coefficient appears in one multiplication","第 k 阶系数每个分量乘同一个 Δt^k；只影响同一空间分量，因此 Jacobian 是这个标量乘 I3。":"Each component of coefficient k multiplies the same Δt^k and affects only its own spatial component. Its Jacobian is that scalar times I3.","时间变化同时走多条路":"Changing time follows several paths at once","一条改 opacity，一条改位置，还有旋转和可能的特征时间分支。数学导数存在不代表实现一定传递；detach 会有意切断某条边。":"One path changes opacity, another position, and others rotation or temporal features. A mathematical derivative is not necessarily propagated by the implementation: detach deliberately cuts a graph edge.","Δt=ρ=0.25 时 w=e⁻¹。":"At Δt=ρ=0.25, w=e⁻¹.","GPU 前向分别计算 dt、center、quaternion、temporal_opacity；当前 toy 只训练线性 motion，没有训练 τ、ρ 或 ω。":"The GPU forward pass computes dt, center, quaternion, and temporal_opacity separately. The toy trainer trains only linear motion, not τ, ρ, or ω.","τ ↔ r0.w；ℓτ ↔ r1.x；mk ↔ motion 字段":"τ ↔ r0.w; ℓτ ↔ r1.x; mk ↔ motion fields","时间宽度达到 max(exp(log-width),1e−6) 的保护区后，关于 log-width 的实际分支导数不再是未裁剪公式。":"Once max(exp(log-width),1e−6) selects the lower bound, the actual branch derivative with respect to log-width differs from the unclamped formula.","Δt=0 时，一次 motion 参数从这一时刻的图像得到什么位置梯度？":"At Δt=0, what position gradient does this frame supply to the linear motion parameter?","0，因为 ∂μ/∂m1=Δt I=0；需要其他时刻来约束运动。":"Zero, because ∂μ/∂m1=Δt I=0. Other times are needed to constrain motion.","用两次前向验证反向":"Use two forward evaluations to check backward","怎样不用相信手推或 autograd，就独立检查一个梯度？":"How can a gradient be checked independently of a hand derivation or autograd?","一次只改一个参数":"Change one parameter at a time","ek 表示只有第 k 项为 1 的向量。固定图像、相机、时间、其他参数，分别把 θk 增加 h 和减少 h。":"ek has a 1 only in entry k. Hold the image, camera, time, and other parameters fixed. Increase θk by h for one evaluation and decrease it by h for the other.","用中间对称的两点求斜率":"Compute a symmetric two-point slope","两次参数相差 2h，所以分母是 2h。它近似中心处的变化率。":"The parameter values are 2h apart, so the denominator is 2h. This approximates the rate of change at the center.","解释为什么对称差分更准确":"Explain why symmetry improves accuracy","平滑函数局部展开的二次项在相减时抵消；除以 2h 后剩下的主要误差是 h² 级别。O(h²) 表示误差随 h² 缩小的量级，不是精确常数。":"The quadratic terms in a smooth local expansion cancel on subtraction. After division by 2h, the leading truncation error is of order h². O(h²) describes scaling, not an exact constant.","不要把 h 越小越好当口诀":"Smaller h is not always better","过大的 h 有截断误差，过小的 h 会把相近浮点数相减，舍入误差被放大。用 float64，比较 1e−4、1e−5、1e−6 多组，而不是只挑一个看起来好的结果。":"Large h introduces truncation error. Tiny h subtracts nearly equal floating-point values, amplifying rounding error. Use float64 and compare several steps such as 1e−4, 1e−5, and 1e−6 instead of selecting one favorable result.","确保两次前向处在同一个光滑分支":"Keep both forward evaluations on the same smooth branch","深度换序、clip/cutoff 边界、alpha 上限、零范数会使局部光滑假设失效。不要通过放宽容差隐藏这类变化；先选稳定例子，再单独测试分支。":"Depth reordering, clip/cutoff boundaries, alpha caps, and zero norms invalidate local smoothness. Do not hide such changes by loosening tolerance. Check a stable example first, then test branches separately.","把解析梯度用于一次小更新后，再跑前向。下降只能作为额外检查，不能替代逐参数有限差分。":"After a small update using the analytic gradient, evaluate forward again. A decrease is an extra check, not a substitute for finite differences on each parameter.","现有数值检查分别验证均值、协方差独立项、logit、时间和归一化导数。新增像素实验还检查包含 C 路径的完整位置梯度。":"Existing checks cover means, independent covariance entries, logits, time, and normalization. The pixel lab also checks the full position gradient including the C path.","gFD ↔ finiteJacobian；解析值 ↔ expected":"gFD ↔ finiteJacobian; analytic value ↔ expected","单个标量通过检查不等于完整 CUDA/WGSL backward 正确。本页检查数学与教学代码，当前 WGSL 没有训练 backward。":"Checking one scalar does not establish that an entire CUDA/WGSL backward pass is correct. This page tests mathematics and teaching code; the current WGSL has no training backward pass.","analytic=0、finite difference≈0 时只算相对误差有什么问题？":"Why is relative error alone misleading when both gradients are near zero?","分母接近 0，比例会失真；需要绝对误差与带尺度下限的误差一起看。":"Its denominator is near zero. Inspect absolute error and an error scaled with a nonzero lower bound together.","从初中数学出发，逐步推导 39 组 4D Gaussian 公式，打通 PyTorch 训练、PLY 参数、Rust/wgpu 与 WGSL 渲染。":"Derive 39 groups of 4D Gaussian equations from school mathematics, connecting PyTorch training, PLY parameters, Rust/wgpu, and WGSL rendering.","4D Gaussian 数学手册 · 从推导到代码":"4D Gaussian Math Handbook · From Derivation to Code","跳到基础数学":"Skip to foundations","主导航":"Main navigation","打印 / 存为 PDF":"Print / Save PDF","章节目录":"Chapter navigation","先补基础数学":"Math foundations","一个像素的完整旅程":"One pixel, end to end","符号与学习顺序":"Notation & learning path","高斯、尺度与旋转":"Gaussians, scale & rotation","相机、Jacobian 与投影":"Camera, Jacobian & projection","屏幕椭圆与覆盖":"Screen ellipse & coverage","Alpha 与体渲染":"Alpha & volume rendering","STG 的时间与运动":"STG time & motion","形变网络与四维条件化":"Deformation & 4D conditioning","颜色、SH 与特征":"Color, SH & features","损失与反向传播":"Loss & backpropagation","自测与源码地图":"Exercises & source map","论文与原始资料 ↗":"Papers & primary sources ↗","不跳步，从数字到像素":"Every step, from numbers to pixels","推导 → 算例 → 真实源码":"Derivation → Example → Actual code","每一步，":"Every step,","都能":"made ","算出来。":"clear.","从分数、平方和方程开始，走完一颗 Gaussian 的旅程。":"Start with fractions, squares, and equations. Follow one Gaussian all the way through.","读懂它如何随时间移动，变成像素，再从误差中学会改变。":"Understand how it moves through time, becomes pixels, and learns from its errors.","39 组公式，逐条推导":"39 equation groups, fully derived","8 个基础工具":"8 mathematical foundations","可运行像素实验":"Interactive pixel lab","01 / 补基础":"01 / FOUNDATIONS","为什么":"Why","02 / 逐步推":"02 / DERIVATION","怎么算":"How","03 / 看数字":"03 / NUMBERS","跑一遍":"Run it","04 / 对源码":"04 / SOURCE","连起来":"Connect","建议第一次按“基础 → 01–05 → 08 → 像素实验”阅读；06–07 用于比较其他表示。每个公式的“从零推导”可展开，源码链接对应本次部署的文件快照。打印会自动包含完整推导与答案。":"For a first reading, follow Foundations → 01–05 → 08 → Pixel Lab. Sections 06–07 compare other representations. Expand “Derive from scratch” under each equation; source links open snapshots from this deployment. Printing automatically includes full derivations and answers.","按公式跳转":"Jump to equation","选择要推导的公式…":"Choose an equation to derive…","01 · 三维 Gaussian 核":"01 · The 3D Gaussian kernel","02 · 存储参数 → 有效参数":"02 · Stored parameters → valid parameters","03 · 协方差的安全参数化":"03 · A safe covariance parameterization","04 · 单位四元数与旋转矩阵":"04 · Unit quaternions and rotation matrices","05 · 世界 → 相机":"05 · World → camera","06 · 针孔投影":"06 · Pinhole projection","07 · 对投影求偏导":"07 · Partial derivatives of projection","08 · 先证明线性变换的协方差":"08 · First prove covariance under a linear transform","09 · 一阶线性化与屏幕协方差":"09 · First-order linearization and screen covariance","10 · 与 WGSL 对齐的齐次坐标导数":"10 · Homogeneous-coordinate derivatives matching WGSL","11 · 2×2 协方差的逆":"11 · The inverse of a 2×2 covariance","12 · Mahalanobis 距离与像素 alpha":"12 · Mahalanobis distance and pixel alpha","13 · 椭圆主轴与标准差":"13 · Ellipse principal axes and standard deviations","14 · 由 alpha 阈值推覆盖范围":"14 · Derive coverage from an alpha threshold","15 · 前向透射率":"15 · Forward transmittance","16 · 最终像素颜色，包含背景":"16 · Final pixel color, including background","17 · 远→近的预乘 over 操作":"17 · Premultiplied over in far-to-near order","18 · 与体渲染的联系":"18 · Connection to volume rendering","19 · 物理秒与模型时间":"19 · Physical seconds and model time","20 · STG-Lite 的时间核":"20 · The STG-Lite temporal kernel","21 · 三次运动轨迹":"21 · A cubic motion trajectory","22 · 速度取决于时间单位":"22 · Velocity depends on time units","23 · 四元数的一阶时间模型":"23 · A first-order quaternion time model","24 · 归一化的 Jacobian":"24 · The Jacobian of normalization","25 · 参数形变的概念接口":"25 · A conceptual parameter-deformation interface","26 · 四维联合协方差的分块":"26 · Block structure of a joint 4D covariance","27 · 条件 Gaussian：均值与 Schur 补":"27 · Conditional Gaussian: mean and Schur complement","28 · 空间条件核 × 时间边缘核":"28 · Conditional spatial kernel × marginal temporal kernel","29 · 一个可手算的条件化例子":"29 · A conditioning example you can calculate by hand","30 · 静态 3DGS 常用的方向外观":"30 · Directional appearance commonly used in static 3DGS","31 · 先合成特征，再解码":"31 · Composite features first, then decode","32 · 常见的 photometric 目标":"32 · A common photometric objective","33 · Gaussian 核对投影均值的梯度":"33 · Gaussian-kernel gradient with respect to the projected mean","34 · 对屏幕协方差的梯度":"34 · Gradient with respect to screen covariance","35 · 对 opacity logit 的梯度":"35 · Gradient with respect to the opacity logit","36 · 位置梯度不只有投影均值这一条路":"36 · Position gradients have more than the projected-mean path","37 · 合成对 alpha 与颜色的梯度":"37 · Composition gradients for alpha and color","38 · 时间核与运动系数的导数":"38 · Derivatives of the temporal kernel and motion coefficients","39 · 用有限差分检验一个梯度":"39 · Check a gradient with finite differences","展开全部推导":"Expand all derivations","收起全部推导":"Collapse all derivations","先补 8 个工具，每次只多走一步。":"Eight tools. One small step at a time.","只预设你会四则运算、分数、平方和解简单方程。向量、矩阵、指数、导数都在这里引入。后面的“定义 / 模型选择”不是从某条物理定律必然推出的；“恒等式”可以代数证明；“近似”会写出适用范围。":"Only arithmetic, fractions, squares, and simple equations are assumed. Vectors, matrices, exponentials, and derivatives are introduced here. A “definition / modeling choice” is not an inevitable physical law; an “identity” can be proved algebraically; an “approximation” comes with a stated scope.","A · 向量、点积、长度：一串数怎样参加运算？":"A · Vectors, dot products, and length: calculating with a list of numbers","向量先当作一列数。位置 (3,4) 表示向右 3、向上 4；相加就是每项相加。粗体表示整列，普通字母表示一个数。点积把对应项相乘再相加；勾股定理给出长度。转置 T 只把列改成行，不改变数值。":"Think of a vector as a column of numbers. Position (3,4) means 3 right and 4 up; addition works entry by entry. Bold symbols denote the whole column, ordinary letters a single number. A dot product multiplies matching entries and sums them. Pythagoras gives the length. Transpose T turns a column into a row without changing its values.","推导公式，可横向滚动":"Derivation equation; scroll horizontally","“归一化”在这里指除以长度，结果长度为 1；不是把每个坐标都变成 1。分母为 0 时没有方向，不能归一化。外积则保留所有两两乘积，产出一张表：":"Here, “normalize” means divide by length to obtain length 1, not make every coordinate 1. A zero denominator has no direction and cannot be normalized. An outer product instead keeps every pairwise product in a table:","求和符号 ∑ 就是把指定范围内的项全部加起来；连乘符号 ∏ 则把它们全部乘起来。":"The ∑ symbol adds all terms in the specified range; ∏ multiplies them all.","B · 矩阵：把很多条一次方程装进表格":"B · Matrices: a table of linear equations","矩阵乘列向量，就是每一行与这列做一次点积。2×3 表示 2 行 3 列；把 3 个输入变成 2 个输出。矩阵乘法 AB 表示先做 B 再做 A，一般不能交换。":"Multiplying a matrix by a column vector takes one dot product per row. A 2×3 matrix has 2 rows and 3 columns, turning 3 inputs into 2 outputs. AB means apply B first, then A; the order generally cannot be swapped.","I 是原样输出的单位矩阵；逆矩阵是撤销一次变换。不可撤销（例如把某一维压成 0）就没有逆矩阵。旋转保持长度，因此逆旋转等于转置。diag 表示只在对角线上放数，其余为 0。":"I is the identity matrix: it returns the input unchanged. An inverse undoes a transformation. An irreversible transformation, such as collapsing a dimension to zero, has no inverse. A rotation preserves length, so its inverse is its transpose. diag puts numbers on the diagonal and zeros elsewhere.","C · 指数与对数：从反复相乘到连续增长":"C · Exponentials and logarithms: from repeated multiplication to continuous growth","2³ 是 2 连乘 3 次；2⁻³ 是它的倒数；2^(1/2) 是 √2。把“份数”继续细分，可以定义任意实数指数。e≈2.71828 是特殊的底数：它的增长率恰好等于自己。ln 是指数的反操作，可用计算器。":"2³ multiplies three copies of 2; 2⁻³ is its reciprocal; 2^(1/2) is √2. Subdividing exponents more finely extends the definition to real numbers. e≈2.71828 is a special base whose rate of growth equals its own value. ln reverses exponentiation; a calculator can evaluate it.","指数永远为正。负平方放在指数上，离 0 越远就越接近 0，这就是 Gaussian 的形状。ln 在正数范围单调递增，所以不等式两边取 ln 不会改变方向。":"An exponential is always positive. A negative square in the exponent makes the value approach zero as its input moves away from zero, giving the Gaussian shape. ln is increasing on positive numbers, so taking ln on both sides preserves an inequality’s direction.","为什么 e 的导数还是 e？从 e=lim(1+1/n)ⁿ 引入的实数指数有 lim(h→0)(eʰ−1)/h=1。这个极限是这里新增的基础事实；结合指数乘法规则，就能推出后面使用的导数。":"Why is the derivative of eˣ still eˣ? Real exponentiation introduced through e=lim(1+1/n)ⁿ satisfies lim(h→0)(eʰ−1)/h=1. We introduce this limit as a foundational fact here. Combined with the exponent addition rule, it gives the derivative used below.","D · 均值、方差与协方差：用“平均乘积”描述形状":"D · Mean, variance, and covariance: shape through average products","平均值就是总和除以个数。方差是“偏离平均值的距离的平方”的平均，不是平均距离。E 读作期望，这里先理解为大量样本的平均；Cov 是协方差。我们描述分布，分母用 N；样本无偏估计的 N−1 是另一个问题。":"The mean is the total divided by the count. Variance averages squared deviations from the mean, not distances themselves. E denotes expectation; initially, think of it as an average over many samples. Cov denotes covariance. We describe a distribution using denominator N; the N−1 in unbiased sample estimation is a separate issue.","样本 (1,2)、(3,6) 的均值为 (2,4)。偏移为 (−1,−2)、(1,2)，两张外积表相同：":"Samples (1,2) and (3,6) have mean (2,4). Their offsets are (−1,−2) and (1,2), producing identical outer-product tables:","对角元素是各轴方差；非对角元素表示两个方向是否一起偏大。这里两点共线，所以矩阵不可逆。GS 用三个正尺度和旋转构造有厚度的椭球。“正定”就是任意非零方向上的方差都大于 0。":"Diagonal entries give axis variances; off-diagonal entries indicate whether two coordinates tend to increase together. These two samples are collinear, so their matrix is singular. GS constructs a full ellipsoid from three positive scales and a rotation. “Positive definite” means positive variance in every nonzero direction.","E · 导数与偏导：从两点之间的斜率开始":"E · Derivatives and partial derivatives: start with a two-point slope","汽车走了 Δ路程、用了 Δ时间，比值就是平均速度。把间隔 h 越缩越小，得到某一刻的变化率，记作 df/dx。不是令 h=0 后除以 0，而是观察 h 接近 0 时的比值。":"A car travels Δdistance in Δtime; their ratio is average velocity. Shrinking interval h gives an instantaneous rate of change, written df/dx. We do not set h=0 and divide by zero; we examine the ratio as h approaches zero.","偏导数 ∂ 是“先锁住其他输入，只改一个”。函数有多个输出时，把每个输出对每个输入的偏导排成表，叫 Jacobian。函数只有一个输出时，各偏导组成的列叫梯度 ∇。":"A partial derivative ∂ holds all other inputs fixed and changes just one. With multiple outputs, arrange each output’s derivative with respect to each input in a table called the Jacobian. For one scalar output, the column of partial derivatives is its gradient ∇.","乘法法则来自 (f+Δf)(g+Δg) 展开，除以 h 后 ΔfΔg/h 趋于 0。用它对 g·(1/g)=1 求导，得到倒数法则；再组合成商法则：":"The product rule follows by expanding (f+Δf)(g+Δg): after division by h, ΔfΔg/h tends to zero. Apply it to g·(1/g)=1 to derive the reciprocal rule, then combine the rules to obtain the quotient rule:","F · 链式法则、反向传播与一步更新":"F · Chain rule, backpropagation, and one update","输入多 0.01，让中间量多约 0.03；中间量每多 1 又让输出多约 5。总变化就是 3×5×0.01。这叫链式法则：沿一条路线相乘，多条路线相加。":"An input increase of 0.01 raises an intermediate value by about 0.03. Each unit increase in that intermediate value raises the output by about 5. The total change is 3×5×0.01. This is the chain rule: multiply along each path and add across paths.","“反向”是从最终误差向输入传斜率。一个量被使用两次，两条路的贡献都要加。若梯度为正，减小参数能在足够小的步长下减小误差：":"“Backward” sends slopes from the final error toward the inputs. If a value is used twice, add both paths’ contributions. A positive gradient means decreasing the parameter reduces error for a sufficiently small step:","η 是学习率。PyTorch 的 backward 负责算梯度；optimizer.step 才修改参数。上面是 SGD，项目教学训练器使用带历史平均和自适应步长的 Adam，两者不是同一个更新式。":"η is the learning rate. PyTorch backward calculates gradients; optimizer.step changes parameters. This example uses SGD. The project’s teaching trainer uses Adam, with historical averages and adaptive steps, so its update equation differs.","G · 配方与求根：条件高斯和椭圆共用的代数":"G · Completing the square and finding roots: algebra shared by ellipses and conditional Gaussians","把一次项吸收进平方，叫配方。直接展开右侧可以验证；这也是后面消掉时空交叉项的办法。":"Absorbing a linear term into a square is called completing the square. Expand the right-hand side to verify it. We later use the same idea to remove space–time cross terms.","解 λ²−sλ+p=0：先把常数移到右边，两边加 (s/2)²，再开平方；平方根有正负两支。":"To solve λ²−sλ+p=0, move the constant to the right, add (s/2)² on both sides, and take square roots. Remember both positive and negative branches.","矩阵版本也是逐项乘开。不要因为出现粗体就放弃手算：2×2 逆矩阵只需要解两组二元一次方程。":"The matrix version also follows by multiplying out each term. Bold symbols need not stop a hand calculation: a 2×2 inverse only requires solving two pairs of linear equations.","H · 积分与球面：把很多小块加起来":"H · Integrals and the sphere: adding many small pieces","路程可以用很多小段“速度×时间”相加；小段无限细时，和的极限记作积分。积分号右侧的 ds 提醒我们每块的宽度是什么，单位不能丢。":"Distance can be approximated by summing many small velocity×time segments. As they become arbitrarily fine, the sum’s limit is an integral. The ds beside the integral identifies each piece’s width; keep track of its units.","球谐还会用单位球面。方向 v=(x,y,z) 满足 x²+y²+z²=1；经纬角的正弦、余弦可理解为单位圆上点的两个坐标。球面上的“平均”按小面积加权。单位球面积为 4π；由面积元素 sinθ·dθ·dφ 积分得到。":"Spherical harmonics use the unit sphere. A direction v=(x,y,z) satisfies x²+y²+z²=1. Sines and cosines of angular coordinates can be understood through points on a unit circle. A spherical average weights small surface areas. Integrating sinθ·dθ·dφ gives the unit sphere’s area, 4π.","最后一个积分用 cos 的导数是 −sin：内层等于 [−cosθ] 从 0 到 π 的差，即 2。完整三角函数理论不是 GS 上手的前置门槛；知道它表示方向、能计算基函数，就可以先跑通颜色求和。":"The final integral uses the fact that the derivative of cos is −sin: the inner integral is [−cosθ] from 0 to π, giving 2. Full trigonometric theory need not block your first GS implementation. Understand direction, evaluate the basis functions, and you can begin summing color.","先约定符号，再推公式。":"Agree on notation, then derive.","基础":"FOUNDATION","空间用三维列向量，时间用独立的标量。先理解共同的投影与合成，再选择具体动态表示。":"Space uses 3D column vectors; time is a separate scalar. Understand the shared projection and composition first, then choose a dynamic representation.","世界坐标中的 Gaussian 中心，3×1":"Gaussian center in world coordinates, 3×1","空间协方差，3×3；单位是长度平方":"Spatial covariance, 3×3; units of length squared","屏幕协方差，2×2；单位是像素平方":"Screen covariance, 2×2; units of pixels squared","归一化时间、时间中心、时间核宽度":"Normalized time, temporal center, temporal kernel width","像素处 alpha、到达该层前的透射率":"Pixel alpha; transmittance before this layer","旋转/线性变换、投影 Jacobian":"Rotation / linear transform; projection Jacobian","参数与协方差":"Parameters & covariance","相机与投影":"Camera & projection","椭圆与合成":"Ellipse & composition","时间与运动":"Time & motion","损失与梯度":"Loss & gradients","“4DGS”是方法族":"“4DGS” is a family of methods","STG-Lite 用时间核与运动多项式；形变网络预测随时间变化的三维参数；原生四维高斯对联合时空分布做条件化。下文分别标注，不能把三者的参数文件或公式直接互换。":"STG-Lite uses a temporal kernel and motion polynomials. Deformation networks predict time-varying 3D parameters. Native 4D Gaussians condition a joint space–time distribution. The sections identify each approach separately; their parameter files and equations are not interchangeable.","原始资料":"PRIMARY SOURCES","用协方差描述一个椭球。":"Describe an ellipsoid with covariance.","必会":"ESSENTIAL","中心决定位置，协方差决定形状与方向，不透明度决定该基函数对图像的贡献。":"The center determines position, covariance determines shape and orientation, and opacity controls the basis function’s contribution to the image.","三维 Gaussian 核":"The 3D Gaussian kernel","复制 三维 Gaussian 核 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: The 3D Gaussian kernel","复制 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX","三维 Gaussian 核，较长公式可横向滚动":"The 3D Gaussian kernel; scroll horizontally for long equations","这里是未归一化的核，不是概率密度。Splat 的 opacity 单独学习，不能额外乘概率密度归一化系数后仍期待相同亮度。":"This is an unnormalized kernel, not a probability density. Splat opacity is learned separately. Adding a probability-density normalization factor will change brightness.","从零推导":"Derive from scratch","5 步 · 数字算例 · 源码 · 自测":"5 steps · Worked example · Code · Check","用到的小工具":"Tools used","A 向量":"A Vectors","B 矩阵":"B Matrices","C 指数":"C Exponentials","代入数字，亲手核对":"Substitute numbers and check","这一步在代码里在哪里？":"Where is this step in the code?","实际源码片段":"Actual source excerpt","边界与易错点":"Boundaries & common mistakes","停下来想一想：点改成 (4,0,0)，权重是多少？":"Pause and think: What is the weight at (4,0,0)?","带着这条公式，查看完整像素算例 →":"Follow this equation through the complete pixel example →","存储参数 → 有效参数":"Stored parameters → valid parameters","复制 存储参数 → 有效参数 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Stored parameters → valid parameters","存储参数 → 有效参数，较长公式可横向滚动":"Stored parameters → valid parameters; scroll horizontally for long equations","log-scale 保证理论尺度为正；sigmoid 将基准 opacity 映射到 0–1。实际实现仍需防止溢出与下溢。":"Log-scale guarantees a theoretically positive scale; sigmoid maps base opacity to 0–1. Implementations still need protection against overflow and underflow.","4 步 · 数字算例 · 源码 · 自测":"4 steps · Worked example · Code · Check","停下来想一想：scale_0=0 表示零尺寸吗？":"Pause and think: Does scale_0=0 mean zero size?","协方差的安全参数化":"A safe covariance parameterization","复制 协方差的安全参数化 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A safe covariance parameterization","协方差的安全参数化，较长公式可横向滚动":"A safe covariance parameterization; scroll horizontally for long equations","rₖ 是旋转矩阵的第 k 列。正尺度时 Σ 正定；轴向量外积求和与矩阵乘法等价，适合直接写进 shader。":"rₖ is column k of the rotation matrix. Positive scales make Σ positive definite. Summing axis outer products is equivalent to the matrix product and convenient for shaders.","D 方差":"D Variance","停下来想一想：整体位置平移 10 米会改变 Σ 吗？":"Pause and think: Does translating everything by 10 meters change Σ?","单位四元数与旋转矩阵":"Unit quaternions and rotation matrices","复制 单位四元数与旋转矩阵 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Unit quaternions and rotation matrices","单位四元数与旋转矩阵，较长公式可横向滚动":"Unit quaternions and rotation matrices; scroll horizontally for long equations","这里采用 q=(w,x,y,z)、右手系、主动旋转与列向量，且 ‖q‖=1。内存中的行/列布局和参考实现可能采用转置约定；最终应比较轴向量和 Σ，而非只比较名为 R 的数组。":"Conventions here are q=(w,x,y,z), right-handed coordinates, active rotations, column vectors, and ‖q‖=1. Memory layouts and reference code may use transposed conventions. Compare the resulting axis vectors and Σ, rather than just arrays named R.","停下来想一想：q=(1,0,0,0) 得到什么？":"Pause and think: What does q=(1,0,0,0) produce?","代码对应":"Code connection","src/splat.wgsl → quaternion、axis0/1/2。当前 renderer 通过三个轴的外积构建协方差；不要仅因注释里的转置就改变矩阵。":"src/splat.wgsl → quaternion and axis0/1/2. This renderer builds covariance from three axis outer products. Do not change a matrix based only on a transpose mentioned in a comment.","本次部署源码 · splat.wgsl ↗":"Deployed source · splat.wgsl ↗","把三维不确定性投影到屏幕。":"Project 3D uncertainty onto the screen.","必推":"DERIVE IT","本节推导采用 OpenCV 风格相机轴：x 向右、y 向下、z 向前。与 wgpu 的视图和裁剪空间衔接时，需要显式处理轴向和投影约定。":"This derivation uses OpenCV-style camera axes: x right, y down, z forward. Connecting it to wgpu view and clip spaces requires explicit axis and projection conventions.","世界 → 相机":"World → camera","复制 世界 → 相机 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: World → camera","世界 → 相机，较长公式可横向滚动":"World → camera; scroll horizontally for long equations","下标 cw 明确表示 world→camera。相机中心不是平移项 t；camera→world 位姿需要先求逆。":"The subscript cw explicitly means world→camera. The camera center is not translation t; invert a camera→world pose before use.","停下来想一想：相机向右移动 1，静止物体的相机 x 怎样变化？":"Pause and think: If the camera moves right by 1, what happens to a stationary object’s camera-space x?","针孔投影":"Pinhole projection","复制 针孔投影 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Pinhole projection","针孔投影，较长公式可横向滚动":"Pinhole projection; scroll horizontally for long equations","fx、fy 是像素单位焦距；cx、cy 是主点。此处忽略镜头畸变，标定与缩放后的图像内参必须一致。":"fx and fy are focal lengths in pixels; cx and cy give the principal point. Lens distortion is omitted here. Calibration and resized-image intrinsics must agree.","停下来想一想：fx 增加一倍，主点不变时会怎样？":"Pause and think: What happens if fx doubles while the principal point stays fixed?","对投影求偏导":"Partial derivatives of projection","复制 对投影求偏导 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Partial derivatives of projection","对投影求偏导，较长公式可横向滚动":"Partial derivatives of projection; scroll horizontally for long equations","E 导数":"E Derivatives","停下来想一想：位于光轴 x=y=0 时，J 的第三列为什么全是 0？":"Pause and think: Why is the third column zero when x=y=0 on the optical axis?","先证明线性变换的协方差":"First prove covariance under a linear transform","复制 先证明线性变换的协方差 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: First prove covariance under a linear transform","先证明线性变换的协方差，较长公式可横向滚动":"First prove covariance under a linear transform; scroll horizontally for long equations","由 Y−E[Y]=A(X−μ)，再对外积取期望得到。平移消去，因此不影响协方差。":"Use Y−E[Y]=A(X−μ), then take the expected outer product. Translation cancels and therefore does not affect covariance.","停下来想一想：一维尺度放大 3 倍，方差放大几倍？":"Pause and think: If a 1D length scale triples, how much does the variance grow?","一阶线性化与屏幕协方差":"First-order linearization and screen covariance","复制 一阶线性化与屏幕协方差 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: First-order linearization and screen covariance","一阶线性化与屏幕协方差，较长公式可横向滚动":"First-order linearization and screen covariance; scroll horizontally for long equations","J 在 Gaussian 中心处求值。ε 是像素方差；当前 shader 使用 0.3。透视是非线性的，所以这是一阶近似，不是任意透视变换都精确保留 Gaussian。":"Evaluate J at the Gaussian center. ε is a pixel variance; the current shader uses 0.3. Perspective is nonlinear, so this is a first-order approximation. Arbitrary perspective transforms do not exactly preserve Gaussians.","停下来想一想：为什么主点 cx、cy 不出现在 C 里？":"Pause and think: Why do cx and cy not appear in C?","与 WGSL 对齐的齐次坐标导数":"Homogeneous-coordinate derivatives matching WGSL","复制 与 WGSL 对齐的齐次坐标导数 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Homogeneous-coordinate derivatives matching WGSL","与 WGSL 对齐的齐次坐标导数，较长公式可横向滚动":"Homogeneous-coordinate derivatives matching WGSL; scroll horizontally for long equations","h=PV[μ,1]ᵀ，δh=PV[aₖ,0]ᵀ。将导数按 viewport 尺寸换成像素，再对三条投影轴做外积求和。这个形式把视图坐标的符号差异包含在 P、V 中。":"h=PV[μ,1]ᵀ and δh=PV[aₖ,0]ᵀ. Convert derivatives to pixels using viewport dimensions, then sum the three projected-axis outer products. P and V incorporate view-coordinate sign conventions in this form.","停下来想一想：轴的齐次末位为什么是 0？":"Pause and think: Why is the homogeneous coordinate of an axis 0?","手算检查":"Check by hand","fx=fy=100，中心为 (1,2,10)，Σc=diag(1,4,9)：":"fx=fy=100, center (1,2,10), Σc=diag(1,4,9):","非零的交叉项来自离轴投影。即使三维协方差是对角矩阵，投影椭圆也可能发生旋转。":"The nonzero cross term comes from off-axis projection. Even a diagonal 3D covariance can project to a rotated ellipse.","COLMAP · 相机坐标约定 ↗":"COLMAP · Camera conventions ↗","从协方差到一个像素的权重。":"From covariance to one pixel’s weight.","协方差告诉我们形状；逆协方差定义到中心的“加权距离”。":"Covariance describes shape; inverse covariance defines a weighted distance from the center.","2×2 协方差的逆":"The inverse of a 2×2 covariance","复制 2×2 协方差的逆 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: The inverse of a 2×2 covariance","2×2 协方差的逆，较长公式可横向滚动":"The inverse of a 2×2 covariance; scroll horizontally for long equations","正定要求 a>0、ac−b²>0。接近奇异时，逆矩阵会放大误差；需要与 renderer 一致的滤波和数值下限。":"Positive definiteness requires a>0 and ac−b²>0. A nearly singular inverse amplifies errors; filtering and numerical bounds must match the renderer.","停下来想一想：C=diag(4,9) 的逆是什么？":"Pause and think: What is the inverse of C=diag(4,9)?","Mahalanobis 距离与像素 alpha":"Mahalanobis distance and pixel alpha","复制 Mahalanobis 距离与像素 alpha 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Mahalanobis distance and pixel alpha","Mahalanobis 距离与像素 alpha，较长公式可横向滚动":"Mahalanobis distance and pixel alpha; scroll horizontally for long equations","空间核指数含 1/2。当前 fragment shader 另做 alpha≤0.99 和 alpha<1/255 的丢弃；以下训练推导先忽略这些分段操作。":"The spatial exponent includes 1/2. The fragment shader also caps alpha at 0.99 and discards alpha<1/255. The training derivations initially set aside these piecewise operations.","停下来想一想：local=(0,0) 时 alpha 一定等于 1 吗？":"Pause and think: Must alpha equal 1 at local=(0,0)?","椭圆主轴与标准差":"Ellipse principal axes and standard deviations","复制 椭圆主轴与标准差 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Ellipse principal axes and standard deviations","椭圆主轴与标准差，较长公式可横向滚动":"Ellipse principal axes and standard deviations; scroll horizontally for long equations","特征向量是主轴方向，√λ 是对应方向的像素标准差。k=3 给出常用的 3σ 覆盖；当前实现对 sigma 额外设了 192px 上限。":"Eigenvectors give principal directions; √λ is the pixel standard deviation along each direction. k=3 gives the common 3σ extent. The current implementation additionally caps sigma at 192px.","G 配方":"G Completing the square","停下来想一想：C=diag(9,4)，3σ 椭圆半轴多长？":"Pause and think: For C=diag(9,4), how long are the 3σ semiaxes?","由 alpha 阈值推覆盖范围":"Derive coverage from an alpha threshold","复制 由 alpha 阈值推覆盖范围 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Derive coverage from an alpha threshold","由 alpha 阈值推覆盖范围，较长公式可横向滚动":"Derive coverage from an alpha threshold; scroll horizontally for long equations","仅在 o(t)≥αmin 时有非空范围。固定 3σ quad 与阈值支持集不完全相同；“Gaussian 理论无限支持”与有限 GPU footprint 需要区分。":"Coverage is nonempty only when o(t)≥αmin. A fixed 3σ quad differs from the threshold support. Distinguish the Gaussian’s theoretically infinite support from the finite GPU footprint.","停下来想一想：o 正好等于 αmin 时，数学上哪里还能保留？":"Pause and think: If o equals αmin exactly, which points pass the mathematical threshold?","为什么透明度必须按顺序合成。":"Why transparency must be composited in order.","下式按近→远排列。颜色与 alpha 的贡献受前面所有层的透射率影响。":"The equations below use near-to-far order. All previous layers affect each layer’s color contribution through transmittance.","前向透射率":"Forward transmittance","复制 前向透射率 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Forward transmittance","前向透射率，较长公式可横向滚动":"Forward transmittance; scroll horizontally for long equations","停下来想一想：若第一层 alpha=1，后面的 Ti 是多少？":"Pause and think: If the first alpha is 1, what are all subsequent Ti values?","最终像素颜色，包含背景":"Final pixel color, including background","复制 最终像素颜色，包含背景 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Final pixel color, including background","最终像素颜色，包含背景，较长公式可横向滚动":"Final pixel color, including background; scroll horizontally for long equations","停下来想一想：为什么权重不一定加起来等于 1？":"Pause and think: Why might the weights appear not to sum to 1?","远→近的预乘 over 操作":"Premultiplied over in far-to-near order","复制 远→近的预乘 over 操作 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Premultiplied over in far-to-near order","远→近的预乘 over 操作，较长公式可横向滚动":"Premultiplied over in far-to-near order; scroll horizontally for long equations","graphics pipeline 使用远→近顺序时，shader 输出 RGB×alpha，再配置 premultiplied blending。重复乘 SrcAlpha 会让颜色额外变暗。":"For a far-to-near graphics pipeline, the shader outputs RGB×alpha and uses premultiplied blending. Multiplying by SrcAlpha again makes colors incorrectly darker.","停下来想一想：预乘颜色仍要乘 Ti 吗？":"Pause and think: Does premultiplied color still need Ti?","红在前":"Red in front","蓝在前":"Blue in front","红、蓝两层 alpha 都为 0.5，背景为黑。交换顺序改变结果，所以普通 atomic-add 不能代替有序透明合成。":"Both layers have alpha 0.5 over black. Swapping their order changes the result, so ordinary atomic-add cannot replace ordered transparency composition.","与体渲染的联系":"Connection to volume rendering","复制 与体渲染的联系 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Connection to volume rendering","与体渲染的联系，较长公式可横向滚动":"Connection to volume rendering; scroll horizontally for long equations","第二式来自分段恒定密度的射线积分，帮助理解 transmittance。3DGS 通常直接学习 opacity 并评估投影核，不能把它说成对每个三维 Gaussian 都做了精确物理射线积分。":"The second equation integrates piecewise constant density along a ray and helps explain transmittance. 3DGS usually learns opacity directly and evaluates a projected kernel; it does not perform an exact physical ray integral through each 3D Gaussian.","H 积分":"H Integrals","停下来想一想：若把一段恒密度路程平分两半，总透过率会变吗？":"Pause and think: Does splitting a constant-density segment in half change total transmittance?","排序边界":"Limits of sorting","全局中心深度与 tile 内排序可以使用相同的中心深度 key。Tile 分桶降低遍历成本，但不会自动解决相交 Gaussian 的精确逐像素遮挡。":"Global sorting and per-tile sorting can use the same center-depth key. Tile binning reduces traversal cost but does not automatically resolve exact per-pixel occlusion for intersecting Gaussians.","NeRF · 体渲染背景 ↗":"NeRF · Volume-rendering background ↗","让位置、旋转和可见性随时间变化。":"Let position, rotation, and visibility change with time.","项目核心":"PROJECT CORE","下面采用本项目 PLY/WGSL 的实际参数化。归一化时间 t 不自动等于物理秒。":"The following equations use this project’s actual PLY/WGSL parameterization. Normalized time t does not automatically mean physical seconds.","物理秒与模型时间":"Physical seconds and model time","复制 物理秒与模型时间 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Physical seconds and model time","物理秒与模型时间，较长公式可横向滚动":"Physical seconds and model time; scroll horizontally for long equations","D 是有来源的时间尺度。例如 loader 使用 frame/N 时，通常需与 N/fps 对齐，而不是擅自换成最后一帧时间。当前研究模型 PLY 不携带 fps/时长，播放器的 10 秒映射仍需追溯验证。":"D must come from a documented time convention. For a loader using frame/N, it typically aligns with N/fps, not arbitrarily with the final frame’s timestamp. The current research-model PLY contains no fps or duration; the player’s 10-second mapping still needs provenance verification.","停下来想一想：同一个模型以两倍播放速度播放，运动系数需要改吗？":"Pause and think: Must motion coefficients change to play the same model at double speed?","STG-Lite 的时间核":"The STG-Lite temporal kernel","复制 STG-Lite 的时间核 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: The STG-Lite temporal kernel","STG-Lite 的时间核，较长公式可横向滚动":"The STG-Lite temporal kernel; scroll horizontally for long equations","注意指数没有 1/2。若用标准 Gaussian 的标准差 σt 表示同一核，则 σt=ρ/√2。论文写 exp(−sτ·Δt²)，这里 sτ=ρ⁻²；代码对 ρ 还有最小值保护。":"There is no 1/2 in this exponent. Expressing the same kernel with a standard Gaussian deviation gives σt=ρ/√2. The paper writes exp(−sτ·Δt²), where sτ=ρ⁻² here. The code also applies a lower bound to ρ.","停下来想一想：把 ρ 加倍，在同样 Δt 下指数平方项变成几分之一？":"Pause and think: If ρ doubles at the same Δt, what happens to the squared term in the exponent?","三次运动轨迹":"A cubic motion trajectory","复制 三次运动轨迹 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A cubic motion trajectory","三次运动轨迹，较长公式可横向滚动":"A cubic motion trajectory; scroll horizontally for long equations","停下来想一想：Δt=0 时 motion 再大，中心是什么？":"Pause and think: At Δt=0, where is the center even if motion coefficients are large?","速度取决于时间单位":"Velocity depends on time units","复制 速度取决于时间单位 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Velocity depends on time units","速度取决于时间单位，较长公式可横向滚动":"Velocity depends on time units; scroll horizontally for long equations","m₁ 是相对模型时间的系数；只有空间单位与 D 都明确后，才能解释为米/秒。改变归一化规则时，多项式系数也必须对应变换。":"m₁ is a coefficient with respect to model time. Interpreting it as meters per second requires known spatial units and D. Changing the time normalization also requires transforming polynomial coefficients.","F 链式法则":"F Chain rule","停下来想一想：D 加倍、模型不变，同一归一化时刻的物理速度怎样变？":"Pause and think: If D doubles with the model unchanged, what happens to physical velocity at the same normalized time?","四元数的一阶时间模型":"A first-order quaternion time model","复制 四元数的一阶时间模型 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A first-order quaternion time model","四元数的一阶时间模型，较长公式可横向滚动":"A first-order quaternion time model; scroll horizontally for long equations","q₀ 与 ω 均为四维系数，且需 u(t)≠0。这里 ω 不是刚体公式中的三维角速度；该模型也不是一般意义上的 SLERP。":"q₀ and ω are both four-component coefficients, and u(t) must be nonzero. This ω is not the three-dimensional angular velocity of rigid-body equations; the model is not generally SLERP.","停下来想一想：ω=0 时旋转会随时间变化吗？":"Pause and think: Does rotation change over time if ω=0?","归一化的 Jacobian":"The Jacobian of normalization","复制 归一化的 Jacobian 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: The Jacobian of normalization","归一化的 Jacobian，较长公式可横向滚动":"The Jacobian of normalization; scroll horizontally for long equations","归一化会去掉沿 q 自身方向的变化分量；分母接近零时梯度不稳定。不要跳过零范数与有限值检查。":"Normalization removes changes along q itself. Gradients become unstable near a zero denominator. Keep zero-norm and finite-value checks.","停下来想一想：只把 u 整体乘一个略大的正数，q 会变吗？":"Pause and think: Does q change if all of u is multiplied by a slightly larger positive number?","动一下，观察公式":"Move the controls, inspect the equation","同一条轨迹，不同的时间权重":"One trajectory, different temporal weights","这是二维示意：标记沿三次轨迹移动，亮度随时间核变化；不是完整的训练或 rasterizer。":"A 2D illustration: the marker follows a cubic trajectory while its brightness follows the temporal kernel. This is not a complete trainer or rasterizer.","时间 t":"Time t","宽度 ρ":"Width ρ","时间权重 w(t) =":"Temporal weight w(t) =","三次运动轨迹与时间权重示意":"Cubic trajectory and temporal weight illustration","官方 Lite 参数与激活 ↗":"Official Lite parameters & activation ↗","“加上时间”，还有不同的数学方式。":"More than one mathematical way to add time.","理解差异":"COMPARE","下面两种表示用于比较；当前 STG-Lite viewer 没有实现这两套 decoder。":"The next two representations are included for comparison. The current STG-Lite viewer implements neither decoder.","形变网络：由规范空间预测动态参数":"Deformation networks: predict dynamic parameters from canonical space","参数形变的概念接口":"A conceptual parameter-deformation interface","复制 参数形变的概念接口 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A conceptual parameter-deformation interface","参数形变的概念接口，较长公式可横向滚动":"A conceptual parameter-deformation interface; scroll horizontally for long equations","这是方法族的接口表示。Wu et al. 使用时空特征编码与 deformation decoder；平移、尺度、旋转各 head 的增量域和激活规则必须按实现核对。":"This is an interface for a family of methods. Wu et al. use space–time feature encoding and a deformation decoder. Check each translation, scale, and rotation head’s residual domain and activation against its implementation.","停下来想一想：log-scale 加 0.1 对真实尺度是加 0.1 吗？":"Pause and think: Does adding 0.1 to log-scale add 0.1 to physical scale?","原生 4D Gaussian：联合分布 → 固定时刻的 3D 切片":"Native 4D Gaussian: joint distribution → 3D slice at a fixed time","四维联合协方差的分块":"Block structure of a joint 4D covariance","复制 四维联合协方差的分块 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Block structure of a joint 4D covariance","四维联合协方差的分块，较长公式可横向滚动":"Block structure of a joint 4D covariance; scroll horizontally for long equations","z=[xᵀ,t]ᵀ；均值 μ₄=[μxᵀ,μt]ᵀ。A 为 3×3 空间块，b 为 3×1 时空交叉项，c>0 为时间方差。四维旋转不等于一个三维四元数。":"z=[xᵀ,t]ᵀ and μ₄=[μxᵀ,μt]ᵀ. A is the 3×3 spatial block, b the 3×1 space–time cross term, and c>0 the temporal variance. A 4D rotation is not a single 3D quaternion.","停下来想一想：b=0 表示什么？":"Pause and think: What does b=0 mean?","条件 Gaussian：均值与 Schur 补":"Conditional Gaussian: mean and Schur complement","复制 条件 Gaussian：均值与 Schur 补 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Conditional Gaussian: mean and Schur complement","条件 Gaussian：均值与 Schur 补，较长公式可横向滚动":"Conditional Gaussian: mean and Schur complement; scroll horizontally for long equations","第一式让空间中心随时间线性移动；第二式是条件协方差，不是直接拿 A。对单个固定的联合 Gaussian，条件协方差不随 t 变化。":"The first equation makes the spatial center move linearly with time. The second gives conditional covariance, which is not simply A. For one fixed joint Gaussian, this conditional covariance is independent of t.","停下来想一想：单个固定 4D Gaussian 的条件协方差会随 t 改变吗？":"Pause and think: Does the conditional covariance of one fixed 4D Gaussian vary with t?","空间条件核 × 时间边缘核":"Conditional spatial kernel × marginal temporal kernel","复制 空间条件核 × 时间边缘核 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Conditional spatial kernel × marginal temporal kernel","空间条件核 × 时间边缘核，较长公式可横向滚动":"Conditional spatial kernel × marginal temporal kernel; scroll horizontally for long equations","对二次型配方即可得到。这里均指未归一化核；时间边缘项必须保留，决定该 primitive 在该时刻的权重。条件化后再走三维投影与合成。":"Complete the square in the quadratic form. These are unnormalized kernels. Keep the temporal marginal factor: it determines the primitive’s weight at that time. After conditioning, apply the usual 3D projection and composition.","停下来想一想：这条时间核与 STG-Lite 的 ρ 怎样对应？":"Pause and think: How does this temporal kernel correspond to STG-Lite width ρ?","一个可手算的条件化例子":"A conditioning example you can calculate by hand","复制 一个可手算的条件化例子 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A conditioning example you can calculate by hand","一个可手算的条件化例子，较长公式可横向滚动":"A conditioning example you can calculate by hand; scroll horizontally for long equations","设 μ₄=0，条件中心是 (t,0,0)，时间权重是 exp(−t²/2)。时空相关性 b 编码了这个简单运动。":"With μ₄=0, the conditional center is (t,0,0) and the temporal weight is exp(−t²/2). The cross-covariance b encodes this simple motion.","停下来想一想：若误用 A 当条件协方差，哪个轴会过宽？":"Pause and think: Which axis becomes too wide if you incorrectly use A as conditional covariance?","三种时间模型的区别":"Distinguish the three time models","STG 的三次中心轨迹和旋转变化，不等于对单个四维 Gaussian 条件化得到的线性中心与恒定条件协方差。形变网络则额外依赖其特征场和网络权重。":"STG’s cubic center trajectory and changing rotation differ from the linear center and constant conditional covariance obtained by conditioning a single 4D Gaussian. A deformation network additionally depends on its feature field and network weights.","Native 4DGS · 公式证明 ↗":"Native 4DGS · Equation proofs ↗","几何决定覆盖，外观决定颜色。":"Geometry determines coverage. Appearance determines color.","理解":"UNDERSTAND","不同 Gaussian 方法存储的颜色信息不同。相同字段名不一定有相同激活方式。":"Gaussian methods store different appearance information. Identical field names do not guarantee identical activation rules.","静态 3DGS 常用的方向外观":"Directional appearance commonly used in static 3DGS","复制 静态 3DGS 常用的方向外观 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Directional appearance commonly used in static 3DGS","静态 3DGS 常用的方向外观，较长公式可横向滚动":"Directional appearance commonly used in static 3DGS; scroll horizontally for long equations","Yℓm 为球谐基，a 为 RGB 系数；v 必须是按实现约定的单位观察方向。不要把这条外观函数理解成可重光照的材质。":"Yℓm are spherical-harmonic basis functions; a are RGB coefficients. v must be a unit viewing direction matching the implementation’s convention. This appearance function is not a relightable material.","7 步 · 数字算例 · 源码 · 自测":"7 steps · Worked example · Code · Check","停下来想一想：最高阶 L=3 一共需要多少个 RGB 系数？":"Pause and think: How many RGB coefficient vectors are needed through order L=3?","先合成特征，再解码":"Composite features first, then decode","复制 先合成特征，再解码 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Composite features first, then decode","先合成特征，再解码，较长公式可横向滚动":"Composite features first, then decode; scroll horizontally for long equations","这是 STG 完整版特征渲染的概念式；特征组成与 decoder 输入要跟源码核对。当前 Lite 使用直接 RGB，没有在运行时调用这个 MLP。":"A conceptual equation for feature rendering in full STG. Check feature composition and decoder inputs against the code. The current Lite renderer uses direct RGB and does not run this MLP.","停下来想一想：只有线性 decoder 就能随意交换合成和解码吗？":"Pause and think: Can composition and decoding always be swapped if the decoder is linear?","本项目的字段约定":"This project’s field convention","STG-Lite 的 f_dc_0..2 被直接作为 RGB 使用，当前 shader 再 clamp 到 0–1；不要套用静态 3DGS 的 SH DC 系数转换。颜色传递函数、HDR 和曝光也需要独立约定。":"STG-Lite uses f_dc_0..2 directly as RGB, then the shader clamps to 0–1. Do not apply static 3DGS’s SH DC conversion. Color transfer functions, HDR, and exposure require separate conventions.","渲染是前向过程，训练把误差传回来。":"Rendering goes forward. Training sends error back.","先固定点集合、排序与可见性分支，理解局部梯度。完整训练还包含分段裁剪、离散的密度控制与具体实现的梯度路径。":"Start with fixed primitives, ordering, and visibility branches to understand local gradients. Complete training also involves piecewise clipping, discrete density control, and implementation-specific gradient paths.","常见的 photometric 目标":"A common photometric objective","复制 常见的 photometric 目标 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: A common photometric objective","常见的 photometric 目标，较长公式可横向滚动":"A common photometric objective; scroll horizontally for long equations","M 为参与 L1 平均的像素通道数；R 为方法特定的正则，可能为零。这是常见目标结构，不是所有 4DGS 共享的一套固定 loss。训练相机、时间采样与 mask 必须记录。":"M counts pixel channels averaged in L1. R is method-specific regularization and may be zero. This is a common objective structure, not one fixed loss shared by every 4DGS method. Record training cameras, time sampling, and masks.","6 步 · 数字算例 · 源码 · 自测":"6 steps · Worked example · Code · Check","停下来想一想：为什么 backward 后画面可能完全没变？":"Pause and think: Why might the image remain unchanged after backward?","Gaussian 核对投影均值的梯度":"Gaussian-kernel gradient with respect to the projected mean","复制 Gaussian 核对投影均值的梯度 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Gaussian-kernel gradient with respect to the projected mean","Gaussian 核对投影均值的梯度，较长公式可横向滚动":"Gaussian-kernel gradient with respect to the projected mean; scroll horizontally for long equations","推导：d=p−μ，∂(−½dᵀQd)/∂μ=Qd，再乘指数本身。这里固定协方差，忽略 clamp/cutoff。":"Derivation: d=p−μ, so ∂(−½dᵀQd)/∂μ=Qd; then multiply by the exponential itself. Covariance is fixed here, and clamp/cutoff are ignored.","停下来想一想：像素恰好在中心，均值偏导是多少？":"Pause and think: What is the mean derivative exactly at the center?","对屏幕协方差的梯度":"Gradient with respect to screen covariance","复制 对屏幕协方差的梯度 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Gradient with respect to screen covariance","对屏幕协方差的梯度，较长公式可横向滚动":"Gradient with respect to screen covariance; scroll horizontally for long equations","利用 d(C⁻¹)=−C⁻¹(dC)C⁻¹。这里固定投影中心且 C 对称；若只存独立的 (a,b,c)，交叉项 b 的导数要合并两个对称元素的贡献。":"Use d(C⁻¹)=−C⁻¹(dC)C⁻¹. The projected center is fixed and C is symmetric. When storing only independent (a,b,c), combine both symmetric entries’ contributions to the b derivative.","停下来想一想：像素位于中心时，只变宽度会改变未归一化核的峰值吗？":"Pause and think: At the center, does changing width change the peak of this unnormalized kernel?","对 opacity logit 的梯度":"Gradient with respect to the opacity logit","复制 对 opacity logit 的梯度 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Gradient with respect to the opacity logit","对 opacity logit 的梯度，较长公式可横向滚动":"Gradient with respect to the opacity logit; scroll horizontally for long equations","停下来想一想：为什么 β 非常大时难以继续训练 opacity？":"Pause and think: Why is opacity hard to train when β is very large?","位置梯度不只有投影均值这一条路":"Position gradients have more than the projected-mean path","复制 位置梯度不只有投影均值这一条路 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Position gradients have more than the projected-mean path","位置梯度不只有投影均值这一条路，较长公式可横向滚动":"Position gradients have more than the projected-mean path; scroll horizontally for long equations","本式固定外观与 opacity，只展开投影均值和协方差两条路径。J 随三维位置变化，C=JΣcJᵀ 也随位置变化；只乘 Jᵀ 会漏掉后者。SH/decoder 若使用位置相关的观察方向，还需补外观路径。转回世界坐标的梯度要乘对应旋转的转置。":"This equation fixes appearance and opacity and expands the mean and covariance paths. J depends on 3D position, so C=JΣcJᵀ does too; multiplying only by Jᵀ misses that path. Position-dependent viewing directions in SH or decoders add appearance paths. Returning gradients to world coordinates requires the corresponding rotation transpose.","停下来想一想：在哪段代码最容易漏掉第二条路径？":"Pause and think: Where is the second path most easily lost in code?","合成对 alpha 与颜色的梯度":"Composition gradients for alpha and color","复制 合成对 alpha 与颜色的梯度 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Composition gradients for alpha and color","合成对 alpha 与颜色的梯度，较长公式可横向滚动":"Composition gradients for alpha and color; scroll horizontally for long equations","Bᵢ 是从第 i 层后面开始、按自身透射率合成的尾部颜色，包含背景。增加前景 alpha 会增加本层贡献，同时遮住后面颜色。此式假定排序固定。":"Bᵢ is the tail after layer i, composited with its own transmittance and including the background. Increasing foreground alpha adds this layer’s contribution while hiding later colors. Ordering is assumed fixed.","停下来想一想：前景颜色和后方合成颜色完全一样时，alpha 的颜色梯度是多少？":"Pause and think: What is the alpha color derivative when foreground color equals the composited tail?","时间核与运动系数的导数":"Derivatives of the temporal kernel and motion coefficients","复制 时间核与运动系数的导数 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Derivatives of the temporal kernel and motion coefficients","时间核与运动系数的导数，较长公式可横向滚动":"Derivatives of the temporal kernel and motion coefficients; scroll horizontally for long equations","这些是数学函数的局部导数。官方 STG 训练在部分时间路径上使用 detach；“纸面上可导”不等于实现对所有变量都传播该梯度。":"These are local mathematical derivatives. Official STG training uses detach on some time paths. Being differentiable on paper does not mean the implementation propagates that gradient to every variable.","停下来想一想：Δt=0 时，一次 motion 参数从这一时刻的图像得到什么位置梯度？":"Pause and think: At Δt=0, what position gradient does this frame supply to the linear motion parameter?","用有限差分检验一个梯度":"Check a gradient with finite differences","复制 用有限差分检验一个梯度 的 LaTeX":"Copy LaTeX: Check a gradient with finite differences","用有限差分检验一个梯度，较长公式可横向滚动":"Check a gradient with finite differences; scroll horizontally for long equations","选 float64 的小例子，避开深度交换、near plane、cutoff 和 clamp 边界；比较多个 h 的误差趋势。单一 h 恰好接近不能证明整个 backward 正确。":"Use a small float64 example away from depth swaps, the near plane, cutoffs, and clamp boundaries. Compare error trends across several h values. Agreement at one h does not prove an entire backward pass correct.","停下来想一想：analytic=0、finite difference≈0 时只算相对误差有什么问题？":"Pause and think: Why is relative error alone misleading when both gradients are near zero?","梯度不会自动增加 Gaussian":"Gradients do not automatically add Gaussians","Clone、split、prune 会改变参数集合，是额外的离散密度控制；需要同时管理优化器状态。它不等同于固定维度上的一次 Adam 更新。":"Clone, split, and prune change the parameter set. They are additional discrete density-control operations and require optimizer-state management. They differ from one Adam update in a fixed-dimensional space.","CMU · 可微 GS 编程练习 ↗":"CMU · Differentiable GS programming exercise ↗","会解释，也要能检查。":"Explain it. Then check it.","实践":"PRACTICE","建议先完成六个小练习，再沿同一顺序走读 renderer。":"Complete these six small exercises, then read the renderer in the same order.","投影。":"Projection.","从 u=fx·x/z+cx 推出 J 的第一行，说出单位。":"Derive the first row of J from u=fx·x/z+cx and state its units.","协方差。":"Covariance.","从期望定义证明 Cov(AX+b)=AΣAᵀ，解释为什么透视需要近似。":"Prove Cov(AX+b)=AΣAᵀ from expectation and explain why perspective needs an approximation.","混合。":"Blending.","手算红蓝两层各 0.5 alpha，解释前后顺序的差别。":"Calculate red and blue layers with alpha 0.5 by hand and explain why order matters.","时间。":"Time.","把归一化轨迹改成秒，检查速度系数与时间核宽度。":"Convert a normalized trajectory to seconds; check velocity coefficients and temporal width.","条件化。":"Conditioning.","完成第 6 节的 Schur 补例子，说清它与 STG 三次轨迹的差异。":"Complete the Schur-complement example in section 6 and explain how it differs from STG’s cubic trajectory.","梯度。":"Gradients.","固定排序，对 μ、C 或 opacity 做一次 finite difference。":"Hold sorting fixed and run a finite-difference check on μ, C, or opacity.","阶段":"Stage","当前仓库位置":"Location in this repository","核对什么":"What to check","参数读入":"Parameter loading","字段、log-scale、logit、wxyz":"Fields, log-scale, logit, wxyz","时间求值":"Time evaluation","CPU 与 GPU 的同一运动和时间核":"Matching motion and temporal kernels on CPU and GPU","投影椭圆":"Projected ellipse","齐次导数、轴外积、像素单位":"Homogeneous derivatives, axis outer products, pixel units","像素合成":"Pixel composition","指数、cutoff、预乘、排序":"Exponent, cutoff, premultiplication, ordering","原生宿主":"Native host","矩阵、viewport、时间契约":"Matrix, viewport, and time contracts","教学训练":"Teaching trainer","前向、loss、backward、导出":"Forward, loss, backward, export","先分清三种差异":"Distinguish three kinds of mismatch","画面不对时先检查坐标、时间和颜色契约，再检查浮点与算法近似。公式正确也可能因转置、单位、排序或字段激活错误而得到错误图像。":"If the image looks wrong, check coordinate, time, and color contracts first, then floating-point behavior and algorithmic approximations. Correct formulas can still produce wrong images through transposes, units, ordering, or field activations.","项目源码 ↗":"Project source ↗","完整 Field Guide ↗":"Complete Field Guide ↗","从文件里的 32 个数，走到一次参数更新。":"From 32 stored numbers to one parameter update.","这是可运行的双精度 CPU 教学算例。两颗 STG-Lite Gaussian、一个像素、已知相机、固定 RGB 目标。每次改动都会重新求时间、椭圆、覆盖、合成与梯度；它不是浏览器里的完整 GPU renderer。屏幕坐标向右、向下，深度向前。":"A runnable double-precision CPU teaching example: two STG-Lite Gaussians, one pixel, a known camera, and a fixed RGB target. Each change recomputes time, ellipses, coverage, composition, and gradients. This is not the browser’s full GPU renderer. Screen axes point right and down; depth points forward.","模型时间 t":"Model time t","像素横坐标 u":"Pixel horizontal coordinate u","对 A 的哪个参数求导？":"Differentiate which parameter of A?","基准位置 μ₀x":"Base position μ₀x","基准深度 μ₀z":"Base depth μ₀z","相机 fx=fy=100，主点 (64,48)，画幅 128×96；像素纵坐标固定 68.5。世界到相机旋转为 I、平移为 0。背景 (0.04,0.05,0.08)，目标 (0.45,0.18,0.22)。更改时间和像素时目标保持固定，方便观察梯度；这不是一套多帧训练标签。":"Camera fx=fy=100, principal point (64,48), image 128×96; pixel y is fixed at 68.5. World-to-camera rotation is I and translation is zero. Background is (0.04,0.05,0.08); target is (0.45,0.18,0.22). The target stays fixed when time or pixel changes so you can inspect gradients; these are not multi-frame training labels.","预测像素":"Predicted pixel","目标像素":"Target pixel","对 3 个通道取平均":"Average over 3 channels","正在计算初始例子…":"Computing the initial example…","做一次 SGD 更新 · η=0.5":"Take one SGD step · η=0.5","恢复初始算例":"Reset example","下载当前 2 点 PLY":"Download current 2-point PLY","下载会把当前参数写成":"The download writes current parameters as","、32×float32 的真实 STG-Lite 记录；计算过程用 float64，导出时会有 float32 舍入。PLY 不含相机和时间单位，使用原生渲染器时仍需提供上面的相机约定。":", 32×float32 STG-Lite records. Calculations use float64, so export introduces float32 rounding. PLY contains neither camera data nor time units; the native renderer still needs the camera conventions above.","跟着一条数据记录检查内存布局与张量形状":"Follow one record through memory layout and tensor shapes","浮点索引 / 字节":"Float index / bytes","PLY 字段":"PLY field","数学量":"Mathematical quantity","τ 时刻的 μ₀":"μ₀ at time τ","此模型布局占位，渲染不使用":"Layout padding for this model; unused in rendering","m₁,m₂,m₃，各 3 个数":"m₁,m₂,m₃, three numbers each","r2,r3,r4.x 跨行重组":"Reassembled across r2,r3,r4.x","已激活的直接 RGB":"Activated direct RGB","β，未激活 logit":"β, unactivated logit","四维系数 ω":"Four-component coefficient ω","一个记录 128 字节，恰好对应 8 个 vec4。CPU 只读取排序需要的中心、运动和 opacity；GPU storage buffer 保留整条记录，instance index 决定当前画哪条。":"A record is 128 bytes, exactly eight vec4 values. The CPU reads only center, motion, and opacity needed for ordering. The GPU storage buffer retains the full record, and the instance index selects which record to draw.","教学 PyTorch：B=相机/时间组合数，N=Gaussian 数。xyz: [B,N,3]；uv: [B,N,2]；J: [B,N,2,3]；C: [B,N,2,2]；delta: [B,N,H,W,2]；alpha/T: [B,N,H,W]；color: [B,N,3]；输出图像: [B,H,W,3]。None 增加可广播维度，sum(1) 沿 Gaussian 维合成。":"Teaching PyTorch shapes: B=camera/time combinations, N=Gaussians. xyz: [B,N,3]; uv: [B,N,2]; J: [B,N,2,3]; C: [B,N,2,2]; delta: [B,N,H,W,2]; alpha/T: [B,N,H,W]; color: [B,N,3]; output: [B,H,W,3]. None inserts a broadcast dimension; sum(1) composites along the Gaussian dimension.","从教学算例继续到真正的训练 → 导出 → Rust/wgpu":"Continue from this example to training → export → Rust/wgpu","用":"Run","跑合成多相机训练；无 CUDA 时使用":"for synthetic multi-camera training; without CUDA use","。需要 torch 与 numpy。它学习 mean、linear motion、RGB logits、opacity logits，固定尺度、旋转和时间核。":". Requires torch and numpy. It learns means, linear motion, RGB logits, and opacity logits while holding scale, rotation, and the temporal kernel fixed.","把 RGB 误差经合成、Gaussian、相机和时间路径传给这四组参数。输出在":"propagates RGB error through composition, Gaussian, camera, and time paths to those four parameter groups. Outputs are saved in","，其中 PLY 的 RGB 已 sigmoid，opacity 仍为 logit。":", where PLY RGB is already sigmoid-activated and opacity remains a logit.","原生宿主读取 PLY，调用":"The native host reads PLY and calls","提供 V、P、viewport 和归一化 t；CPU 求值后从远到近排序，把索引传给 GPU。":"with V, P, viewport, and normalized t. The CPU evaluates and sorts far to near, then passes indices to the GPU.","每实例画 6 个顶点组成的 quad；vertex 算当前椭圆；fragment 求权重；固定混合单元做预乘 over。当前引擎没有反向传播 kernel，训练在 PyTorch 侧完成。":"Each instance draws a six-vertex quad. The vertex shader computes the current ellipse, the fragment shader evaluates weights, and fixed-function blending applies premultiplied over. The current engine has no backward kernel; training runs in PyTorch.","把真实拍摄数据接进来，还需相机标定/位姿、统一时间、初始化、训练采样、密度控制与评估。这个五点合成训练器没有包含这些步骤；完整路线见":"Real captured data also needs camera calibration/poses, consistent time, initialization, training sampling, density control, and evaluation. This five-point synthetic trainer does not include those steps. See the full route in the","实际优化器 Adam 把梯度 g 的历史平均 m 和平方平均 v 结合，使用每个参数自己的步长。它是优化算法的设计选择，不是 Gaussian 渲染公式的必然结论；本页按钮用 SGD 以便每个数字都能手算。":"The actual Adam optimizer combines the gradient’s historical mean m and squared mean v, adapting the step per parameter. This is an optimization design choice, not a necessary consequence of Gaussian rendering. The page uses SGD so each number can be checked by hand.","平方、开方、除法逐参数进行。若梯度恒为 g、m₀=0，展开递推是 (1−β₁)(1+β₁+…+β₁^(k−1))g=(1−β₁^k)g，所以除以 1−β₁^k 消掉从零开始的偏差；v 同理。这里 β₁、β₂ 是 Adam 的衰减系数，与 opacity logit β 无关。":"Squares, square roots, and divisions act per parameter. For constant gradient g and m₀=0, expanding the recurrence gives (1−β₁)(1+β₁+…+β₁^(k−1))g=(1−β₁^k)g. Dividing by 1−β₁^k removes the zero-initialization bias; the same reasoning applies to v. Adam’s β₁ and β₂ are decay coefficients, unrelated to opacity logit β.","下载并独立运行：":"Download and run independently:","像素前向与解析梯度":"Pixel forward pass & analytic gradients","其他方法的教学函数":"Teaching functions for other methods","完整 toy trainer":"Complete toy trainer","源码指纹":"Source fingerprints","与论文、与源码一起读。":"Read alongside the papers and code.","推导采用统一符号；模型选择、数学恒等式和实现近似分别标明。其他方法的教学函数与当前 STG-Lite 渲染器明确区分。":"The derivations use consistent notation and distinguish modeling choices, mathematical identities, and implementation approximations. Teaching functions for other methods are separate from the current STG-Lite renderer.","STG 官方实现与 Lite 分支 ↗":"Official STG implementation & Lite branch ↗","COLMAP 相机与文件约定 ↗":"COLMAP camera & file conventions ↗","3DV 2024 · 3DGS 作者教程 ↗":"3DV 2024 · Tutorial by the 3DGS authors ↗","MathML Core · 本页公式排版标准 ↗":"MathML Core · Equation typesetting standard ↗","NIST DLMF · 球谐定义与正交性 ↗":"NIST DLMF · Spherical harmonics & orthogonality ↗","NIST DLMF · Legendre 多项式 ↗":"NIST DLMF · Legendre polynomials ↗","3DGS 官方 SH 符号与系数顺序 ↗":"Official 3DGS SH signs & coefficient order ↗","KaTeX · 构建时排版 ↗":"KaTeX · Build-time typesetting ↗","主公式使用 MathML；逐步推导在构建时排版为 KaTeX HTML + 可访问 MathML。字体和样式均由本站提供，无外部 CDN。源码快照的 SHA-256 可在":"Core equations use MathML. Step-by-step derivations are typeset at build time as KaTeX HTML with accessible MathML. Fonts and styles are hosted here without an external CDN. Verify source-snapshot SHA-256 hashes in the ","指纹清单":"fingerprint manifest","核对。":".","回到顶部 ↑":"Back to top ↑","public/learn/models.mjs · 数学源码":"public/learn/models.mjs · Math source","public/math/reference.mjs · 数学源码":"public/math/reference.mjs · Math source","public/math/sh.mjs · 数学源码":"public/math/sh.mjs · Math source","public/math/trace.mjs · 数学源码":"public/math/trace.mjs · Math source","public/math/training.mjs · 数学源码":"public/math/training.mjs · Math source","scripts/check-math.mjs · 数学源码":"scripts/check-math.mjs · Math source","scripts/train_toy_stg.py · 数学源码":"scripts/train_toy_stg.py · Math source","src/lib.rs · 数学源码":"src/lib.rs · Math source","src/splat.wgsl · 数学源码":"src/splat.wgsl · Math source","src/stg_pass.rs · 数学源码":"src/stg_pass.rs · Math source"};
